(53817, 1175, 889, '<td valign="top">the shaddows are nice and crips from adjacent flowers. the only detraction is the out of focus petals in the lower right corner.</td>', 'the shaddows are nice and crips from adjacent flowers. the only detraction is the out of focus petals in the lower right corner.', '2002-04-29 02:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53818, 1175, 801, '<td valign="top">very well!! perphaps with more down levels?</td>', 'very well!! perphaps with more down levels?', '2002-04-29 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53819, 1175, 1024, '<td valign="top">I love this photo .... its so light and airy<br/><br/>Addition to previous comment:  I keep coming back to this picture.  As much as I liked it when I first saw it, I like it more and more every time I look at it.  Wonderful picture!!</td>', 'I love this photo .... its so light and airyAddition to previous comment:  I keep coming back to this picture.  As much as I liked it when I first saw it, I like it more and more every time I look at it.  Wonderful picture!!', '2002-04-29 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53820, 1175, 656, '<td valign="top">clean, good composition and well balanced colours.  Like the whispy, out of focus clouds.  Would make a good desktop</td>', 'clean, good composition and well balanced colours.  Like the whispy, out of focus clouds.  Would make a good desktop', '2002-04-29 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53821, 1175, 142, '<td valign="top">Beautiful photo!  The color of the flowers and the softness of the clouds make this a winner in my opinion!</td>', 'Beautiful photo!  The color of the flowers and the softness of the clouds make this a winner in my opinion!', '2002-04-29 10:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53822, 1175, 259, '<td valign="top">best pic i have seen yet, and finally one that is from the ground up.</td>', 'best pic i have seen yet, and finally one that is from the ground up.', '2002-04-29 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53823, 1175, 189, '<td valign="top">Splendid.</td>', 'Splendid.', '2002-04-29 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53824, 1175, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great! The lighting and colours are vibrant, the puffy clouds set off the flowers perfectly. The semi-transparent, overlapping petals are very pretty. I think the only problem is that it''s a little bit too contrasty and sharp, which gives it an edge that detracts from the gentle nature of the subject matter and makes me feel like I need sunglasses...</td>', 'Great! The lighting and colours are vibrant, the puffy clouds set off the flowers perfectly. The semi-transparent, overlapping petals are very pretty. I think the only problem is that it''s a little bit too contrasty and sharp, which gives it an edge that detracts from the gentle nature of the subject matter and makes me feel like I need sunglasses...', '2002-04-29 11:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53825, 1175, 640, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors</td>', 'Beautiful colors', '2002-04-29 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53826, 1175, 681, '<td valign="top">very pretty</td>', 'very pretty', '2002-04-29 12:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53827, 1175, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very lovely.  But "ground up"?</td>', 'Very lovely.  But "ground up"?', '2002-04-29 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53828, 1175, 1336, '<td valign="top">beautiful.</td>', 'beautiful.', '2002-04-29 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53829, 1175, 1078, '<td valign="top">Really like the soft focus for the background -- compliments the flowers nicely</td>', 'Really like the soft focus for the background -- compliments the flowers nicely', '2002-04-29 16:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53830, 1175, 962, '<td valign="top">Great color.</td>', 'Great color.', '2002-04-29 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53831, 1175, 675, '<td valign="top">now here is another great shot...who cares if it''s flowers, awesome job</td>', 'now here is another great shot...who cares if it''s flowers, awesome job', '2002-04-29 18:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53832, 1175, 772, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo!  I like it!!</td>', 'Excellent photo!  I like it!!', '2002-04-29 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53833, 1175, 933, '<td valign="top">Great lighting, composition and colors.  Looks almost like a painting.  Very nice work.</td>', 'Great lighting, composition and colors.  Looks almost like a painting.  Very nice work.', '2002-04-29 23:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53834, 1175, 1283, '<td valign="top">This is a calendar shot..I love the blue on blue......</td>', 'This is a calendar shot..I love the blue on blue......', '2002-04-30 03:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53835, 1175, 885, '<td valign="top">Quite nice how the cloud there mirrors the clumps of flowers.  Good composition around that, though I''m not sure about the out of focus one in the lower right corner.  The fact that that blue clashes with the sky blue bothers me a bit, so I''m not sure you should empasize it (though I realize those colors are completely beyond your control).</td>', 'Quite nice how the cloud there mirrors the clumps of flowers.  Good composition around that, though I''m not sure about the out of focus one in the lower right corner.  The fact that that blue clashes with the sky blue bothers me a bit, so I''m not sure you should empasize it (though I realize those colors are completely beyond your control).', '2002-04-30 12:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53836, 1175, 1042, '<td valign="top">beautiful</td>', 'beautiful', '2002-04-30 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53837, 1175, 1209, '<td valign="top">Very pleasant picture, and technically well done, I think.</td>', 'Very pleasant picture, and technically well done, I think.', '2002-04-30 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53838, 1175, 813, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! You obviously understand composition and the technical details so there''s really nothing more to say. Bravo.</td>', 'Gorgeous! You obviously understand composition and the technical details so there''s really nothing more to say. Bravo.', '2002-04-30 16:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53839, 1175, 1211, '<td valign="top">Absolutely love the colors in this one. My only complaint might be that the cloud in the lower left dulls the flowers a bit.  Overall, though, awesome picture.</td>', 'Absolutely love the colors in this one. My only complaint might be that the cloud in the lower left dulls the flowers a bit.  Overall, though, awesome picture.', '2002-04-30 17:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53840, 1175, 441, '<td valign="top">super sky and different shades of blue make this a very attractive shot</td>', 'super sky and different shades of blue make this a very attractive shot', '2002-04-30 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53841, 1175, 748, '<td valign="top">I like the softness fo the background.  A shame that the white cloud is so bright in the lower left, but still a great shot.</td>', 'I like the softness fo the background.  A shame that the white cloud is so bright in the lower left, but still a great shot.', '2002-05-01 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53842, 1175, 1041, '<td valign="top">Beautiful colors and clarity.  Is the camera actually on or near the ground?  This looks more like the top of a tree to me.  But I guess that could be due to cropping.</td>', 'Beautiful colors and clarity.  Is the camera actually on or near the ground?  This looks more like the top of a tree to me.  But I guess that could be due to cropping.', '2002-05-01 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53843, 1175, 310, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective - good interpretation of the challenge theme. Some of the petals are slightly blown out and the out of focus flower in the lower right distracts the eye.</td>', 'Nice perspective - good interpretation of the challenge theme. Some of the petals are slightly blown out and the out of focus flower in the lower right distracts the eye.', '2002-05-01 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53844, 1175, 1066, '<td valign="top">Very ethereal feeling shot.  Nice.</td>', 'Very ethereal feeling shot.  Nice.', '2002-05-01 17:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53845, 1175, 244, '<td valign="top">nice picture I almost submitted a similar one<br/></td>', 'nice picture I almost submitted a similar one', '2002-05-01 19:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53846, 1175, 790, '<td valign="top">nice colors, contrast</td>', 'nice colors, contrast', '2002-05-01 22:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53847, 1175, 782, '<td valign="top">Good sharp photo, I like it.</td>', 'Good sharp photo, I like it.', '2002-05-01 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53848, 1175, 715, '<td valign="top">Beautifull. I like the contrast in this picture and the way the sky looks. The unsharp flower in the right-bottom corner is a little distracting though.</td>', 'Beautifull. I like the contrast in this picture and the way the sky looks. The unsharp flower in the right-bottom corner is a little distracting though.', '2002-05-02 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53849, 1175, 1290, '<td valign="top">Love it - God''s creation and God''s heaven!</td>', 'Love it - God''s creation and God''s heaven!', '2002-05-02 19:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53850, 1175, 1, '<td valign="top">The colors in this shot are great.  They all blend very well together.  I wish the flowers filled more of the frame at the top though.</td>', 'The colors in this shot are great.  They all blend very well together.  I wish the flowers filled more of the frame at the top though.', '2002-05-03 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53851, 1175, 739, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful shot!! So soothing and calm.  Love the color of the flowers against the sky.</td>', 'What a beautiful shot!! So soothing and calm.  Love the color of the flowers against the sky.', '2002-05-03 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53852, 1175, 255, '<td valign="top">i love this!</td>', 'i love this!', '2002-05-03 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53853, 1175, 1457, '<td valign="top">more flowers...</td>', 'more flowers...', '2002-05-04 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53854, 1175, 554, '<td valign="top">the best of the flower shots. great blend of color</td>', 'the best of the flower shots. great blend of color', '2002-05-05 12:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53855, 1175, 1191, '<td valign="top">A little bit of under-exposure would have darkened the sky and made the flowers stand out a bit more.</td>', 'A little bit of under-exposure would have darkened the sky and made the flowers stand out a bit more.', '2002-05-05 17:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53856, 1175, 797, '<td valign="top">The clouds in the background look almost Van Gogh - ish.  Lovely choice of subject and colors.</td>', 'The clouds in the background look almost Van Gogh - ish.  Lovely choice of subject and colors.', '2002-05-06 00:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53857, 1176, 301, '<td valign="top">seems underexposed to me ... I''d prefer to see the sky blown out and the detail on  the flowers and leaves</td>', 'seems underexposed to me ... I''d prefer to see the sky blown out and the detail on  the flowers and leaves', '2002-04-29 07:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53858, 1176, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice use of backlight.</td>', 'Nice use of backlight.', '2002-04-29 08:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53859, 1176, 862, '<td valign="top">Fill flash would have been very helpful here.</td>', 'Fill flash would have been very helpful here.', '2002-04-29 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53860, 1176, 656, '<td valign="top">Needed to be exposed for the flowers, rather than the sky - ends up too dark to work well</td>', 'Needed to be exposed for the flowers, rather than the sky - ends up too dark to work well', '2002-04-29 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53861, 1176, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think the dimness of the lighting and colours detract from this photo and make it flat. The flowers are almost seen in silhouette, but tulips in profile aren''t all that interesting, especially set off against such a dim sky.</td>', 'I think the dimness of the lighting and colours detract from this photo and make it flat. The flowers are almost seen in silhouette, but tulips in profile aren''t all that interesting, especially set off against such a dim sky.', '2002-04-29 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53862, 1176, 259, '<td valign="top">a tad bit dark</td>', 'a tad bit dark', '2002-04-29 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53863, 1176, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo, but I think the sunlight is getting in teh way of the exposure.</td>', 'This is a nice photo, but I think the sunlight is getting in teh way of the exposure.', '2002-04-29 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53864, 1176, 885, '<td valign="top">A little bit underexposed, I think, the leaves and the flowers are very dark.  You might have overexposed the sky if you had a longer exposure though, but maybe from a different side of the plant or a different time of day they would have been less backlighted, and then easier to expose?</td>', 'A little bit underexposed, I think, the leaves and the flowers are very dark.  You might have overexposed the sky if you had a longer exposure though, but maybe from a different side of the plant or a different time of day they would have been less backlighted, and then easier to expose?', '2002-04-29 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53865, 1176, 544, '<td valign="top">Ah! This photo could have been really nice. Your framing is great, as is the angle. The lack of up-closeness with the flowers, the lighting of the ground, the coloring of the picture (seems washed out), and so forth are all detracting from the photo, though. I''d go back and try this photo again on a day where there are some clouds out or something to help you balance the color of the sky and also add some texture to it. I''d also try to get the flowers more in focus, and see if you can''t lighten the photo up a bit in order to get the lower-green parts to have some texture. I might even lower the angle a degree or two if you can capture some dirt from the ground. I think that could add to it. Certainly worth trying out :)</td>', 'Ah! This photo could have been really nice. Your framing is great, as is the angle. The lack of up-closeness with the flowers, the lighting of the ground, the coloring of the picture (seems washed out), and so forth are all detracting from the photo, though. I''d go back and try this photo again on a day where there are some clouds out or something to help you balance the color of the sky and also add some texture to it. I''d also try to get the flowers more in focus, and see if you can''t lighten the photo up a bit in order to get the lower-green parts to have some texture. I might even lower the angle a degree or two if you can capture some dirt from the ground. I think that could add to it. Certainly worth trying out :)', '2002-04-29 14:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53866, 1176, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think this would have been a great picture if the lighting and sharpness were better.</td>', 'i think this would have been a great picture if the lighting and sharpness were better.', '2002-04-29 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53867, 1176, 1379, '<td valign="top">So pretty.  So Dutch.  So springy.  So nice.</td>', 'So pretty.  So Dutch.  So springy.  So nice.', '2002-04-29 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53868, 1176, 962, '<td valign="top">Backlighting too strong...........can improve with fill-in flash.</td>', 'Backlighting too strong...........can improve with fill-in flash.', '2002-04-29 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53869, 1176, 675, '<td valign="top">just not the best flower shot...the lighting is off and the flowers seem grainy</td>', 'just not the best flower shot...the lighting is off and the flowers seem grainy', '2002-04-29 18:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53870, 1176, 843, '<td valign="top">Don''t know if you could have done it without overexposing the sky, but the flowers need to be brighter.</td>', 'Don''t know if you could have done it without overexposing the sky, but the flowers need to be brighter.', '2002-04-29 22:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53871, 1176, 724, '<td valign="top">I love these tulips!!  You might try adjusting the contrast and sharpening this image a bit. The photo feels a bit flat, for such a wonderful subject!</td>', 'I love these tulips!!  You might try adjusting the contrast and sharpening this image a bit. The photo feels a bit flat, for such a wonderful subject!', '2002-04-29 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53872, 1176, 640, '<td valign="top">Nice flowers and I like the angle. Color seems too dark.</td>', 'Nice flowers and I like the angle. Color seems too dark.', '2002-04-30 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53873, 1176, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the idea, and the composition of the pictures, unfortunately, the tulips are too dark against the light sky.  Have you tried taking this one with a flash?  Also, something distracting in the background to the left (behind the still closed tulip).  I know you couldn''t remove it for this challenge, but I would do that for final processing.</td>', 'I like the idea, and the composition of the pictures, unfortunately, the tulips are too dark against the light sky.  Have you tried taking this one with a flash?  Also, something distracting in the background to the left (behind the still closed tulip).  I know you couldn''t remove it for this challenge, but I would do that for final processing.', '2002-04-30 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53874, 1176, 1019, '<td valign="top">Beautiful</td>', 'Beautiful', '2002-04-30 12:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53875, 1176, 244, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, image looks too dark, also I wonder how you compressed it, looks really jagged/</td>', 'Nice idea, image looks too dark, also I wonder how you compressed it, looks really jagged/', '2002-05-01 16:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53876, 1176, 280, '<td valign="top">If you could get closer to the tulips, to get a higher angle looking up at the flowers.</td>', 'If you could get closer to the tulips, to get a higher angle looking up at the flowers.', '2002-05-01 17:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53877, 1176, 748, '<td valign="top">Think I would have used some fill flash to illuminate the beauty of the tulips, but a nice perspective.</td>', 'Think I would have used some fill flash to illuminate the beauty of the tulips, but a nice perspective.', '2002-05-02 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53878, 1176, 933, '<td valign="top">Too dark, too pixelated.  Next time try a fill in flash or back lighting to lighten the flowers.</td>', 'Too dark, too pixelated.  Next time try a fill in flash or back lighting to lighten the flowers.', '2002-05-03 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53879, 1176, 1202, '<td valign="top">Good angle for tis challenge, too bad it couldn''t have been a little lighter in the foreground.</td>', 'Good angle for tis challenge, too bad it couldn''t have been a little lighter in the foreground.', '2002-05-04 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53880, 1176, 1457, '<td valign="top">lame, i hate flowers</td>', 'lame, i hate flowers', '2002-05-04 22:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53881, 1176, 1, '<td valign="top">The image seems a bit over-shapened&amp;despckeled.  Or just grainy?</td>', 'The image seems a bit over-shapened&despckeled.  Or just grainy?', '2002-05-05 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53882, 1177, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice use of leading lines.</td>', 'Nice use of leading lines.', '2002-04-29 09:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53883, 1177, 656, '<td valign="top">more diagonal lines might have been less static ?</td>', 'more diagonal lines might have been less static ?', '2002-04-29 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53884, 1177, 675, '<td valign="top">damnation, why, why, why</td>', 'damnation, why, why, why', '2002-04-29 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53885, 1177, 772, '<td valign="top">Your title is great!  It''s nice that you could actually use ''wires'' as part of your subject in this photograph.  I really get discouraged sometimes when I find a nice photo opporutnity and can''t make it happen because of wires, poles, and signs.  Good shot!</td>', 'Your title is great!  It''s nice that you could actually use ''wires'' as part of your subject in this photograph.  I really get discouraged sometimes when I find a nice photo opporutnity and can''t make it happen because of wires, poles, and signs.  Good shot!', '2002-04-29 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53886, 1177, 259, '<td valign="top">it may be just me, but i dont like to look at wires</td>', 'it may be just me, but i dont like to look at wires', '2002-04-29 11:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53887, 1177, 714, '<td valign="top">Very interesting.  If we didn''t have all these wires and cables how would we be on here today.  Great picture.</td>', 'Very interesting.  If we didn''t have all these wires and cables how would we be on here today.  Great picture.', '2002-04-29 13:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53888, 1177, 1181, '<td valign="top">Interesting perspective. Nice shot.</td>', 'Interesting perspective. Nice shot.', '2002-04-29 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53889, 1177, 1336, '<td valign="top">ordinary.  the wires detract from the photo.  i think the pole itself would have been a better subject</td>', 'ordinary.  the wires detract from the photo.  i think the pole itself would have been a better subject', '2002-04-29 14:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53890, 1177, 962, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot. Can improve framing if you position the pole at the edge of the photo.</td>', 'Interesting shot. Can improve framing if you position the pole at the edge of the photo.', '2002-04-29 16:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53891, 1177, 1242, '<td valign="top">Good use of the power lines.</td>', 'Good use of the power lines.', '2002-04-29 16:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53892, 1177, 1034, '<td valign="top">neat.  i can totally imagine the clouds moving.  nice image.  :)</td>', 'neat.  i can totally imagine the clouds moving.  nice image.  :)', '2002-04-29 19:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53893, 1177, 885, '<td valign="top">This looks a little dark to me, but it may be my piece of poo monitor...but otherwise, there''s nothing wrong with it technically.  I think it''s a bit busy - too many lines going too many directions, and the focal point becomes the top of the telephone pole, but there isn''t really anything to look at there...  I don''t think that the white cloud on the left 3rd helps.</td>', 'This looks a little dark to me, but it may be my piece of poo monitor...but otherwise, there''s nothing wrong with it technically.  I think it''s a bit busy - too many lines going too many directions, and the focal point becomes the top of the telephone pole, but there isn''t really anything to look at there...  I don''t think that the white cloud on the left 3rd helps.', '2002-04-30 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53894, 1177, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice from the ground up shot.  Having the pole start in the corner of the picture rather than coming out of the side would''ve also been a nice angle to try.</td>', 'Nice from the ground up shot.  Having the pole start in the corner of the picture rather than coming out of the side would''ve also been a nice angle to try.', '2002-05-01 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53895, 1177, 280, '<td valign="top">Sorry but your subject lacks interest.</td>', 'Sorry but your subject lacks interest.', '2002-05-01 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53896, 1177, 446, '<td valign="top">I like it.  This photo takes something we might take for granted and shows a different way of looking at it.  Love the nice blue sky and clouds.  Wish the photo showed a little more depth of field to get more of the lower portion of the pole in focus.  Nice job nonetheless.</td>', 'I like it.  This photo takes something we might take for granted and shows a different way of looking at it.  Love the nice blue sky and clouds.  Wish the photo showed a little more depth of field to get more of the lower portion of the pole in focus.  Nice job nonetheless.', '2002-05-01 21:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53897, 1177, 933, '<td valign="top">The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.</td>', 'The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.', '2002-05-02 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53898, 1177, 1379, '<td valign="top">Nice interesting sky...</td>', 'Nice interesting sky...', '2002-05-03 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53899, 1177, 1457, '<td valign="top">didn''t see THAT coming!</td>', 'didn''t see THAT coming!', '2002-05-04 22:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53900, 1177, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely done to keep everything in focus.</td>', 'Nicely done to keep everything in focus.', '2002-05-05 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53901, 1178, 205, '<td valign="top">Translation?</td>', 'Translation?', '2002-04-29 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53902, 1178, 352, '<td valign="top">Simple yet clean, even at 38K!  Very impressive!</td>', 'Simple yet clean, even at 38K!  Very impressive!', '2002-04-29 02:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53903, 1178, 1024, '<td valign="top">I like this alot.</td>', 'I like this alot.', '2002-04-29 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
