(53944, 1184, 813, '<td valign="top">I like the composition in this shot but want more balance in the exposure. This would be a good candidate for exactly the kind of post exposure manipulation that''s not permitted in this contest. If you could have shot several different exposures (from over to under exposed) then blended them in layers to have beautiful detail in everything from the shadows to the sky it would be great.</td>', 'I like the composition in this shot but want more balance in the exposure. This would be a good candidate for exactly the kind of post exposure manipulation that''s not permitted in this contest. If you could have shot several different exposures (from over to under exposed) then blended them in layers to have beautiful detail in everything from the shadows to the sky it would be great.', '2002-04-30 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
