(53948, 1184, 1078, '<td valign="top">cool escalator/stairway will be curious to see where this was shot -- over all the picture seems a little flat -- probably because you were shooting in a relatively dark area but with that bright patch of sky and red rock at the top and so the camera had some metering problems  -- without some tweaks in photoshop I don''t know what to suggest to help fix this</td>', 'cool escalator/stairway will be curious to see where this was shot -- over all the picture seems a little flat -- probably because you were shooting in a relatively dark area but with that bright patch of sky and red rock at the top and so the camera had some metering problems  -- without some tweaks in photoshop I don''t know what to suggest to help fix this', '2002-05-01 14:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53949, 1184, 280, '<td valign="top">good leading lines, great perspective and a good slant on the ''ground up''.</td>', 'good leading lines, great perspective and a good slant on the ''ground up''.', '2002-05-01 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53950, 1184, 446, '<td valign="top">Extermely tough subject and lighting condition to control.  I admire your guts to try it.  The dynamic range required to expose for the bright sky, reflections off the chrome, and the shadows must have presented a real challenge for you.  A few to many blown highlights to be a winner I think.  Having said all of that, the composition is eyecatching, and easy to look at.  Nice effort.</td>', 'Extermely tough subject and lighting condition to control.  I admire your guts to try it.  The dynamic range required to expose for the bright sky, reflections off the chrome, and the shadows must have presented a real challenge for you.  A few to many blown highlights to be a winner I think.  Having said all of that, the composition is eyecatching, and easy to look at.  Nice effort.', '2002-05-01 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(53951, 1184, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice layout.  Really draws you in.  That light is a bit distracting, but there''s probably not much you can do about that. <br/></td>', 'Nice layout.  Really draws you in.  That light is a bit distracting, but there''s probably not much you can do about that. ', '2002-05-02 20:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
