(54153, 1198, 446, '<td valign="top">This is a great example of taking a very common object and illustrating its beauty.  I applaud your attention to detail in your composition.  Give us more of this good work.</td>', 'This is a great example of taking a very common object and illustrating its beauty.  I applaud your attention to detail in your composition.  Give us more of this good work.', '2002-04-30 22:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
