(54167, 1199, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s an interesting photo in terms of composition, especially with the way the foot is positioned and the expression on the man''s face makes it seem like he''s about to stomp, however there isn''t much about the subject matter, lighting, colours, etc. that make me want to look at it for very long.</td>', 'It''s an interesting photo in terms of composition, especially with the way the foot is positioned and the expression on the man''s face makes it seem like he''s about to stomp, however there isn''t much about the subject matter, lighting, colours, etc. that make me want to look at it for very long.', '2002-04-29 10:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54168, 1199, 544, '<td valign="top">Cute idea, and one I knew was bound to appear in this challenge. You did a great job of framing it, and also of capturing it. A friend of mine mentioned this as a difficult one to try when she attempted it herself. I can believe it. As for nits, I would have saved the picture-taking for a day when there was a better sky. If you had a better sky, then you did a poor job of capturing it. I would have liked to have seen the shoe more in focus than the rest of you and the tree, since that is the focal point of the picture, in my opinion. I also would have liked to have seen more lighting, so that you and your shoe aren''t so poorly lit. I have no idea how you would accomplish that one naturally, though! :) Nice picture all around, and one that definitely fits the theme of the challenge. nice and fun! :)</td>', 'Cute idea, and one I knew was bound to appear in this challenge. You did a great job of framing it, and also of capturing it. A friend of mine mentioned this as a difficult one to try when she attempted it herself. I can believe it. As for nits, I would have saved the picture-taking for a day when there was a better sky. If you had a better sky, then you did a poor job of capturing it. I would have liked to have seen the shoe more in focus than the rest of you and the tree, since that is the focal point of the picture, in my opinion. I also would have liked to have seen more lighting, so that you and your shoe aren''t so poorly lit. I have no idea how you would accomplish that one naturally, though! :) Nice picture all around, and one that definitely fits the theme of the challenge. nice and fun! :)', '2002-04-29 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54169, 1199, 772, '<td valign="top">:) this is cool...  Nice shot!</td>', ':) this is cool...  Nice shot!', '2002-04-29 14:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
