(54177, 1199, 1078, '<td valign="top">I would have scored this one higher if you''d taken it the extra step and had the model (you?) in costume as a giant *grin* -- the main subject is under exposed, a little bit of adjustment with levels should bring that out, I think -- like the overall composition</td>', 'I would have scored this one higher if you''d taken it the extra step and had the model (you?) in costume as a giant *grin* -- the main subject is under exposed, a little bit of adjustment with levels should bring that out, I think -- like the overall composition', '2002-05-01 13:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
