(54181, 1199, 543, '<td valign="top">I think you''re the guy I''d least like to be stepped on by.  {g}  You sure got the camera pointed upwards, alright, indeedy (sorry.  just frustrated that mine apparently is angle-challenged).  Spot metering or fill flash would have made for a better exposure on your face.</td>', 'I think you''re the guy I''d least like to be stepped on by.  {g}  You sure got the camera pointed upwards, alright, indeedy (sorry.  just frustrated that mine apparently is angle-challenged).  Spot metering or fill flash would have made for a better exposure on your face.', '2002-05-03 09:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
