(54185, 1200, 885, '<td valign="top">Well composed, the lighting really shows off the texture and rust of the fire hydrant.  Like the dark blue sky, did you use a polarizer?  Nitpicky comment: there is such a small amount of a tree/bush/something just to the left of the fire hydrant at the bottom of the frame, could it not have been cropped?</td>', 'Well composed, the lighting really shows off the texture and rust of the fire hydrant.  Like the dark blue sky, did you use a polarizer?  Nitpicky comment: there is such a small amount of a tree/bush/something just to the left of the fire hydrant at the bottom of the frame, could it not have been cropped?', '2002-04-29 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
