(54196, 1200, 1283, '<td valign="top">Great shot..and I really like the title..</td>', 'Great shot..and I really like the title..', '2002-04-30 04:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54197, 1200, 1175, '<td valign="top">That''s a great photo.  Love how the angle of the light makes the letters pop out more.</td>', 'That''s a great photo.  Love how the angle of the light makes the letters pop out more.', '2002-04-30 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54198, 1200, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, angel.</td>', 'Interesting colors, angel.', '2002-04-30 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54199, 1200, 772, '<td valign="top">Nice photo!  Very well done.  I would like to comment a little on the light pole.. this is an interesting optics problem that is hard to solve... i had similar problems shooting a lighthouse a while back... These tall pieces like to bend in the photo... Good shot!</td>', 'Nice photo!  Very well done.  I would like to comment a little on the light pole.. this is an interesting optics problem that is hard to solve... i had similar problems shooting a lighthouse a while back... These tall pieces like to bend in the photo... Good shot!', '2002-04-30 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54200, 1200, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice!</td>', 'Nice!', '2002-04-30 17:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54201, 1200, 888, '<td valign="top">ha ha</td>', 'ha ha', '2002-04-30 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54202, 1200, 387, '<td valign="top">I considered this shot too. (I got bored waiting for a dog to come along :)) Unlike most shots that have a pole of some type in them your belongs.  I like the imperfections of the finish of the fire hydrant.  Good contrast.</td>', 'I considered this shot too. (I got bored waiting for a dog to come along :)) Unlike most shots that have a pole of some type in them your belongs.  I like the imperfections of the finish of the fire hydrant.  Good contrast.', '2002-04-30 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54203, 1200, 1209, '<td valign="top">Not much happenin'' in your town, huh? Cute idea though, a real dog''s eye view from the ground up!</td>', 'Not much happenin'' in your town, huh? Cute idea though, a real dog''s eye view from the ground up!', '2002-04-30 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54204, 1200, 446, '<td valign="top">What imagination.  You have taken a very common subject and brought it to life.  Your exposure is darn close to "dead nuts".  The sharpness of the subject is awfully natural.  Did you use a polarizer to knock down the glare on the plug and darken the sky?  In my mind there are many technical difficulties to overcome to achieve this exposure, in particular the bright exposure of the fireplug while not overexposing the sky.  Good job.  Keep it up!</td>', 'What imagination.  You have taken a very common subject and brought it to life.  Your exposure is darn close to "dead nuts".  The sharpness of the subject is awfully natural.  Did you use a polarizer to knock down the glare on the plug and darken the sky?  In my mind there are many technical difficulties to overcome to achieve this exposure, in particular the bright exposure of the fireplug while not overexposing the sky.  Good job.  Keep it up!', '2002-04-30 22:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54205, 1200, 543, '<td valign="top">Very nice color and contrast.  It would be boring without the lamppost - good decision.</td>', 'Very nice color and contrast.  It would be boring without the lamppost - good decision.', '2002-05-01 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54206, 1200, 1066, '<td valign="top">One of 5 subjects I had taken photos of.  Fire hydrants always seem to look good from the ground up and I like the silver one here.<br/><br/>Couldnt make my mind up whether I would have left the light in the photo or not.  I could go either way.  Anytime you add another subject into what is basically an inanimate object portrait shot you risk losing emphasis on the main subject.<br/><br/>None the less, I like this photo</td>', 'One of 5 subjects I had taken photos of.  Fire hydrants always seem to look good from the ground up and I like the silver one here.Couldnt make my mind up whether I would have left the light in the photo or not.  I could go either way.  Anytime you add another subject into what is basically an inanimate object portrait shot you risk losing emphasis on the main subject.None the less, I like this photo', '2002-05-01 09:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54207, 1200, 1041, '<td valign="top">Funny caption.  Nice colors and clarity.  Would''ve preferred it w/out the lamp post.</td>', 'Funny caption.  Nice colors and clarity.  Would''ve preferred it w/out the lamp post.', '2002-05-01 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54208, 1200, 156, '<td valign="top">GREAT perspective!</td>', 'GREAT perspective!', '2002-05-01 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54209, 1200, 878, '<td valign="top">Makes me want to go to the washroom.  Great angle on this shot, I love the color / lighting of of the hydrant and the sky looks nice too.<br/><br/></td>', 'Makes me want to go to the washroom.  Great angle on this shot, I love the color / lighting of of the hydrant and the sky looks nice too.', '2002-05-01 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54210, 1200, 813, '<td valign="top">Nice color and texture.</td>', 'Nice color and texture.', '2002-05-01 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54211, 1200, 509, '<td valign="top">Very original.  People might complain about the barrel distortion of the lamp post, but I think it adds to this shot, good choice of fire hydrant too, one of those flashy red or yellow ones would not have worked as well</td>', 'Very original.  People might complain about the barrel distortion of the lamp post, but I think it adds to this shot, good choice of fire hydrant too, one of those flashy red or yellow ones would not have worked as well', '2002-05-01 20:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54212, 1200, 901, '<td valign="top">delete light pole</td>', 'delete light pole', '2002-05-02 01:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54213, 1200, 797, '<td valign="top">excellent detail! also love the contrasting colors of metal and blue sky. high marks from me</td>', 'excellent detail! also love the contrasting colors of metal and blue sky. high marks from me', '2002-05-02 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54214, 1200, 1191, '<td valign="top">Very clever interpretation of the theme.</td>', 'Very clever interpretation of the theme.', '2002-05-02 16:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54215, 1200, 1290, '<td valign="top">Clever photo - clever title.</td>', 'Clever photo - clever title.', '2002-05-02 19:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54216, 1200, 255, '<td valign="top">Chihuahua? I love this! 10.</td>', 'Chihuahua? I love this! 10.', '2002-05-03 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54217, 1200, 910, '<td valign="top">great lighting</td>', 'great lighting', '2002-05-05 03:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54218, 1200, 1070, '<td valign="top">Amazingly clever shot.  The lighting, textures, colours, all perfect... got to be one of my top scorers.</td>', 'Amazingly clever shot.  The lighting, textures, colours, all perfect... got to be one of my top scorers.', '2002-05-05 11:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54219, 1200, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.  Great colors, framing, composition, etc.  I think I woulda made the street lamp''s pole parallel with the side of the image though, that''s all.</td>', 'Nicely done.  Great colors, framing, composition, etc.  I think I woulda made the street lamp''s pole parallel with the side of the image though, that''s all.', '2002-05-05 22:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54220, 1200, 689, '<td valign="top">Must be a really short dog ....</td>', 'Must be a really short dog ....', '2002-05-06 00:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54221, 1200, 656, '<td valign="top">thank you to those people who noticed the bushes at the base of the pic.  I''ll pay more attention to my cropping in future!</td>', 'thank you to those people who noticed the bushes at the base of the pic.  I''ll pay more attention to my cropping in future!', '2002-05-06 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54222, 1200, 327, '<td valign="top">Gordon<br/> Back to look again at your photo.<br/> First because I spelled angle wrong.........LOL.......... <br/>and second because I wanted to see the metal-rust in the sunlight again. I found it interesting the first time. It still is. Good work.<br/> <br/>dyslexic and sloppy in Oregon. Kee</td>', 'Gordon Back to look again at your photo. First because I spelled angle wrong.........LOL.......... and second because I wanted to see the metal-rust in the sunlight again. I found it interesting the first time. It still is. Good work. dyslexic and sloppy in Oregon. Kee', '2002-05-07 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54223, 1203, 301, '<td valign="top">not the most picturesque outlook.  The lamp posts detract from the cityscape.</td>', 'not the most picturesque outlook.  The lamp posts detract from the cityscape.', '2002-04-29 07:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54224, 1203, 1024, '<td valign="top">nice use of leading lines.</td>', 'nice use of leading lines.', '2002-04-29 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(54225, 1203, 656, '<td valign="top">don''t really get the point of this - what''s the subject ?   Good framing using the station though.</td>', 'don''t really get the point of this - what''s the subject ?   Good framing using the station though.', '2002-04-29 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54226, 1203, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photograph but I''m having trouble relating it to the challenge.  it looks like the buildings in the distance are the subject of the photograph.  If that''s the case, I understand the challenge attempt.  If the overhead canopy is the subject of the photo, I am missing out on this altogether.  if the light posts are the subject, I would have been sure to not clip them off at the bottom of the photograph.  I am a firm believer that all good photographs should have a definite subject.  You don''t want to leave your viewer wondering what he/she/it is supposed to be focusing on.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'This is an interesting photograph but I''m having trouble relating it to the challenge.  it looks like the buildings in the distance are the subject of the photograph.  If that''s the case, I understand the challenge attempt.  If the overhead canopy is the subject of the photo, I am missing out on this altogether.  if the light posts are the subject, I would have been sure to not clip them off at the bottom of the photograph.  I am a firm believer that all good photographs should have a definite subject.  You don''t want to leave your viewer wondering what he/she/it is supposed to be focusing on.  Keep up the good work!', '2002-04-29 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54227, 1203, 189, '<td valign="top">This doesn''t seem like it is from the ground. more like 6 feet up.</td>', 'This doesn''t seem like it is from the ground. more like 6 feet up.', '2002-04-29 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54228, 1203, 1371, '<td valign="top">I like the juxtaposition of the power lines and roof in the foreground with the skyline. I do feel some additional cropping would have helped emphasise it.</td>', 'I like the juxtaposition of the power lines and roof in the foreground with the skyline. I do feel some additional cropping would have helped emphasise it.', '2002-04-29 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54229, 1203, 962, '<td valign="top">Where is the light-rail ?</td>', 'Where is the light-rail ?', '2002-04-29 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54230, 1203, 675, '<td valign="top">take the darn power lines out of the shot and you have yourself a great photo</td>', 'take the darn power lines out of the shot and you have yourself a great photo', '2002-04-29 18:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54231, 1203, 862, '<td valign="top">I''m afraid I don''t see the "ground up" aspect of this shot.  It looks like a standard cityscape to me.<br/>It is a good shot none-the-less.</td>', 'I''m afraid I don''t see the "ground up" aspect of this shot.  It looks like a standard cityscape to me.It is a good shot none-the-less.', '2002-04-30 08:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54232, 1203, 885, '<td valign="top">There are so many cloud-less skies in this challenge, I''m jealous :-)</td>', 'There are so many cloud-less skies in this challenge, I''m jealous :-)', '2002-04-30 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54233, 1203, 1041, '<td valign="top">Even though the angle of the photograph is up, it doesn''t convey to me the impression that the camera was on or close to the ground.  I know from some of my photos that it can be on the ground, and not look like it, but I think the final impression conveyed is what counts.  Otherwise nice picture.</td>', 'Even though the angle of the photograph is up, it doesn''t convey to me the impression that the camera was on or close to the ground.  I know from some of my photos that it can be on the ground, and not look like it, but I think the final impression conveyed is what counts.  Otherwise nice picture.', '2002-04-30 11:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54234, 1203, 888, '<td valign="top">I like the city scape but I don''t think the station roof, as the subject of the ground up part of the picture isn''t as exciting as the sky line</td>', 'I like the city scape but I don''t think the station roof, as the subject of the ground up part of the picture isn''t as exciting as the sky line', '2002-04-30 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54235, 1203, 1078, '<td valign="top">I think this might have been a better photo as a more traditional shot (as opposed to shooting for this specific challenge) -- I like the roof as a framing element, but much of the elements at the bottom feel like they''ve been _just_ cropped out (whether or not they actually have)</td>', 'I think this might have been a better photo as a more traditional shot (as opposed to shooting for this specific challenge) -- I like the roof as a framing element, but much of the elements at the bottom feel like they''ve been _just_ cropped out (whether or not they actually have)', '2002-05-01 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54236, 1203, 739, '<td valign="top">hmm..I want to focus on the horizon, giving me an eye level perspective rather than a grounds up perspective.  Would be better had there been something interesting in the upper left corner.</td>', 'hmm..I want to focus on the horizon, giving me an eye level perspective rather than a grounds up perspective.  Would be better had there been something interesting in the upper left corner.', '2002-05-01 21:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54237, 1203, 933, '<td valign="top">The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.</td>', 'The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.', '2002-05-02 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54238, 1203, 2, '<td valign="top">There doesn''t seem to be anything technically wrong with this photo, but the composition just seems dull to me.</td>', 'There doesn''t seem to be anything technically wrong with this photo, but the composition just seems dull to me.', '2002-05-05 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54239, 1203, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems more head-on than ground-up.</td>', 'Seems more head-on than ground-up.', '2002-05-05 23:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54240, 1203, 689, '<td valign="top">Can you get rid of that building with all the plywood?</td>', 'Can you get rid of that building with all the plywood?', '2002-05-06 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54241, 1204, 352, '<td valign="top">Love the catch of sunlight in the hair.</td>', 'Love the catch of sunlight in the hair.', '2002-04-29 01:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54242, 1204, 1175, '<td valign="top">Its a nice picture.  But i don''t see "fromt he ground up" in it.</td>', 'Its a nice picture.  But i don''t see "fromt he ground up" in it.', '2002-04-29 06:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54243, 1204, 656, '<td valign="top">nice light cutting across just the hair - background is too cluttered though</td>', 'nice light cutting across just the hair - background is too cluttered though', '2002-04-29 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54244, 1204, 189, '<td valign="top">Where''s the whole face?</td>', 'Where''s the whole face?', '2002-04-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54245, 1204, 1037, '<td valign="top">The light catching the hair is very nice :). So are the smiling eyes. The composition is really interesting, but somehow not very pleasing to me... It''s hard to say why.</td>', 'The light catching the hair is very nice :). So are the smiling eyes. The composition is really interesting, but somehow not very pleasing to me... It''s hard to say why.', '2002-04-29 11:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54246, 1204, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.  I always admire the black and whites.  My own tastes tell me that i would have tried to capture more of the face.  My other issue is that I have no indication that I''m looking up other than the title of this photo...</td>', 'This is an interesting photo.  I always admire the black and whites.  My own tastes tell me that i would have tried to capture more of the face.  My other issue is that I have no indication that I''m looking up other than the title of this photo...', '2002-04-29 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54247, 1204, 714, '<td valign="top">Precious.  Very nice</td>', 'Precious.  Very nice', '2002-04-29 13:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54248, 1204, 1379, '<td valign="top">Intensely sweet!!  Nice catchlights in the eyes.. very twinkly!  Not a good sense of "from the ground up", though...</td>', 'Intensely sweet!!  Nice catchlights in the eyes.. very twinkly!  Not a good sense of "from the ground up", though...', '2002-04-29 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54249, 1204, 813, '<td valign="top">Beautiful lighting, composition and expression on the childs face make this compelling. I would score it higher if it were obvious the camera is looking up.</td>', 'Beautiful lighting, composition and expression on the childs face make this compelling. I would score it higher if it were obvious the camera is looking up.', '2002-04-29 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54250, 1204, 962, '<td valign="top">Not obvious that the person is looking down at the camera</td>', 'Not obvious that the person is looking down at the camera', '2002-04-29 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54251, 1204, 675, '<td valign="top">she might as well have been looking up at him, there isn''t much sense of perspective in this shot...the black and white was a good choice</td>', 'she might as well have been looking up at him, there isn''t much sense of perspective in this shot...the black and white was a good choice', '2002-04-29 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54252, 1204, 1, '<td valign="top">Very cute, though it doesn''t represent ground up.  With the angle, she is looking at you head on... not down.  The background does not represent the ceiling either, it looks more like shades.</td>', 'Very cute, though it doesn''t represent ground up.  With the angle, she is looking at you head on... not down.  The background does not represent the ceiling either, it looks more like shades.', '2002-04-29 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54253, 1204, 1344, '<td valign="top">Nothing in the picture to show that we''re actually looking upward</td>', 'Nothing in the picture to show that we''re actually looking upward', '2002-04-29 22:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54254, 1204, 536, '<td valign="top">IMO cropping the child''s face weakened the photo.  I don''t get the "feeling" that the child is looking down at you or you''re looking up. Without something in the photo to act as a point of reference, I''m left feeling the challenge wasn''t met.</td>', 'IMO cropping the child''s face weakened the photo.  I don''t get the "feeling" that the child is looking down at you or you''re looking up. Without something in the photo to act as a point of reference, I''m left feeling the challenge wasn''t met.', '2002-04-29 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54255, 1204, 459, '<td valign="top">Wispy hair is beautiful</td>', 'Wispy hair is beautiful', '2002-04-30 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54256, 1204, 885, '<td valign="top">The light on the hair is VERY cute.  The background is nicely non-distracting, and I think it is a good use of black and white.  Just showing the eyes actually does work, because they''re really very expressive.  Nitpick: the top left corner seems a little bit overexposed.</td>', 'The light on the hair is VERY cute.  The background is nicely non-distracting, and I think it is a good use of black and white.  Just showing the eyes actually does work, because they''re really very expressive.  Nitpick: the top left corner seems a little bit overexposed.', '2002-04-30 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54257, 1204, 1078, '<td valign="top">I can''t see her eyes, and while her fly-away hair is cool, her eyes are the part I really want to see.  Between the dark eyes and the highlight on the hair, I keep getting pulled away from what is, to me, the most important part of a portrait.  Would it have been possible to use a reflector or a piece of white card to get some light up on her face?</td>', 'I can''t see her eyes, and while her fly-away hair is cool, her eyes are the part I really want to see.  Between the dark eyes and the highlight on the hair, I keep getting pulled away from what is, to me, the most important part of a portrait.  Would it have been possible to use a reflector or a piece of white card to get some light up on her face?', '2002-04-30 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54258, 1204, 1323, '<td valign="top">I love how the eyes and cheeks indicate a big smile, even though it can''t be seen.</td>', 'I love how the eyes and cheeks indicate a big smile, even though it can''t be seen.', '2002-04-30 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54259, 1204, 888, '<td valign="top">nice pic but I don''t think the hair gives enough of an impression of what direction everything is to each other.direction</td>', 'nice pic but I don''t think the hair gives enough of an impression of what direction everything is to each other.direction', '2002-04-30 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54260, 1204, 280, '<td valign="top">Not normally a big fan of shots of peoples kids, however I feel this is a well taken shot, really captures the moment well.</td>', 'Not normally a big fan of shots of peoples kids, however I feel this is a well taken shot, really captures the moment well.', '2002-04-30 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54261, 1204, 1041, '<td valign="top">I love the glint in the eye and how the hair is lit up by the sun, but I would prefer to see more of the face.  Great concept!</td>', 'I love the glint in the eye and how the hair is lit up by the sun, but I would prefer to see more of the face.  Great concept!', '2002-04-30 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54262, 1204, 387, '<td valign="top">Adorable subject!  Left me wanting to see more of the face though.<br/></td>', 'Adorable subject!  Left me wanting to see more of the face though.', '2002-04-30 20:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54263, 1204, 1066, '<td valign="top">I like the photo but...there are not enough clues beyond the title to give you the impression she is looking down.<br/><br/>Just some simple out of focus background clues would have been helpful to the photo or maybe if she had hair that was more drapey (is that a word?)</td>', 'I like the photo but...there are not enough clues beyond the title to give you the impression she is looking down.Just some simple out of focus background clues would have been helpful to the photo or maybe if she had hair that was more drapey (is that a word?)', '2002-05-01 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54264, 1204, 543, '<td valign="top">Daring, but I don''t know if it works.  The blown out hair grabs all my attention, and the rest is tonally pretty flat.  Good on you for taking a chance.  Beautiful baby.</td>', 'Daring, but I don''t know if it works.  The blown out hair grabs all my attention, and the rest is tonally pretty flat.  Good on you for taking a chance.  Beautiful baby.', '2002-05-01 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54265, 1204, 156, '<td valign="top">...but was daddy''s camera on the ground?</td>', '...but was daddy''s camera on the ground?', '2002-05-01 13:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54266, 1204, 933, '<td valign="top">Neat composition &amp; lighting.  Though it does seem a tad dark.  Like it a lot though.  Good job!</td>', 'Neat composition & lighting.  Though it does seem a tad dark.  Like it a lot though.  Good job!', '2002-05-01 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54267, 1204, 1457, '<td valign="top">maybe not ground up, but i don''t belive in ruling out for that, I mean thats what inspired it right. Very interesting, nice comp. The eyes are so dark, and creepy and there is that hint of a smile, the hair is fun,</td>', 'maybe not ground up, but i don''t belive in ruling out for that, I mean thats what inspired it right. Very interesting, nice comp. The eyes are so dark, and creepy and there is that hint of a smile, the hair is fun,', '2002-05-04 22:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54268, 1204, 749, '<td valign="top">Great detail, but it''s very hard to tell if this shot was taken from the ground up</td>', 'Great detail, but it''s very hard to tell if this shot was taken from the ground up', '2002-05-05 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54269, 1205, 107, '<td valign="top">I like this picture alot.  The old train has a lot of personality to it, and the perspective works really well with this shot.</td>', 'I like this picture alot.  The old train has a lot of personality to it, and the perspective works really well with this shot.', '2002-04-29 04:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54270, 1205, 1024, '<td valign="top">I am a sucker for train pictures.</td>', 'I am a sucker for train pictures.', '2002-04-29 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54271, 1205, 656, '<td valign="top">would work well as a black &amp; white shot - bring out the rust textures</td>', 'would work well as a black & white shot - bring out the rust textures', '2002-04-29 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54272, 1205, 509, '<td valign="top">I really like train pics (my last one was one, didn''t do as well as I''m sure yours is going to do though).  Cropping is a bit tight, but other than that this is a nice shot</td>', 'I really like train pics (my last one was one, didn''t do as well as I''m sure yours is going to do though).  Cropping is a bit tight, but other than that this is a nice shot', '2002-04-29 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54273, 1205, 772, '<td valign="top">I wish i had an opportunity to spend a few hours with this old man and my camera... I love your subject!  I think this is a *perfect* candidate for black and white or sepia tones.  Both modes seem to help convey antiquity.  I don'' t know how the contrast would be on the train but it would be worth seeing!  Excellent photo!</td>', 'I wish i had an opportunity to spend a few hours with this old man and my camera... I love your subject!  I think this is a *perfect* candidate for black and white or sepia tones.  Both modes seem to help convey antiquity.  I don'' t know how the contrast would be on the train but it would be worth seeing!  Excellent photo!', '2002-04-29 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54274, 1205, 544, '<td valign="top">Holy cow! I love this picture. I love it to death! Rich green grass, a beautiful train dressed up in rust and moss... definitely one of the top photos this week, even if you''re probably going to get knocked by others for not having a neck-craning angle of UP. Too bad you couldn''t have gotten more color into the sky (i.e. taken the picture on a day where there was a worthwhile sky). That definitely would have added a point to the score.</td>', 'Holy cow! I love this picture. I love it to death! Rich green grass, a beautiful train dressed up in rust and moss... definitely one of the top photos this week, even if you''re probably going to get knocked by others for not having a neck-craning angle of UP. Too bad you couldn''t have gotten more color into the sky (i.e. taken the picture on a day where there was a worthwhile sky). That definitely would have added a point to the score.', '2002-04-29 13:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54275, 1205, 675, '<td valign="top">that is definitely an old train, and a good interpretation of the challenge - achiral</td>', 'that is definitely an old train, and a good interpretation of the challenge - achiral', '2002-04-29 18:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54276, 1205, 1350, '<td valign="top">I really enjoy this pic...it appeals to the amateur historian in me. I also like the subtle colors and prospective of this photo. The subject choice is very well done!</td>', 'I really enjoy this pic...it appeals to the amateur historian in me. I also like the subtle colors and prospective of this photo. The subject choice is very well done!', '2002-04-29 18:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54277, 1205, 661, '<td valign="top">Great train.</td>', 'Great train.', '2002-04-29 19:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54278, 1205, 142, '<td valign="top">This really is an ancient train.  Good angle.  It is still facing upwards even though you have it at a slight angle.  This is a great picture.</td>', 'This really is an ancient train.  Good angle.  It is still facing upwards even though you have it at a slight angle.  This is a great picture.', '2002-04-29 21:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54279, 1205, 1, '<td valign="top">Great composition, although the sky sort of bleeds over into the train.  I think shooting at a different time of day and/or maybe a slightly quicker exposure or greater aperature would darken it and make it not seem to over-exposed at the top.<br/><br/>Otherwise, I really do like it.</td>', 'Great composition, although the sky sort of bleeds over into the train.  I think shooting at a different time of day and/or maybe a slightly quicker exposure or greater aperature would darken it and make it not seem to over-exposed at the top.Otherwise, I really do like it.', '2002-04-29 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54280, 1205, 301, '<td valign="top">this is a great subject, but I feel like there may have been another angle that could have captured the essence of the train better ... it''s hard to tell not being there.  Maybe using some DOF to get the viewer to concentrate on a particular part of the train whilst still showing what the object is.</td>', 'this is a great subject, but I feel like there may have been another angle that could have captured the essence of the train better ... it''s hard to tell not being there.  Maybe using some DOF to get the viewer to concentrate on a particular part of the train whilst still showing what the object is.', '2002-04-30 07:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54281, 1205, 714, '<td valign="top">Choo Choo!  Now that is an old train.  Great picture.  I like how I can see the details.<br/></td>', 'Choo Choo!  Now that is an old train.  Great picture.  I like how I can see the details.', '2002-04-30 09:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54282, 1205, 813, '<td valign="top">The angle this picture was shot at gives it a sense of movement which works very nicely in contrast to the fact it has obviously been a long time since this beast went anywhere. Ahh but in it''s day...  I wish the sky had some color in it. Did you try converting to black and white?</td>', 'The angle this picture was shot at gives it a sense of movement which works very nicely in contrast to the fact it has obviously been a long time since this beast went anywhere. Ahh but in it''s day...  I wish the sky had some color in it. Did you try converting to black and white?', '2002-04-30 10:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54283, 1205, 1209, '<td valign="top">I know just how it feels!!  My Dad was a railroad man; brings back memories!  Wonderful photographic study.</td>', 'I know just how it feels!!  My Dad was a railroad man; brings back memories!  Wonderful photographic study.', '2002-04-30 16:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54284, 1205, 888, '<td valign="top">nice and industrial</td>', 'nice and industrial', '2002-04-30 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54285, 1205, 446, '<td valign="top">Wow!  I can feel the power this engine once produced.  It''s almost like the retired warrior.  Lots of emotion evoked with this shot for me.  Extremely sharp.  If you did post processing, you were very judicious.  If no post processing was done, it''s even more impressive.   Excellent work.  Irated this high.  Gave it a 9.</td>', 'Wow!  I can feel the power this engine once produced.  It''s almost like the retired warrior.  Lots of emotion evoked with this shot for me.  Extremely sharp.  If you did post processing, you were very judicious.  If no post processing was done, it''s even more impressive.   Excellent work.  Irated this high.  Gave it a 9.', '2002-04-30 22:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54286, 1205, 640, '<td valign="top">well done photo and i like the idea of a train, but the rust and paint coming off doesn''t do anything for me I wonder if b&amp;W would have been better?</td>', 'well done photo and i like the idea of a train, but the rust and paint coming off doesn''t do anything for me I wonder if b&W would have been better?', '2002-05-01 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54287, 1205, 543, '<td valign="top">At another time of day, when you could balance the exposure of the engine against the sky, this would be very good.  If I had to shoot in this kind of overcast, I''d get even closer in and try to include as little of the sky as possible (optimally none).</td>', 'At another time of day, when you could balance the exposure of the engine against the sky, this would be very good.  If I had to shoot in this kind of overcast, I''d get even closer in and try to include as little of the sky as possible (optimally none).', '2002-05-01 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54288, 1205, 885, '<td valign="top">Good subject.  I''m fond of old rusty things :-)  The white sky isn''t doing you any favors..more direct light on a less cloudy day might make it ''pop'' a little more.</td>', 'Good subject.  I''m fond of old rusty things :-)  The white sky isn''t doing you any favors..more direct light on a less cloudy day might make it ''pop'' a little more.', '2002-05-01 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54289, 1205, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2002-05-01 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54290, 1205, 244, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, I wish the sky wasn''t washed out though.</td>', 'interesting shot, I wish the sky wasn''t washed out though.', '2002-05-01 19:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54291, 1205, 1290, '<td valign="top">There are some stories this engine could tell - brilliant photo!</td>', 'There are some stories this engine could tell - brilliant photo!', '2002-05-02 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54292, 1205, 739, '<td valign="top">I like the bit of ground that you got.  Gives a really "ground up" feel though I feel the perspective is more horizontal than vertical.  Did you try a shot that was closer to the train?</td>', 'I like the bit of ground that you got.  Gives a really "ground up" feel though I feel the perspective is more horizontal than vertical.  Did you try a shot that was closer to the train?', '2002-05-03 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54293, 1205, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, but not a particularly interesting  angle.</td>', 'Nice idea, but not a particularly interesting  angle.', '2002-05-03 20:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54294, 1205, 1202, '<td valign="top">Worth a thousand words.   I think it would have been so much more effective had you taken it more from the catcher up, but all the same a good angle.   Maybe you tried too hard for the challege and let composition slip a little.</td>', 'Worth a thousand words.   I think it would have been so much more effective had you taken it more from the catcher up, but all the same a good angle.   Maybe you tried too hard for the challege and let composition slip a little.', '2002-05-04 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
