(54310, 1206, 772, '<td valign="top">I love the angle and the composition in general of this photo.  The depth of field is excellent!  This is a very nice photo.  I think it''s one of my favorites... well.. wait a sec.. hmmm... i see something wrong.... this is VERY wrong... I see a purple pixel in the ear just to the left of the eye socket.. a randomly errant pixel.. man.. this blows the whole photograph... I don'' tknow if i can score higher than a 1 for that... bummr... I dunno.. I may need to consult with the higher powers on this one.. I''m thinking hard now... well.. i guess this photo is worth one of my highest ratings on this challenge anyway... Excellent job!</td>', 'I love the angle and the composition in general of this photo.  The depth of field is excellent!  This is a very nice photo.  I think it''s one of my favorites... well.. wait a sec.. hmmm... i see something wrong.... this is VERY wrong... I see a purple pixel in the ear just to the left of the eye socket.. a randomly errant pixel.. man.. this blows the whole photograph... I don'' tknow if i can score higher than a 1 for that... bummr... I dunno.. I may need to consult with the higher powers on this one.. I''m thinking hard now... well.. i guess this photo is worth one of my highest ratings on this challenge anyway... Excellent job!', '2002-04-29 20:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
