(54317, 1206, 446, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  I like the lighting, color balance, sharpness and depth of field isolating the subject.  Good job.</td>', 'Very nice.  I like the lighting, color balance, sharpness and depth of field isolating the subject.  Good job.', '2002-05-01 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54318, 1206, 543, '<td valign="top">Not bad for OPA (other people''s art).  I love shooting stuff like this, but usually don''t display it.  Just my thing.  Nice open shade with good detail in the shadows.  The bg would be better even more oof, but you know how that goes; I''m sure you were at max aperture.  Maybe from just a little higher / farther back to include more eye.</td>', 'Not bad for OPA (other people''s art).  I love shooting stuff like this, but usually don''t display it.  Just my thing.  Nice open shade with good detail in the shadows.  The bg would be better even more oof, but you know how that goes; I''m sure you were at max aperture.  Maybe from just a little higher / farther back to include more eye.', '2002-05-01 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54319, 1206, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Wonderful smile.  The more I look at this one the more I like it!  How close to the ground were you though?  I know cropping sometimes removes the feel of being close to the ground even if you are . . .</td>', 'Great idea.  Wonderful smile.  The more I look at this one the more I like it!  How close to the ground were you though?  I know cropping sometimes removes the feel of being close to the ground even if you are . . .', '2002-05-01 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
