(54330, 1209, 885, '<td valign="top">Oh, I very much like this picture.  Nice sepia tones, I like the lines of the rungs of the stool/chair.  Not as sure about the door in the background, as the perspective makes it and the corner of the wall to the right tilt, which may be a bit distracting.</td>', 'Oh, I very much like this picture.  Nice sepia tones, I like the lines of the rungs of the stool/chair.  Not as sure about the door in the background, as the perspective makes it and the corner of the wall to the right tilt, which may be a bit distracting.', '2002-04-29 08:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
