(54344, 1209, 772, '<td valign="top">I wish i wasn''t such a huge fan of monochromatic images... I like the sepia tone here but I actually think that normal b/w may have served this shot better.  Sepia usually gives an ''antique'' mood to an image and this shot is not an antique subject.  I like your challenge interpretation and this is a great photo!  Good work!</td>', 'I wish i wasn''t such a huge fan of monochromatic images... I like the sepia tone here but I actually think that normal b/w may have served this shot better.  Sepia usually gives an ''antique'' mood to an image and this shot is not an antique subject.  I like your challenge interpretation and this is a great photo!  Good work!', '2002-04-30 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
