(54364, 1210, 2, '<td valign="top">Cool idea and nice colors in the reflection.</td>', 'Cool idea and nice colors in the reflection.', '2002-04-29 10:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54365, 1210, 189, '<td valign="top">Slightly original</td>', 'Slightly original', '2002-04-29 10:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54366, 1210, 1034, '<td valign="top">i think this is the first actual original photo I''ve seen.</td>', 'i think this is the first actual original photo I''ve seen.', '2002-04-29 11:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54367, 1210, 835, '<td valign="top">original</td>', 'original', '2002-04-29 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54368, 1210, 509, '<td valign="top">Very creative twist on the challenge, nice job</td>', 'Very creative twist on the challenge, nice job', '2002-04-29 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54369, 1210, 1336, '<td valign="top">brilliant.  very original.</td>', 'brilliant.  very original.', '2002-04-29 15:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54370, 1210, 1379, '<td valign="top">Clever...</td>', 'Clever...', '2002-04-29 15:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54371, 1210, 885, '<td valign="top">Original interpretation.  I like the repetition of the diagonals, and it is well-exposed.  It gives just enough hint of trees to not be blank, but mostly sky so that we know where that mirror is pointing.  It''s clever, but I''m not sure that there''s enough going on (not enough color?) that it would grab me enough to take a closer look outside of the challenge.</td>', 'Original interpretation.  I like the repetition of the diagonals, and it is well-exposed.  It gives just enough hint of trees to not be blank, but mostly sky so that we know where that mirror is pointing.  It''s clever, but I''m not sure that there''s enough going on (not enough color?) that it would grab me enough to take a closer look outside of the challenge.', '2002-04-29 15:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54372, 1210, 772, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I like the composition of this shot but the ''ground up'' concept is flawed here for several reasons... first of all, the camera is pointing down at the mirror... but i do see that the mirror is reflecting what is above it.  So what''s wrong?  well, the objects in the mirror are oriented from a top down perspective as well.  it looks like the treetops are pointing directly downwards and at an downward slope.  Maybe I''m misinterpreting the whole idea here... maybe this is a ''bounce'' shot that is bouncing the image off the ground mirror into your camera?  Hmm... I don''t know... I''ll follow up on your comments with this one after the challenge is over...</td>', 'Hmmm... I like the composition of this shot but the ''ground up'' concept is flawed here for several reasons... first of all, the camera is pointing down at the mirror... but i do see that the mirror is reflecting what is above it.  So what''s wrong?  well, the objects in the mirror are oriented from a top down perspective as well.  it looks like the treetops are pointing directly downwards and at an downward slope.  Maybe I''m misinterpreting the whole idea here... maybe this is a ''bounce'' shot that is bouncing the image off the ground mirror into your camera?  Hmm... I don''t know... I''ll follow up on your comments with this one after the challenge is over...', '2002-04-29 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54373, 1210, 962, '<td valign="top">Clever idea.....however, too much background surrounding the frame and too much reflection of sky.</td>', 'Clever idea.....however, too much background surrounding the frame and too much reflection of sky.', '2002-04-29 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54374, 1210, 117, '<td valign="top">i like the concept</td>', 'i like the concept', '2002-04-29 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54375, 1210, 327, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, original!! Good for you.</td>', 'Interesting idea, original!! Good for you.', '2002-04-29 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54376, 1210, 1344, '<td valign="top">Great interpretation!</td>', 'Great interpretation!', '2002-04-29 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54377, 1210, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! I feel that a lot of thought was put into creating something very simple in this photo. It ties the elements of ground and sky together very effectively, with clear lines and a great contrast between the geometric lines of the pavings and mirror and the fractal complexity of the branches and clouds.</td>', 'Beautiful! I feel that a lot of thought was put into creating something very simple in this photo. It ties the elements of ground and sky together very effectively, with clear lines and a great contrast between the geometric lines of the pavings and mirror and the fractal complexity of the branches and clouds.', '2002-04-30 05:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54378, 1210, 813, '<td valign="top">Good idea, you can see the ground and you can see up. It would have been much better if the reflection in the mirror were more interesting.</td>', 'Good idea, you can see the ground and you can see up. It would have been much better if the reflection in the mirror were more interesting.', '2002-04-30 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54379, 1210, 459, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  If there were only something more interesting in the mirror....</td>', 'Great idea.  If there were only something more interesting in the mirror....', '2002-04-30 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54380, 1210, 446, '<td valign="top">Nice idea.  The tree and sky does not appear in focus in the mirror.  If they were in focus I think the picture would have been even more dramatic.  You may try adjusting your aperture for greater depth of field for this type of shot - keeping both the mirror frame and the reflection in focus.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'Nice idea.  The tree and sky does not appear in focus in the mirror.  If they were in focus I think the picture would have been even more dramatic.  You may try adjusting your aperture for greater depth of field for this type of shot - keeping both the mirror frame and the reflection in focus.  Keep up the good work.', '2002-05-01 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54381, 1210, 543, '<td valign="top">Lavender on brown... my favorite.  I see what you''re getting at, and it''s a valid interpretation - just not enough interest in the image to support the idea.</td>', 'Lavender on brown... my favorite.  I see what you''re getting at, and it''s a valid interpretation - just not enough interest in the image to support the idea.', '2002-05-01 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54382, 1210, 1041, '<td valign="top">I like the interesting twist on the challenge!</td>', 'I like the interesting twist on the challenge!', '2002-05-01 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54383, 1210, 156, '<td valign="top">interesting interpretation and nicely executed</td>', 'interesting interpretation and nicely executed', '2002-05-01 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54384, 1210, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool idea.</td>', 'Cool idea.', '2002-05-01 12:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54385, 1210, 901, '<td valign="top">didn''t pull it off</td>', 'didn''t pull it off', '2002-05-02 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54386, 1210, 715, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot. Great idea and vey well executed.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot. Great idea and vey well executed.', '2002-05-02 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54387, 1210, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting interpretation of the challenge.  Maybe could have done a little more with the content appearing in the mirror. That is definitely the focus of the shot, and right now it just doesn''t do a whole lot.</td>', 'Interesting interpretation of the challenge.  Maybe could have done a little more with the content appearing in the mirror. That is definitely the focus of the shot, and right now it just doesn''t do a whole lot.', '2002-05-02 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54388, 1210, 748, '<td valign="top">This is really creative for the challenge.  wish I had thought about something like this.  Good job.</td>', 'This is really creative for the challenge.  wish I had thought about something like this.  Good job.', '2002-05-02 18:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54389, 1210, 1290, '<td valign="top">Clever!</td>', 'Clever!', '2002-05-02 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54390, 1210, 637, '<td valign="top">Great idea.  Wish the mirror''s image were more interesting.</td>', 'Great idea.  Wish the mirror''s image were more interesting.', '2002-05-03 19:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54391, 1210, 1202, '<td valign="top">I want to see the other shots you took but didn''t enter.   Just kidding, nice way to shoot from ground up.</td>', 'I want to see the other shots you took but didn''t enter.   Just kidding, nice way to shoot from ground up.', '2002-05-04 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
