(54394, 1210, 749, '<td valign="top">I debated between submitting a similar shot and the one I eventually submitted - good thinking tho ;o)</td>', 'I debated between submitting a similar shot and the one I eventually submitted - good thinking tho ;o)', '2002-05-05 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54395, 1210, 1191, '<td valign="top">You certainly thought about this one.  Brilliant.</td>', 'You certainly thought about this one.  Brilliant.', '2002-05-05 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54396, 1210, 1, '<td valign="top">Interesting take on things.</td>', 'Interesting take on things.', '2002-05-05 23:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54397, 1210, 888, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately I was really pushed for time on this one as I have been real busy that week so in the end I used my back garden to set up the shot.<br/><br/>My camera is an ixus so I can''t make many manual adjustments so the mirro''s reflection was a little out of focus.</td>', 'Unfortunately I was really pushed for time on this one as I have been real busy that week so in the end I used my back garden to set up the shot.My camera is an ixus so I can''t make many manual adjustments so the mirro''s reflection was a little out of focus.', '2002-05-06 04:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54400, 1212, 352, '<td valign="top">It''s all there, composition, focus, DOF, contrast.  Very well taken shot!</td>', 'It''s all there, composition, focus, DOF, contrast.  Very well taken shot!', '2002-04-29 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54401, 1212, 656, '<td valign="top">more interesting than most ''up tree'' shots, with the ladder adding interest.  Could have been framed better, with the tree over to the right more.</td>', 'more interesting than most ''up tree'' shots, with the ladder adding interest.  Could have been framed better, with the tree over to the right more.', '2002-04-29 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54402, 1212, 142, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  The colors and perspective is excellent.  This is one of my top three favorites.  A definate 10!</td>', 'Great shot!  The colors and perspective is excellent.  This is one of my top three favorites.  A definate 10!', '2002-04-29 10:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54403, 1212, 772, '<td valign="top">This photo displays very nice focus thoroughout the frame.  Good job!</td>', 'This photo displays very nice focus thoroughout the frame.  Good job!', '2002-04-29 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54404, 1212, 1042, '<td valign="top">Now there''s an interesting twist. :)</td>', 'Now there''s an interesting twist. :)', '2002-04-29 12:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54405, 1212, 259, '<td valign="top">excellent clarity</td>', 'excellent clarity', '2002-04-29 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54406, 1212, 813, '<td valign="top">The rope ladder really sells the notion of "ground up", bravo! Good exposure, focus, and composition. The only thing I''d like to be changed is the red flowers which keep pulling my eye away from the central focal point.</td>', 'The rope ladder really sells the notion of "ground up", bravo! Good exposure, focus, and composition. The only thing I''d like to be changed is the red flowers which keep pulling my eye away from the central focal point.', '2002-04-29 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54407, 1212, 1336, '<td valign="top">i think this photo would have been better if it was taken vertically, also closer to the ground would have been good.</td>', 'i think this photo would have been better if it was taken vertically, also closer to the ground would have been good.', '2002-04-29 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54408, 1212, 327, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2002-04-29 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54409, 1212, 1078, '<td valign="top">Really liked this -- would have given it an even better score but I fund the red flowers in the lower corner distracting to the rest of the image</td>', 'Really liked this -- would have given it an even better score but I fund the red flowers in the lower corner distracting to the rest of the image', '2002-04-29 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54410, 1212, 675, '<td valign="top">this is what people would say is cliche, but i don''t buy it, you captured this scene perfectly, nice job - achiral</td>', 'this is what people would say is cliche, but i don''t buy it, you captured this scene perfectly, nice job - achiral', '2002-04-29 18:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54411, 1212, 885, '<td valign="top">Couldn''t you have gotten Nick to sit up there and pose? ;-)  The red flowers on the right draw my eye away from the tree...</td>', 'Couldn''t you have gotten Nick to sit up there and pose? ;-)  The red flowers on the right draw my eye away from the tree...', '2002-04-30 11:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54412, 1212, 1323, '<td valign="top">The gorgeous and very defined leaves make the picture.  Very nice.</td>', 'The gorgeous and very defined leaves make the picture.  Very nice.', '2002-04-30 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54413, 1212, 554, '<td valign="top">top 3       nice lighting</td>', 'top 3       nice lighting', '2002-04-30 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54414, 1212, 387, '<td valign="top">I would have liked to see more of the ladder.  And the red at the bottom right was distracting.</td>', 'I would have liked to see more of the ladder.  And the red at the bottom right was distracting.', '2002-04-30 20:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54415, 1212, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective, detail and lighting</td>', 'Nice perspective, detail and lighting', '2002-05-01 03:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54416, 1212, 543, '<td valign="top">The ladder is very inviting.  Kind of feel sorry for Nick with just a branch to sit on, though.  A vertical composition with more ladder might work better.  Very nice colors and exposure right on.</td>', 'The ladder is very inviting.  Kind of feel sorry for Nick with just a branch to sit on, though.  A vertical composition with more ladder might work better.  Very nice colors and exposure right on.', '2002-05-01 04:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54417, 1212, 640, '<td valign="top">very nice. Gives a good peaceful feeling. I like how you added the swing and flower to the tree.</td>', 'very nice. Gives a good peaceful feeling. I like how you added the swing and flower to the tree.', '2002-05-01 09:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54418, 1212, 1041, '<td valign="top">Lucky Nick, nice place.  The flowers to the right are a little distracting, but good clarity overall.</td>', 'Lucky Nick, nice place.  The flowers to the right are a little distracting, but good clarity overall.', '2002-05-01 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54419, 1212, 156, '<td valign="top">i like the composition very much but with only four rungs of the ladder showing it doesn''t appear to have been taken from the perspective of the ground, more like from a standing height...unless you were on the ground and zoomed in?</td>', 'i like the composition very much but with only four rungs of the ladder showing it doesn''t appear to have been taken from the perspective of the ground, more like from a standing height...unless you were on the ground and zoomed in?', '2002-05-01 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54420, 1212, 714, '<td valign="top">very nice, calming</td>', 'very nice, calming', '2002-05-01 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54421, 1212, 301, '<td valign="top">Not sure if you wanted to keep the red flowers on the right, but I would prefer the photo if you''d gotten more of the ladder in.  The flowers seem more of a distraction here.</td>', 'Not sure if you wanted to keep the red flowers on the right, but I would prefer the photo if you''d gotten more of the ladder in.  The flowers seem more of a distraction here.', '2002-05-02 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54422, 1212, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice composition.  Though I think it would have been better if the the whole thing were moved to the right a bit, so that you could see the whole ladder.</td>', 'Nice composition.  Though I think it would have been better if the the whole thing were moved to the right a bit, so that you could see the whole ladder.', '2002-05-02 20:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54423, 1212, 1, '<td valign="top">Cute little shot here.  The colors are nice and soft.  I have two problems with it (mintor):  The red flowers? on the right I feel distract from the image.  And the tree/ladder could be moved over to the right a little bit to gain better composure?</td>', 'Cute little shot here.  The colors are nice and soft.  I have two problems with it (mintor):  The red flowers? on the right I feel distract from the image.  And the tree/ladder could be moved over to the right a little bit to gain better composure?', '2002-05-03 09:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54424, 1212, 1135, '<td valign="top">This was my first try at something like this and I very much appreciate all of the thoughtful and constructive comments. I am learning tons from this WEB Site! <br/>Thanks!<br/></td>', 'This was my first try at something like this and I very much appreciate all of the thoughtful and constructive comments. I am learning tons from this WEB Site! Thanks!', '2002-05-06 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54425, 1213, 1233, '<td valign="top">Now I know how the ants fee.  Great perspective.</td>', 'Now I know how the ants fee.  Great perspective.', '2002-04-29 06:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54426, 1213, 656, '<td valign="top">too much out of focus foreground - that only really works with very specific depth of field</td>', 'too much out of focus foreground - that only really works with very specific depth of field', '2002-04-29 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(54427, 1213, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... I like the dandelions, but the person in the photo is framed a bit awkwardly. Maybe more of the foot would have been cool.</td>', 'Hmm... I like the dandelions, but the person in the photo is framed a bit awkwardly. Maybe more of the foot would have been cool.', '2002-04-29 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54428, 1213, 259, '<td valign="top">great picture, it seems like it could be stronger if you were a half a step or a full step closer.</td>', 'great picture, it seems like it could be stronger if you were a half a step or a full step closer.', '2002-04-29 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54429, 1213, 1042, '<td valign="top">cool...</td>', 'cool...', '2002-04-29 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54430, 1213, 1077, '<td valign="top">Hey has an E in it</td>', 'Hey has an E in it', '2002-04-29 12:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54431, 1213, 616, '<td valign="top">wow, lots of weeds</td>', 'wow, lots of weeds', '2002-04-29 13:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54432, 1213, 933, '<td valign="top">Hey, I can see your clicker!</td>', 'Hey, I can see your clicker!', '2002-04-29 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54433, 1213, 1379, '<td valign="top">Antz!  A bug''s life!  What a weedy place!  This picture rocks!  I love the cropping of the face... this dude is anonymously blundering through the field.  It''s terrific!</td>', 'Antz!  A bug''s life!  What a weedy place!  This picture rocks!  I love the cropping of the face... this dude is anonymously blundering through the field.  It''s terrific!', '2002-04-29 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54434, 1213, 544, '<td valign="top">This is for sure the best of the "about to be stepped on" genre :) Your plants are in sharp focus, your subject is clear and well-lit, and the sky is only a little bleached-out in the upper right section of the photo. I love how the immediate plant life is more blurry - good use of that manual focus capability!</td>', 'This is for sure the best of the "about to be stepped on" genre :) Your plants are in sharp focus, your subject is clear and well-lit, and the sky is only a little bleached-out in the upper right section of the photo. I love how the immediate plant life is more blurry - good use of that manual focus capability!', '2002-04-29 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54435, 1213, 772, '<td valign="top">Uh oh... I''m gonna be smushed...  Nice shot!</td>', 'Uh oh... I''m gonna be smushed...  Nice shot!', '2002-04-29 16:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54436, 1213, 1005, '<td valign="top">I like it.  Good use of foreground material.</td>', 'I like it.  Good use of foreground material.', '2002-04-29 17:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54437, 1213, 675, '<td valign="top">umm, i am somehow not interested in this...maybe if the foot were literally right about to step on the camera</td>', 'umm, i am somehow not interested in this...maybe if the foot were literally right about to step on the camera', '2002-04-29 18:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54438, 1213, 1283, '<td valign="top">Aaaaaaaahh ! Look down here, don''t step on me..I''m only a little bug..Land of the giants'' Maybe?</td>', 'Aaaaaaaahh ! Look down here, don''t step on me..I''m only a little bug..Land of the giants'' Maybe?', '2002-04-30 03:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54439, 1213, 674, '<td valign="top">I think that his would have had more impact if you had taken it in portrait mode</td>', 'I think that his would have had more impact if you had taken it in portrait mode', '2002-04-30 06:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54440, 1213, 459, '<td valign="top">Is that the remote in your right hand?  Nice interpretation of the topic.</td>', 'Is that the remote in your right hand?  Nice interpretation of the topic.', '2002-04-30 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54441, 1213, 640, '<td valign="top">an ant alright.</td>', 'an ant alright.', '2002-04-30 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54442, 1213, 885, '<td valign="top">One of the few pictures where cropping off the head of the main subject actually works :-)  The foot doesn''t seem to be ''about to'' step on the camera though.</td>', 'One of the few pictures where cropping off the head of the main subject actually works :-)  The foot doesn''t seem to be ''about to'' step on the camera though.', '2002-04-30 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54443, 1213, 888, '<td valign="top">arghhhh they''re going to squash me......<br/>Nice pic!</td>', 'arghhhh they''re going to squash me......Nice pic!', '2002-04-30 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54444, 1213, 554, '<td valign="top">10</td>', '10', '2002-04-30 14:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54445, 1213, 441, '<td valign="top">good shot , almost same as mine - these dandelions are everywhere! scored well</td>', 'good shot , almost same as mine - these dandelions are everywhere! scored well', '2002-04-30 17:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54446, 1213, 301, '<td valign="top">Good angle on this one.  I would have preferred to see more of the shoe, and the person''s face as well.  Maybe taking the photo in portrait would have given more of an impression that the person was really towering over the viewer</td>', 'Good angle on this one.  I would have preferred to see more of the shoe, and the person''s face as well.  Maybe taking the photo in portrait would have given more of an impression that the person was really towering over the viewer', '2002-05-01 06:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54447, 1213, 543, '<td valign="top">With the sun behind the camera you might have avoided some of the overexposure, but it''s not bad.  I imagine people are taking you to task for cutting of the head, but I think it''s a good device for making height.  Then again, I would...</td>', 'With the sun behind the camera you might have avoided some of the overexposure, but it''s not bad.  I imagine people are taking you to task for cutting of the head, but I think it''s a good device for making height.  Then again, I would...', '2002-05-01 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54448, 1213, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Would''ve been my top vote if the head wasn''t cut off.</td>', 'Very good.  Would''ve been my top vote if the head wasn''t cut off.', '2002-05-01 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54449, 1213, 1, '<td valign="top">Hmm, the foot seems too far away from the camera to make me have the feeling like I''m about to be stepped on.  Maybe move the guy closer, as if he''s about to step on us.</td>', 'Hmm, the foot seems too far away from the camera to make me have the feeling like I''m about to be stepped on.  Maybe move the guy closer, as if he''s about to step on us.', '2002-05-02 09:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54450, 1213, 637, '<td valign="top">Imaginitive</td>', 'Imaginitive', '2002-05-03 19:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
