(54464, 1214, 885, '<td valign="top">I love the texture in this photo.  It''s not really a mushroom, though, is it?  It seems like it would have to have those little gill-like things...but I don''t know.  The framing is good, I like it a lot better than if you had included the whole top.  I do wish though, that the background could have been a little more consistent.</td>', 'I love the texture in this photo.  It''s not really a mushroom, though, is it?  It seems like it would have to have those little gill-like things...but I don''t know.  The framing is good, I like it a lot better than if you had included the whole top.  I do wish though, that the background could have been a little more consistent.', '2002-04-30 08:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
