(54472, 1214, 436, '<td valign="top">great perspective.  this baby had to be a good size just to get the camera under it, but the angle, texture and lighting are wonderful.</td>', 'great perspective.  this baby had to be a good size just to get the camera under it, but the angle, texture and lighting are wonderful.', '2002-05-03 08:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
