(54476, 1214, 1, '<td valign="top">I''m wondering if it''s a real mushroom or a stone statue?  :)</td>', 'I''m wondering if it''s a real mushroom or a stone statue?  :)', '2002-05-05 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54477, 1214, 714, '<td valign="top">Thank you to all who made comments.  My husband and I love to look for rocks.  We are avid rock hounds.  The stem of the mushroom was found on the Old Texas Trail.  26 miles North of Moorcroft, Wyoming.  And the top was found 7 miles away from the bottom. The rocks are mainly a concretion of mud.  We have a couple in our yard.  They make for a great decoration.   The mushroom is about a 1 1/2 feet in height.  The background was hard to get ride of.  It is our deck.   We really haven''t had to worry to much about caterpillars smoking hookas on it.  lol</td>', 'Thank you to all who made comments.  My husband and I love to look for rocks.  We are avid rock hounds.  The stem of the mushroom was found on the Old Texas Trail.  26 miles North of Moorcroft, Wyoming.  And the top was found 7 miles away from the bottom. The rocks are mainly a concretion of mud.  We have a couple in our yard.  They make for a great decoration.   The mushroom is about a 1 1/2 feet in height.  The background was hard to get ride of.  It is our deck.   We really haven''t had to worry to much about caterpillars smoking hookas on it.  lol', '2002-05-07 08:34:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54478, 1218, 772, '<td valign="top">I understand the challenge concept in this photo, but the shot lacks any visual appeal...</td>', 'I understand the challenge concept in this photo, but the shot lacks any visual appeal...', '2002-04-29 05:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54479, 1218, 1024, '<td valign="top">This might have had more impact if it was taken at an angle instead of straight on.</td>', 'This might have had more impact if it was taken at an angle instead of straight on.', '2002-04-29 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54480, 1218, 656, '<td valign="top">A step in the right direction...subject just really doesn''t inspire - too much earth in the frame.  Maybe turning the camera to the left a bit, with the door less centered and more of the blocks in it could have worked better ?</td>', 'A step in the right direction...subject just really doesn''t inspire - too much earth in the frame.  Maybe turning the camera to the left a bit, with the door less centered and more of the blocks in it could have worked better ?', '2002-04-29 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
