(54549, 1224, 1040, '<td valign="top">Ships don''t have propellers, they have screws. Aeroplanes have propellers.</td>', 'Ships don''t have propellers, they have screws. Aeroplanes have propellers.', '2002-04-30 00:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54550, 1224, 640, '<td valign="top">somehow, i get the impression of looking down, not up. the composition seems too busy for my taste</td>', 'somehow, i get the impression of looking down, not up. the composition seems too busy for my taste', '2002-04-30 01:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54551, 1224, 1041, '<td valign="top">Hm.  Technique is fine. Challenge is fulfilled.   I guess it''s the subject that doesn''t do much for me.  Sorry.</td>', 'Hm.  Technique is fine. Challenge is fulfilled.   I guess it''s the subject that doesn''t do much for me.  Sorry.', '2002-04-30 12:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54552, 1224, 1135, '<td valign="top">What kind of ship is this on? Is this an electric motor? Very interesting Photo.</td>', 'What kind of ship is this on? Is this an electric motor? Very interesting Photo.', '2002-05-01 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54553, 1224, 1, '<td valign="top">I had no idea what I was looking at until I read the title.  The propeller is mostly blocked out by the black object on the left.  Nothing is represented by ground up it seems.</td>', 'I had no idea what I was looking at until I read the title.  The propeller is mostly blocked out by the black object on the left.  Nothing is represented by ground up it seems.', '2002-05-02 09:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54554, 1224, 797, '<td valign="top">very interesting subject! i''m wondering how the colors could''ve been brought out better. the blue, yellow and red is ideal for color contrasts.</td>', 'very interesting subject! i''m wondering how the colors could''ve been brought out better. the blue, yellow and red is ideal for color contrasts.', '2002-05-02 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54555, 1224, 933, '<td valign="top">Just does not reach out and grab me.</td>', 'Just does not reach out and grab me.', '2002-05-02 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54556, 1224, 637, '<td valign="top">from the ground up?????</td>', 'from the ground up?????', '2002-05-03 19:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54557, 1224, 1457, '<td valign="top">interesting concept, but not thought provoking</td>', 'interesting concept, but not thought provoking', '2002-05-04 22:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54558, 1229, 352, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot.  Looks like you need to clean your lens though.  Those dots in the sky look to be from that.</td>', 'Very nice shot.  Looks like you need to clean your lens though.  Those dots in the sky look to be from that.', '2002-04-29 01:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54559, 1229, 446, '<td valign="top">Beautiful concept.  I think the blown pixels in the sky part of the image is distracting.  Looks over sharpened.  Still, I have to call it a nice capture.</td>', 'Beautiful concept.  I think the blown pixels in the sky part of the image is distracting.  Looks over sharpened.  Still, I have to call it a nice capture.', '2002-04-29 02:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54560, 1229, 107, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the ladybug was wondering what in the world you were doing....</td>', 'I''m sure the ladybug was wondering what in the world you were doing....', '2002-04-29 04:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54561, 1229, 1024, '<td valign="top">This is a wonderful picture and meets the challenge perfectly.</td>', 'This is a wonderful picture and meets the challenge perfectly.', '2002-04-29 08:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54562, 1229, 656, '<td valign="top">well taken, with good texture &amp; colour in the leaf.  Just doesn''t seem to grab me.</td>', 'well taken, with good texture & colour in the leaf.  Just doesn''t seem to grab me.', '2002-04-29 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54563, 1229, 885, '<td valign="top">Great color, concept, why all the scratches?  Dirty macro lens?</td>', 'Great color, concept, why all the scratches?  Dirty macro lens?', '2002-04-29 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54564, 1229, 259, '<td valign="top">great idea and angle, however, the lens seems dirty or something.</td>', 'great idea and angle, however, the lens seems dirty or something.', '2002-04-29 10:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54565, 1229, 1037, '<td valign="top">It''s so cute!!! I love ladybugs. The lighting is great too. Somehow the composition doesn''t quite work for me though.</td>', 'It''s so cute!!! I love ladybugs. The lighting is great too. Somehow the composition doesn''t quite work for me though.', '2002-04-29 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54566, 1229, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an excellent macro shot!  It looks like there is a little ''noise'' in the blue sky area of the photo.  I can''t really tell what is causing it...</td>', 'This is an excellent macro shot!  It looks like there is a little ''noise'' in the blue sky area of the photo.  I can''t really tell what is causing it...', '2002-04-29 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54567, 1229, 509, '<td valign="top">I would have liked more detail on the lady bug, but under the conditions, this probably wasn''t possible (bright sky and all).  Good colors, but there also seems to be some dirt on your lense maybe?</td>', 'I would have liked more detail on the lady bug, but under the conditions, this probably wasn''t possible (bright sky and all).  Good colors, but there also seems to be some dirt on your lense maybe?', '2002-04-29 14:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54568, 1229, 813, '<td valign="top">Nice composition. Good macro work. It would be totally satisfying if the junk in the sky was not there.</td>', 'Nice composition. Good macro work. It would be totally satisfying if the junk in the sky was not there.', '2002-04-29 14:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54569, 1229, 544, '<td valign="top">Hmm... some things came out well on this photo, and some things didn''t. The looking up portion for the challenge is perfectly covered. The color in the picture is great - nice reds, blues, and greens. You have some great detail in the plant, with even a bit of fuzz for show on the tips. I don''t like the cropping on this image, though. Your sky is plain (not your fault, obviously, unless you had multiple nice days to attempt this shot) and seems to show off scratches (perhaps from your lense??)... As well, the bug isn''t really in focus. I mean, the image is sharp and detailed, not blurry, but there just is no real sense of texture to these objects, or depth. It''s a good picture overall, don''t get me wrong - there just is room for improvement.</td>', 'Hmm... some things came out well on this photo, and some things didn''t. The looking up portion for the challenge is perfectly covered. The color in the picture is great - nice reds, blues, and greens. You have some great detail in the plant, with even a bit of fuzz for show on the tips. I don''t like the cropping on this image, though. Your sky is plain (not your fault, obviously, unless you had multiple nice days to attempt this shot) and seems to show off scratches (perhaps from your lense??)... As well, the bug isn''t really in focus. I mean, the image is sharp and detailed, not blurry, but there just is no real sense of texture to these objects, or depth. It''s a good picture overall, don''t get me wrong - there just is room for improvement.', '2002-04-29 14:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54570, 1229, 1336, '<td valign="top">nice colors</td>', 'nice colors', '2002-04-29 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54571, 1229, 1379, '<td valign="top">Too cool!  The colors are simple, the focus is sharp, the elements rock... This pic is right on!</td>', 'Too cool!  The colors are simple, the focus is sharp, the elements rock... This pic is right on!', '2002-04-29 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54572, 1229, 962, '<td valign="top">Interesting composure.......</td>', 'Interesting composure.......', '2002-04-29 16:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54573, 1229, 1005, '<td valign="top">Very cool!  Very macro!</td>', 'Very cool!  Very macro!', '2002-04-29 17:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54574, 1229, 675, '<td valign="top">what are all those specks in the sky? this isn''t as sharp as i would like it, but you get good points for creativity</td>', 'what are all those specks in the sky? this isn''t as sharp as i would like it, but you get good points for creativity', '2002-04-29 18:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54575, 1229, 843, '<td valign="top">Great detail in the leaf. Is that a real bug???</td>', 'Great detail in the leaf. Is that a real bug???', '2002-04-29 21:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54576, 1229, 301, '<td valign="top">great viewpoint.  Almost like the bug is interested in you :)  Not sure if that''s stuff on your lens causing the streaks and white spots in the sky</td>', 'great viewpoint.  Almost like the bug is interested in you :)  Not sure if that''s stuff on your lens causing the streaks and white spots in the sky', '2002-04-30 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54577, 1229, 587, '<td valign="top">great shot!</td>', 'great shot!', '2002-04-30 07:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54578, 1229, 724, '<td valign="top">Wow!  NIce photo, do you need to clean your lense though?</td>', 'Wow!  NIce photo, do you need to clean your lense though?', '2002-04-30 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54579, 1229, 1209, '<td valign="top">Takes me back to junior high science class! Wonderful image, good composition.<br/></td>', 'Takes me back to junior high science class! Wonderful image, good composition.', '2002-04-30 16:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54580, 1229, 1211, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Must have been difficult to get just right.</td>', 'Great shot.  Must have been difficult to get just right.', '2002-04-30 17:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54581, 1229, 640, '<td valign="top">nice! the shadow on the leaf is quite cool</td>', 'nice! the shadow on the leaf is quite cool', '2002-05-01 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54582, 1229, 543, '<td valign="top">A really nice catch, especially that spash of red on the wing cover, but it could be better focused.  White speckles in the sky detract, as well.</td>', 'A really nice catch, especially that spash of red on the wing cover, but it could be better focused.  White speckles in the sky detract, as well.', '2002-05-01 10:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54583, 1229, 878, '<td valign="top">The leaf appears to be a bit out of focus and there are lots of noise on the blue sky but still in an interesting shot.  Original idea as well.</td>', 'The leaf appears to be a bit out of focus and there are lots of noise on the blue sky but still in an interesting shot.  Original idea as well.', '2002-05-01 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54584, 1229, 1041, '<td valign="top">Great photo composition.  Unfortunately, the sky looks a bit spotty, and the one spot on the leaf is distracting.</td>', 'Great photo composition.  Unfortunately, the sky looks a bit spotty, and the one spot on the leaf is distracting.', '2002-05-01 12:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54585, 1229, 310, '<td valign="top">This is very nice. The colors are great, as is the composition and your interpretation of the chalolenge theme is right on.</td>', 'This is very nice. The colors are great, as is the composition and your interpretation of the chalolenge theme is right on.', '2002-05-01 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54586, 1229, 748, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and lighting.  Looks like some spots on the lens.</td>', 'Nice perspective and lighting.  Looks like some spots on the lens.', '2002-05-01 15:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54587, 1229, 1078, '<td valign="top">very fun macro -- it feels the tiniest bit fuzzy -- is that due to the camera or focal plane?  the scratches/dust in the sky portion are kinda distracting -- and other than despeckle (which would make everything else that much fuzzier) I don''t know what you could do to fix them -- somebody give this person a medium format film camera with a serious macro lens and watch out  ;-)</td>', 'very fun macro -- it feels the tiniest bit fuzzy -- is that due to the camera or focal plane?  the scratches/dust in the sky portion are kinda distracting -- and other than despeckle (which would make everything else that much fuzzier) I don''t know what you could do to fix them -- somebody give this person a medium format film camera with a serious macro lens and watch out  ;-)', '2002-05-01 16:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54588, 1229, 901, '<td valign="top">nice photo</td>', 'nice photo', '2002-05-02 01:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54589, 1229, 1341, '<td valign="top">love The Idea, looks likes it make have been a bit difficult, because of the clarity. Still a great concept though, good job.................</td>', 'love The Idea, looks likes it make have been a bit difficult, because of the clarity. Still a great concept though, good job.................', '2002-05-02 03:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54590, 1229, 811, '<td valign="top">I like hte contrast of th blue and green, and that is one mean looking bug.  10</td>', 'I like hte contrast of th blue and green, and that is one mean looking bug.  10', '2002-05-02 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54591, 1229, 1191, '<td valign="top">You can almost see the angry expression on the bugs face?!  Brilliant</td>', 'You can almost see the angry expression on the bugs face?!  Brilliant', '2002-05-02 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54592, 1229, 330, '<td valign="top">Good shot. The white specks in the sky are a slight distraction.</td>', 'Good shot. The white specks in the sky are a slight distraction.', '2002-05-03 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54593, 1229, 637, '<td valign="top">Nice colors and lighting and shadow</td>', 'Nice colors and lighting and shadow', '2002-05-03 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54594, 1229, 1202, '<td valign="top">A good angle on this one.   I think that if the bugs head were better exposed you would find an invasion of privacy look on his face. " None of the other guys ever looked at me from there,look".</td>', 'A good angle on this one.   I think that if the bugs head were better exposed you would find an invasion of privacy look on his face. " None of the other guys ever looked at me from there,look".', '2002-05-04 08:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54595, 1229, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice looking shot.  I would''ve liked to seen it rotated though.</td>', 'Nice looking shot.  I would''ve liked to seen it rotated though.', '2002-05-04 11:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54596, 1229, 142, '<td valign="top">This is cute.  I like how you have brought out the details on the leaf.</td>', 'This is cute.  I like how you have brought out the details on the leaf.', '2002-05-04 16:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54597, 1229, 1457, '<td valign="top">nice Idea, ok comp, horrible quality!</td>', 'nice Idea, ok comp, horrible quality!', '2002-05-04 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54598, 1229, 1469, '<td valign="top">Amazing shot!  Great job!</td>', 'Amazing shot!  Great job!', '2002-05-05 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54599, 1229, 280, '<td valign="top">I really can not believe this came so high! The ladybug was on the other side of a piece of glass, which wasnt very clean, which explains the speckles. I was quite disappointed as I didnt think this would have affected the photos quality quite as badly as it did, but I submitted it anyway. And am now glad I did. Thank you all for your comments. If you have any questions dont hesitate to e-mail me.</td>', 'I really can not believe this came so high! The ladybug was on the other side of a piece of glass, which wasnt very clean, which explains the speckles. I was quite disappointed as I didnt think this would have affected the photos quality quite as badly as it did, but I submitted it anyway. And am now glad I did. Thank you all for your comments. If you have any questions dont hesitate to e-mail me.', '2002-05-06 05:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54600, 1234, 107, '<td valign="top">better him than me.  no amount of money would get me doing that... and the shot?? fantastic.</td>', 'better him than me.  no amount of money would get me doing that... and the shot?? fantastic.', '2002-04-29 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54601, 1234, 92, '<td valign="top">What a great choice ! Nice find !!!!</td>', 'What a great choice ! Nice find !!!!', '2002-04-29 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54602, 1234, 675, '<td valign="top">good interpretation of the challengs</td>', 'good interpretation of the challengs', '2002-04-29 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54603, 1234, 656, '<td valign="top">very dramatic</td>', 'very dramatic', '2002-04-29 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54604, 1234, 259, '<td valign="top">good for a change.</td>', 'good for a change.', '2002-04-29 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54605, 1234, 509, '<td valign="top">Good colors.  If sharpening was used, it was overly done in my opinion.</td>', 'Good colors.  If sharpening was used, it was overly done in my opinion.', '2002-04-29 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54606, 1234, 813, '<td valign="top">Nice composition, the diagonal lines add a tension that helps with the subject matter.</td>', 'Nice composition, the diagonal lines add a tension that helps with the subject matter.', '2002-04-29 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54607, 1234, 327, '<td valign="top">Yikes, would hate that job.</td>', 'Yikes, would hate that job.', '2002-04-29 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54608, 1234, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot... I like the perspective here.  The photo seems a little grainy.. This is possibly caused by digital zoom or cropping out a small portion of a larger image... nice shot!</td>', 'This is a nice shot... I like the perspective here.  The photo seems a little grainy.. This is possibly caused by digital zoom or cropping out a small portion of a larger image... nice shot!', '2002-04-29 22:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
