(54639, 1235, 156, '<td valign="top">nicely composed but it appears to have been taken from a standing position versus from the ground...unless the camera was at ground level and you zoomed?</td>', 'nicely composed but it appears to have been taken from a standing position versus from the ground...unless the camera was at ground level and you zoomed?', '2002-05-01 12:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
