(54656, 1237, 301, '<td valign="top">I love the subject of this photo.  I''m not sure whether the focus is clearly on the flower.  Maybe zooming in closer to fill more of the photo with the flower would make it work better for me</td>', 'I love the subject of this photo.  I''m not sure whether the focus is clearly on the flower.  Maybe zooming in closer to fill more of the photo with the flower would make it work better for me', '2002-05-01 08:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
