(54664, 1238, 885, '<td valign="top">The contrast between red and green is nice, as is the composition.  Of course, I would have preferred blue sky instead of white, but that was probably beyond your control.  Maybe a little less depth of field too, if you could have.</td>', 'The contrast between red and green is nice, as is the composition.  Of course, I would have preferred blue sky instead of white, but that was probably beyond your control.  Maybe a little less depth of field too, if you could have.', '2002-04-29 09:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
