(54673, 1238, 1034, '<td valign="top">eep!  screws with my eyes a little, but it''s pretty kewl.</td>', 'eep!  screws with my eyes a little, but it''s pretty kewl.', '2002-04-29 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54674, 1238, 675, '<td valign="top">nice job meeting the challenge</td>', 'nice job meeting the challenge', '2002-04-29 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54675, 1238, 724, '<td valign="top">I am the other flag photo in this challenge and I hope you aren''t getting the nasty  comments that I am.  I suppose it will all come clean in the end!  It is a GREAT day when you can look up and see this flag waving!  Nice composition.</td>', 'I am the other flag photo in this challenge and I hope you aren''t getting the nasty  comments that I am.  I suppose it will all come clean in the end!  It is a GREAT day when you can look up and see this flag waving!  Nice composition.', '2002-04-29 21:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54676, 1238, 1066, '<td valign="top">A nice flag shot although I think we are getting flagged out I like the aspect and lines here.  I ms seeing a few chromatic articfacts coming through the tree leaves.  <br/><br/>Shooting sunlight through tight spots , especially tree leaves is one of the hardest things to do in digital.  Digital cameras, except for maybe the best ones of $700 or more, seem to have a hard time with adding chromatic atifacts to edges in when backlit heavily.  It tended to distract slightly ffrom the subject.  Still agood photo</td>', 'A nice flag shot although I think we are getting flagged out I like the aspect and lines here.  I ms seeing a few chromatic articfacts coming through the tree leaves.  Shooting sunlight through tight spots , especially tree leaves is one of the hardest things to do in digital.  Digital cameras, except for maybe the best ones of $700 or more, seem to have a hard time with adding chromatic atifacts to edges in when backlit heavily.  It tended to distract slightly ffrom the subject.  Still agood photo', '2002-05-01 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54677, 1238, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m getting dizzy just looking at this - great angle.  One of my top 10 photos!</td>', 'I''m getting dizzy just looking at this - great angle.  One of my top 10 photos!', '2002-05-01 12:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
