(54732, 1239, 4492, '<td valign="top">Great color and composition. I agree with lolly_gagger, you definitely should have received highr than a 6.8. One of the best on this site.</td>', 'Great color and composition. I agree with lolly_gagger, you definitely should have received highr than a 6.8. One of the best on this site.', '2002-10-10 04:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(54733, 1244, 1204, '<td valign="top">Thanx, all who commented.  I admit that this really isn''t a good photo and it deserved the average grade of 4,383.  I was a bit frustrated though that nobody seemed to notice that the "from the ground up" theme was in the subject rather than the camera angle.  I also have to say that there wasn''t much creativity in this challenge altogether.  I first shot a rather boring scyscraper photo and didn''t really shoot this with the challenge in mind.<br/><br/>Quite few commented on the purple abberations.  Partly this was deliberate.  In photoshop I removed all yellow tones from the picture which I thought made it a bit more original and gave it a "otherworldly feel" as someone put it.  But perhaps I overdid it...</td>', 'Thanx, all who commented.  I admit that this really isn''t a good photo and it deserved the average grade of 4,383.  I was a bit frustrated though that nobody seemed to notice that the "from the ground up" theme was in the subject rather than the camera angle.  I also have to say that there wasn''t much creativity in this challenge altogether.  I first shot a rather boring scyscraper photo and didn''t really shoot this with the challenge in mind.Quite few commented on the purple abberations.  Partly this was deliberate.  In photoshop I removed all yellow tones from the picture which I thought made it a bit more original and gave it a "otherworldly feel" as someone put it.  But perhaps I overdid it...', '2002-05-06 17:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
