(54748, 1244, 1041, '<td valign="top">Even though the angle of the photograph is up, it doesn''t convey to me the impression that the camera was on or close to the ground.  I know from some of my photos that it can be on the ground, and not look like it, but I think the final impression conveyed is what counts.</td>', 'Even though the angle of the photograph is up, it doesn''t convey to me the impression that the camera was on or close to the ground.  I know from some of my photos that it can be on the ground, and not look like it, but I think the final impression conveyed is what counts.', '2002-04-30 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
