(54752, 1244, 1078, '<td valign="top">some of the colors on the statue seem strange -- is this something natural to the statue, something your camera did, or something that happened in the computer?  While some cotton candy clouds in the background would have been cool, that''s just a completely personal preference thing.</td>', 'some of the colors on the statue seem strange -- is this something natural to the statue, something your camera did, or something that happened in the computer?  While some cotton candy clouds in the background would have been cool, that''s just a completely personal preference thing.', '2002-05-01 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
