(54771, 1249, 1175, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition of the sky and clouds.  I really like this one.</td>', 'Beautiful composition of the sky and clouds.  I really like this one.', '2002-04-29 14:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54772, 1249, 835, '<td valign="top">I love the sky.  It would have been better if a larger portion of the kite string could have been outside of the camera view because the out of focus portion really takes away from the wonderful backdrop.</td>', 'I love the sky.  It would have been better if a larger portion of the kite string could have been outside of the camera view because the out of focus portion really takes away from the wonderful backdrop.', '2002-04-29 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54773, 1249, 544, '<td valign="top">I think you have your focus reversed on this picture. The focal point of the picture IS the kite, but I think you need your up close string to be very focused and detailed, and the kite can afford to be blurry. The clouds as well - I''m not sure why you have them as sharp as they are. They look nice, but they''re just a touch of sharpern or two removed from perfect, and have crossed over into distracting. The same goes for the rich blue sky... just sharpened one or two times too many. This picture is well composed though, and very creative, so that adds a good bit of points into it. Nicely done :) and fun, too!</td>', 'I think you have your focus reversed on this picture. The focal point of the picture IS the kite, but I think you need your up close string to be very focused and detailed, and the kite can afford to be blurry. The clouds as well - I''m not sure why you have them as sharp as they are. They look nice, but they''re just a touch of sharpern or two removed from perfect, and have crossed over into distracting. The same goes for the rich blue sky... just sharpened one or two times too many. This picture is well composed though, and very creative, so that adds a good bit of points into it. Nicely done :) and fun, too!', '2002-04-29 14:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54774, 1249, 327, '<td valign="top">Great idea! <br/>A little too sharp or not sharp enough?<br/>Beautiful sky, I like it!</td>', 'Great idea! A little too sharp or not sharp enough?Beautiful sky, I like it!', '2002-04-29 14:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
