(54888, 1254, 1, '<td valign="top">I wish the bike/biker could fill more of the frame.  The shot is very nice though, the read outfit goes great with the rest of the image.  Good lighting.</td>', 'I wish the bike/biker could fill more of the frame.  The shot is very nice though, the read outfit goes great with the rest of the image.  Good lighting.', '2002-05-03 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
