(54985, 1260, 259, '<td valign="top">great closeup and change in ideas</td>', 'great closeup and change in ideas', '2002-04-29 11:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54986, 1260, 509, '<td valign="top">You had your name in the title when you uploaded this, unless I''m mistaken, Jason Cuddy?  It showed up when the page loaded....anyway back to the picture, nice shot of a lock, I would have liked it better if more of the door was in focus</td>', 'You had your name in the title when you uploaded this, unless I''m mistaken, Jason Cuddy?  It showed up when the page loaded....anyway back to the picture, nice shot of a lock, I would have liked it better if more of the door was in focus', '2002-04-29 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54987, 1260, 544, '<td valign="top">Ooooooh! Very very very good! Sometimes I think that I am the only one who really appreciates manual focus - getting the foreground in heavy focus, and everything outside of that focal point blurry. Great great job! It took me a moment to catch on to what was happening, but your picture instantly grabbed my interest, and made me want to figure things out. Great texture on the hinge and padlock, and the door as well. The framing could have been just SLIGHTLY tighter, not too much, to keep the ceiling from filling up as much of the shot as it does. Nice overall :)</td>', 'Ooooooh! Very very very good! Sometimes I think that I am the only one who really appreciates manual focus - getting the foreground in heavy focus, and everything outside of that focal point blurry. Great great job! It took me a moment to catch on to what was happening, but your picture instantly grabbed my interest, and made me want to figure things out. Great texture on the hinge and padlock, and the door as well. The framing could have been just SLIGHTLY tighter, not too much, to keep the ceiling from filling up as much of the shot as it does. Nice overall :)', '2002-04-29 14:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54988, 1260, 1336, '<td valign="top">very unique.  the reflection of the light on the hinge is a nice touch</td>', 'very unique.  the reflection of the light on the hinge is a nice touch', '2002-04-29 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54989, 1260, 327, '<td valign="top">I like this, needs to be a little lighter to see detail.</td>', 'I like this, needs to be a little lighter to see detail.', '2002-04-29 16:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54990, 1260, 724, '<td valign="top">What a great perspective!  It looks like there is too much something going on with the hinge, over saturation or something?  I wish I could be more help there.</td>', 'What a great perspective!  It looks like there is too much something going on with the hinge, over saturation or something?  I wish I could be more help there.', '2002-04-29 21:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54991, 1260, 1344, '<td valign="top">Artsy, cool, nice DOF!</td>', 'Artsy, cool, nice DOF!', '2002-04-29 22:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54992, 1260, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice perspective.  I''m not sure if more depth of field would make this shot more appealing or not...</td>', 'This is a nice perspective.  I''m not sure if more depth of field would make this shot more appealing or not...', '2002-04-30 05:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54993, 1260, 301, '<td valign="top">great macro.  To be picky, I don''t like the light in the top corner - could''ve been cropped</td>', 'great macro.  To be picky, I don''t like the light in the top corner - could''ve been cropped', '2002-04-30 07:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54994, 1260, 1175, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Only thing I would do different is angle the camera a little or raise or lower the subject to the third''s line.</td>', 'Very cool.  Only thing I would do different is angle the camera a little or raise or lower the subject to the third''s line.', '2002-04-30 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54995, 1260, 885, '<td valign="top">I do like it, though I didn''t think I did in thumbnail.  Good depth of field.  The color is very subtle and softens it up a bit, but I think in black and white it would have been too harsh, as it''s not a very warm-fuzzy subject.  Well done.</td>', 'I do like it, though I didn''t think I did in thumbnail.  Good depth of field.  The color is very subtle and softens it up a bit, but I think in black and white it would have been too harsh, as it''s not a very warm-fuzzy subject.  Well done.', '2002-04-30 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54996, 1260, 888, '<td valign="top">nice but it doesn''t say "from the ground up to me", it could quite easily been taken on a horizontal surface</td>', 'nice but it doesn''t say "from the ground up to me", it could quite easily been taken on a horizontal surface', '2002-04-30 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54997, 1260, 543, '<td valign="top">Probably better in B/W, and cropped down to a 2:3 aspect ratio (can''t decide if I like it better chopped from the top or bottom).  Still, quite good.</td>', 'Probably better in B/W, and cropped down to a 2:3 aspect ratio (can''t decide if I like it better chopped from the top or bottom).  Still, quite good.', '2002-05-01 04:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54998, 1260, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice.  Would be even nicer if all of the lock (including cast iron right above it) was in focus.</td>', 'Nice.  Would be even nicer if all of the lock (including cast iron right above it) was in focus.', '2002-05-01 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(54999, 1260, 714, '<td valign="top">Awesome!!!</td>', 'Awesome!!!', '2002-05-02 00:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55000, 1260, 640, '<td valign="top">this has real depth. very well done. I would have prefered to see the board at more of an angle(tilting up) to give more of a feeling of height</td>', 'this has real depth. very well done. I would have prefered to see the board at more of an angle(tilting up) to give more of a feeling of height', '2002-05-02 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55001, 1260, 739, '<td valign="top">Can''t get my brain to interpret this as a vertical shot instead of just a horizontal shot.  Strange...</td>', 'Can''t get my brain to interpret this as a vertical shot instead of just a horizontal shot.  Strange...', '2002-05-03 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55002, 1260, 637, '<td valign="top">Aesthetically ok, but not very interesting.</td>', 'Aesthetically ok, but not very interesting.', '2002-05-03 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55003, 1260, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very sharp!</td>', 'Very sharp!', '2002-05-03 21:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55004, 1260, 1457, '<td valign="top">great angle, placement, awesome</td>', 'great angle, placement, awesome', '2002-05-04 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55005, 1260, 1070, '<td valign="top">well it meets the challenge perfectly, the green light gives an interesting effect</td>', 'well it meets the challenge perfectly, the green light gives an interesting effect', '2002-05-05 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55006, 1260, 2, '<td valign="top">I really like this photo.  Awesome use of space, and cool, soft colors.</td>', 'I really like this photo.  Awesome use of space, and cool, soft colors.', '2002-05-05 13:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55007, 1260, 1191, '<td valign="top">Nice imaginative use of veryday objects.  Great</td>', 'Nice imaginative use of veryday objects.  Great', '2002-05-05 17:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55008, 1260, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot.  The colors are a bit bland though.</td>', 'Cool shot.  The colors are a bit bland though.', '2002-05-05 23:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55009, 1263, 205, '<td valign="top">This is the guy thats been giving me all these problems? son of a bitch lets kill him!</td>', 'This is the guy thats been giving me all these problems? son of a bitch lets kill him!', '2002-04-29 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55010, 1263, 1024, '<td valign="top">Great angle!</td>', 'Great angle!', '2002-04-29 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55011, 1263, 656, '<td valign="top">good choice for B&amp;W, lots of nice textures and a boring sky, make the B&amp;W work well!</td>', 'good choice for B&W, lots of nice textures and a boring sky, make the B&W work well!', '2002-04-29 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55012, 1263, 259, '<td valign="top">if you are going to take photos of statues this is the way to go.  good job.</td>', 'if you are going to take photos of statues this is the way to go.  good job.', '2002-04-29 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55013, 1263, 714, '<td valign="top">very nice.  Every part of the pic seems to be crisp and in focus.</td>', 'very nice.  Every part of the pic seems to be crisp and in focus.', '2002-04-29 12:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55014, 1263, 509, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Good use of black and white to convey the historical importance of this figure.  I''m no history buff, so at the risk of sounding like an idiot, this is Lenin, correct?</td>', 'Very nice.  Good use of black and white to convey the historical importance of this figure.  I''m no history buff, so at the risk of sounding like an idiot, this is Lenin, correct?', '2002-04-29 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55015, 1263, 962, '<td valign="top">Good shot but too much body mass. Would be good if you can show more of the face.</td>', 'Good shot but too much body mass. Would be good if you can show more of the face.', '2002-04-29 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55016, 1263, 675, '<td valign="top">good shot</td>', 'good shot', '2002-04-29 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55017, 1263, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, b/w is fitting.  I don''t like the title tho =P</td>', 'Cool shot, b/w is fitting.  I don''t like the title tho =P', '2002-04-29 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55018, 1263, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice texture.  Good use of black and white.  Nice framing.  Technically, I wonder if the levels should be adjusted because I don''t see any true ''white'' highlights, but that might have made the sky white too.  The greyness might actually work though, it makes it look more ''oppressive''.</td>', 'Nice texture.  Good use of black and white.  Nice framing.  Technically, I wonder if the levels should be adjusted because I don''t see any true ''white'' highlights, but that might have made the sky white too.  The greyness might actually work though, it makes it look more ''oppressive''.', '2002-04-30 08:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55019, 1263, 459, '<td valign="top">Great framing.  Got just enough of th head to show what statue is.  Evokes emotion of being at this guy''s mercy.</td>', 'Great framing.  Got just enough of th head to show what statue is.  Evokes emotion of being at this guy''s mercy.', '2002-04-30 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55020, 1263, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very well executed photo.. I''m impressed!</td>', 'This is a very well executed photo.. I''m impressed!', '2002-04-30 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55021, 1263, 446, '<td valign="top">Cool.  Very powerful image.  Greyscale works well here.  Great depth of field and sharpness.  Very natural looking.  I can imagine the sculpturer "chipping away" to create this job.  Keep it up!</td>', 'Cool.  Very powerful image.  Greyscale works well here.  Great depth of field and sharpness.  Very natural looking.  I can imagine the sculpturer "chipping away" to create this job.  Keep it up!', '2002-04-30 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55022, 1263, 1066, '<td valign="top">I like this a lot but there seems to a bit of a flatness to it.  Maybe if you would have left this in RGB/color mode and desaturated you could have given the subject a bit more contrast/depth.  The worst way to do black and white transfers of color shots is to go to grayscale.  Not saying this is how you did this but for some reason digital loses something in B&amp;W unless you leave the photo in color mode and desaturate, perhaps leaving some tonal shift in it as well..</td>', 'I like this a lot but there seems to a bit of a flatness to it.  Maybe if you would have left this in RGB/color mode and desaturated you could have given the subject a bit more contrast/depth.  The worst way to do black and white transfers of color shots is to go to grayscale.  Not saying this is how you did this but for some reason digital loses something in B&W unless you leave the photo in color mode and desaturate, perhaps leaving some tonal shift in it as well..', '2002-05-01 08:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55023, 1263, 543, '<td valign="top">Good angle, and nice, moody tone.</td>', 'Good angle, and nice, moody tone.', '2002-05-01 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55024, 1263, 1041, '<td valign="top">Good angle and the b&amp;w together with the caption really brings the point across.</td>', 'Good angle and the b&w together with the caption really brings the point across.', '2002-05-01 12:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55025, 1263, 790, '<td valign="top">powerful ... more of the face please.</td>', 'powerful ... more of the face please.', '2002-05-01 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55026, 1263, 933, '<td valign="top">Good B&amp;W shot.</td>', 'Good B&W shot.', '2002-05-02 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55027, 1263, 330, '<td valign="top">Works well in B&amp;W. Could you have taken it from an even lower angle?</td>', 'Works well in B&W. Could you have taken it from an even lower angle?', '2002-05-03 07:18:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(55028, 1263, 637, '<td valign="top">Hi Grandpa!  Unique image. Good detail.</td>', 'Hi Grandpa!  Unique image. Good detail.', '2002-05-03 19:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55029, 1263, 1202, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, good clarity, and from the ground up.   Nice B/W effect.</td>', 'Nice angle, good clarity, and from the ground up.   Nice B/W effect.', '2002-05-04 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55030, 1263, 1070, '<td valign="top">I like the black and white on it.  There is lots of contrast as well.</td>', 'I like the black and white on it.  There is lots of contrast as well.', '2002-05-05 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55031, 1265, 1360, '<td valign="top">This is a rather inspirational pic!</td>', 'This is a rather inspirational pic!', '2002-04-29 02:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55032, 1265, 352, '<td valign="top">Sweet!</td>', 'Sweet!', '2002-04-29 02:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55033, 1265, 92, '<td valign="top">Oh My ! What beauty !!!!</td>', 'Oh My ! What beauty !!!!', '2002-04-29 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55034, 1265, 656, '<td valign="top">well posed</td>', 'well posed', '2002-04-29 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55035, 1265, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice photograph.  I wish you had conjured a nice title to go along with it :)  The jet contrail in the moonlight is really nice... as is the light in the window.  A small addition of *contrast* may have added to the silhouetting effect on this shot... maybe a little reduction in brightness as well... Good job!</td>', 'This is a very nice photograph.  I wish you had conjured a nice title to go along with it :)  The jet contrail in the moonlight is really nice... as is the light in the window.  A small addition of *contrast* may have added to the silhouetting effect on this shot... maybe a little reduction in brightness as well... Good job!', '2002-04-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55036, 1265, 259, '<td valign="top">very cool photo, although it seems a little washed out, and would have been really nice if the blacks were sharper.</td>', 'very cool photo, although it seems a little washed out, and would have been really nice if the blacks were sharper.', '2002-04-29 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55037, 1265, 714, '<td valign="top">Good photo.  Is that white dot above his head a star?  Little rebel.</td>', 'Good photo.  Is that white dot above his head a star?  Little rebel.', '2002-04-29 12:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55038, 1265, 544, '<td valign="top">One thing I think you did well on this photo is the sky, followed by the moon or sun, as it were. I also like the light up in the house, with all of the other lights off, and the photo itself dark in nature. It''s a very calming or relaxing picture, with just a touch of mystery from the house light, and a splash of light on the subject''s face. However, although I think it looks good, I wonder if there is too much distraction by having the two light sources. Also, the airplane trail seems a bit of a distraction, as does the solitary star (?). It does urge you to look up, but with the way you have framed this picture so nicely, you don''t need it. It seems excessive. The only other thing I felt was missing was the texture in the sky. I''m not quite sure why, though. It just feels like it is missing something. Overall, this is a fine submission.</td>', 'One thing I think you did well on this photo is the sky, followed by the moon or sun, as it were. I also like the light up in the house, with all of the other lights off, and the photo itself dark in nature. It''s a very calming or relaxing picture, with just a touch of mystery from the house light, and a splash of light on the subject''s face. However, although I think it looks good, I wonder if there is too much distraction by having the two light sources. Also, the airplane trail seems a bit of a distraction, as does the solitary star (?). It does urge you to look up, but with the way you have framed this picture so nicely, you don''t need it. It seems excessive. The only other thing I felt was missing was the texture in the sky. I''m not quite sure why, though. It just feels like it is missing something. Overall, this is a fine submission.', '2002-04-29 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55039, 1265, 813, '<td valign="top">I realize it''s tough to get a shot like this sharply focussed, especially with a digital camera. But that''s just what this picture needs.</td>', 'I realize it''s tough to get a shot like this sharply focussed, especially with a digital camera. But that''s just what this picture needs.', '2002-04-29 14:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55040, 1265, 1379, '<td valign="top">Very very cool composition.  That jet trail makes the photo.</td>', 'Very very cool composition.  That jet trail makes the photo.', '2002-04-29 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55041, 1265, 885, '<td valign="top">the black isn''t quite black...adjusting the levels in a Photoshop-like program might have helped.  The composition is nice, but the two yellow lights are distracting.  Couldn''t you have asked your neighbor to turn off their lights for a second while you took a picture? ;-)</td>', 'the black isn''t quite black...adjusting the levels in a Photoshop-like program might have helped.  The composition is nice, but the two yellow lights are distracting.  Couldn''t you have asked your neighbor to turn off their lights for a second while you took a picture? ;-)', '2002-04-29 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55042, 1265, 962, '<td valign="top">Clever composition............</td>', 'Clever composition............', '2002-04-29 16:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55043, 1265, 675, '<td valign="top">nice break from the cliche pictures, and nice composition</td>', 'nice break from the cliche pictures, and nice composition', '2002-04-29 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55044, 1265, 843, '<td valign="top">Nice stop motion on that flea jumping off their head!</td>', 'Nice stop motion on that flea jumping off their head!', '2002-04-29 22:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55045, 1265, 536, '<td valign="top">This is fantastic and I hope you''re getting high marks.  The "noise" in the photo gives the sky a textured look almost like it is printed while the building have a painted look.  Lots of good stuff in this photo that makes it art. Excellent colors, mood and interest.  I can''t wait to ask how you created this look.</td>', 'This is fantastic and I hope you''re getting high marks.  The "noise" in the photo gives the sky a textured look almost like it is printed while the building have a painted look.  Lots of good stuff in this photo that makes it art. Excellent colors, mood and interest.  I can''t wait to ask how you created this look.', '2002-04-29 23:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55046, 1265, 1209, '<td valign="top">Interesting sillouette. Is he gazing at the moon, or "Her" window? Thought provoking. Could be a bit sharper.</td>', 'Interesting sillouette. Is he gazing at the moon, or "Her" window? Thought provoking. Could be a bit sharper.', '2002-04-30 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55047, 1265, 459, '<td valign="top">Great composition.  The yellow window, the bit of light on the face, the contrail, and the bit of orange sky are perfect.  If the moon could be turned down a bit, this would be an absolutely perfect shot.  Still, it''s teriffic.</td>', 'Great composition.  The yellow window, the bit of light on the face, the contrail, and the bit of orange sky are perfect.  If the moon could be turned down a bit, this would be an absolutely perfect shot.  Still, it''s teriffic.', '2002-04-30 10:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55048, 1265, 640, '<td valign="top">I like this! Captivating!</td>', 'I like this! Captivating!', '2002-04-30 11:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55049, 1265, 1019, '<td valign="top">Good Composition</td>', 'Good Composition', '2002-04-30 12:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55050, 1265, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice shot.</td>', 'Nice shot.', '2002-04-30 17:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55051, 1265, 387, '<td valign="top">Good shot. The only thing I''d have changed was a level adjustment to darken the foreground.</td>', 'Good shot. The only thing I''d have changed was a level adjustment to darken the foreground.', '2002-04-30 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55052, 1265, 543, '<td valign="top">Very nice.  Took a while to decide, but I like the looming angle of the houses.  That one lit window was a great bit of luck.  I''d like the person''s silhouette a little sharper, but I know it''s hard to focus in the dark like that.  Nicely done.</td>', 'Very nice.  Took a while to decide, but I like the looming angle of the houses.  That one lit window was a great bit of luck.  I''d like the person''s silhouette a little sharper, but I know it''s hard to focus in the dark like that.  Nicely done.', '2002-05-01 04:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55053, 1265, 1066, '<td valign="top">I like this photo a lot and probably have it as on of my 5 favorite shots.  Did you try putting some levels on this?  I downloaded the phot and just did a simple auto level and cleared up the washed out look of the image.  by doing that it got rid of that whitish cast on you blacks.  <br/><br/>Simple rule I follow.  Look at the blackest part of any photo and make that your baseline black.  Meaning black as black ink, perfect, no tint or overcast.  That will help set the contrast for a photo.  Also, did you do a lot of sharpening or cropping, I seem to get a lot or speckling in this photo.<br/><br/>I like this photo a lot though and rated it so.</td>', 'I like this photo a lot and probably have it as on of my 5 favorite shots.  Did you try putting some levels on this?  I downloaded the phot and just did a simple auto level and cleared up the washed out look of the image.  by doing that it got rid of that whitish cast on you blacks.  Simple rule I follow.  Look at the blackest part of any photo and make that your baseline black.  Meaning black as black ink, perfect, no tint or overcast.  That will help set the contrast for a photo.  Also, did you do a lot of sharpening or cropping, I seem to get a lot or speckling in this photo.I like this photo a lot though and rated it so.', '2002-05-01 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55054, 1265, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, good composition.  The moon is a little too bright, it dominates the picture too much.  Would also be better w/out the jet trail.</td>', 'Nice idea, good composition.  The moon is a little too bright, it dominates the picture too much.  Would also be better w/out the jet trail.', '2002-05-01 11:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55055, 1265, 878, '<td valign="top">Nice concept for this shot.  Full moon too.</td>', 'Nice concept for this shot.  Full moon too.', '2002-05-01 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55056, 1265, 748, '<td valign="top">This is really good.  One of my faves.</td>', 'This is really good.  One of my faves.', '2002-05-01 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55057, 1265, 280, '<td valign="top">This shot may benefit from some levels adjustments to add more contrast, apart from that a good shot with lots of atmosphere.</td>', 'This shot may benefit from some levels adjustments to add more contrast, apart from that a good shot with lots of atmosphere.', '2002-05-01 17:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55058, 1265, 244, '<td valign="top">I love the scene that this picture paints for the viewers imagination.  Very imaginative use of the theme.<br/></td>', 'I love the scene that this picture paints for the viewers imagination.  Very imaginative use of the theme.', '2002-05-01 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55059, 1265, 790, '<td valign="top">sharper please</td>', 'sharper please', '2002-05-01 22:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55060, 1265, 1341, '<td valign="top">Very Nice photo</td>', 'Very Nice photo', '2002-05-02 13:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55061, 1265, 933, '<td valign="top">Neat photo. Pretty nice composition.</td>', 'Neat photo. Pretty nice composition.', '2002-05-02 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55062, 1265, 330, '<td valign="top">I like this picture and I''m sure it was a challenge technically.</td>', 'I like this picture and I''m sure it was a challenge technically.', '2002-05-03 08:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55063, 1265, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice silhouette of the person, as well as the houses.  The moon, maybe a little over exposed.  I believe a filter could fix that up.</td>', 'Nice silhouette of the person, as well as the houses.  The moon, maybe a little over exposed.  I believe a filter could fix that up.', '2002-05-03 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55064, 1265, 749, '<td valign="top">A first glance very simple, but with hidden complexity and detail - just beautiful</td>', 'A first glance very simple, but with hidden complexity and detail - just beautiful', '2002-05-05 09:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55065, 1265, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2002-05-05 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55066, 1265, 301, '<td valign="top">Thanx 4 all the comments<br/><br/>Looked up on the way home from the station and saw the moon ... thought "That''s what I wanna shoot".  This was taken from the roof of my downstairs neighbour. The lit window is from my flat.  I liked having the one light on (just lucky that everyone else hadn''t gotten home and turned their lights on) ... seemed to add something extra to the silhouttes and cast a tiny bit of light on my face. Contrail just happend to be there when I got out onto the roof and started shooting.  Camera is on a mini tripod below the ledge I''m sitting on.  Set the timer and ran around a few times in different poses (standing, sitting, holding the moon etc)<br/><br/>Had a lot of troubles adjusting levels (as comments have suggested).  Main reason for the photo looking washed out was because my original (auto-levels with some manual adjustments) looked fine before submitting, but really dark after - you could hardly tell sky from the silhouttes.  After trying a few times, I gave up and turned up the brightness and contrast which caused the moon to grow a fair bit.<br/><br/>Still not sure whether that''s a star above my head.  I thought it may have been a hot pixel, but tests afterwards have proved otherwise</td>', 'Thanx 4 all the commentsLooked up on the way home from the station and saw the moon ... thought "That''s what I wanna shoot".  This was taken from the roof of my downstairs neighbour. The lit window is from my flat.  I liked having the one light on (just lucky that everyone else hadn''t gotten home and turned their lights on) ... seemed to add something extra to the silhouttes and cast a tiny bit of light on my face. Contrail just happend to be there when I got out onto the roof and started shooting.  Camera is on a mini tripod below the ledge I''m sitting on.  Set the timer and ran around a few times in different poses (standing, sitting, holding the moon etc)Had a lot of troubles adjusting levels (as comments have suggested).  Main reason for the photo looking washed out was because my original (auto-levels with some manual adjustments) looked fine before submitting, but really dark after - you could hardly tell sky from the silhouttes.  After trying a few times, I gave up and turned up the brightness and contrast which caused the moon to grow a fair bit.Still not sure whether that''s a star above my head.  I thought it may have been a hot pixel, but tests afterwards have proved otherwise', '2002-05-07 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55067, 1267, 107, '<td valign="top">This is absolutely fantastic.</td>', 'This is absolutely fantastic.', '2002-04-29 04:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55068, 1267, 1175, '<td valign="top">Cool. I love macrophotography.  Wonderful texture.</td>', 'Cool. I love macrophotography.  Wonderful texture.', '2002-04-29 06:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55069, 1267, 92, '<td valign="top">I think this is cool but had to look at it for a long time to figure out what it was due to extreme blur. Maybe if it was showing more detail or the top not so cropped:) Nice idea and capture all the same.</td>', 'I think this is cool but had to look at it for a long time to figure out what it was due to extreme blur. Maybe if it was showing more detail or the top not so cropped:) Nice idea and capture all the same.', '2002-04-29 09:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
