(55074, 1267, 772, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot!  If you had backed away from the tire a little, you may have been able to provide sharper focus in the bottom of this frame.  This photo may have also been more dramatic in a vertical orientation with more tire showing...</td>', 'Very nice shot!  If you had backed away from the tire a little, you may have been able to provide sharper focus in the bottom of this frame.  This photo may have also been more dramatic in a vertical orientation with more tire showing...', '2002-04-29 11:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55075, 1267, 885, '<td valign="top">Oh, it''s a bike.  Nice graphic look.  Seems to be ever so slightly tilted to the left?</td>', 'Oh, it''s a bike.  Nice graphic look.  Seems to be ever so slightly tilted to the left?', '2002-04-29 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55076, 1267, 544, '<td valign="top">I have no idea what this picture is of, but that doesn''t really matter at all. It''s very sharp focus, with great texture detail. The background sky is textureless, but it''s a nice colorful blue, so that is fine. I''d have to give this photo one of my highest scores of the week for doing a good job with the framing and focus of the foreground and everything else.</td>', 'I have no idea what this picture is of, but that doesn''t really matter at all. It''s very sharp focus, with great texture detail. The background sky is textureless, but it''s a nice colorful blue, so that is fine. I''d have to give this photo one of my highest scores of the week for doing a good job with the framing and focus of the foreground and everything else.', '2002-04-29 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55077, 1267, 1181, '<td valign="top">Nice texture and composition.</td>', 'Nice texture and composition.', '2002-04-29 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55078, 1267, 813, '<td valign="top">At first I thought it was a totem pole, then finallly I figured it out. The idea is more interesting than the photograph which need more depth of field or color or something to focus on.</td>', 'At first I thought it was a totem pole, then finallly I figured it out. The idea is more interesting than the photograph which need more depth of field or color or something to focus on.', '2002-04-29 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
