(55096, 1267, 1202, '<td valign="top">I''m Tyred.   I have a soft spot for this one, been there done that.   Hurts too.   If I had entered, which I may do someday, I had a similar shot in mind.</td>', 'I''m Tyred.   I have a soft spot for this one, been there done that.   Hurts too.   If I had entered, which I may do someday, I had a similar shot in mind.', '2002-05-04 09:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
