(55135, 1269, 544, '<td valign="top">I don''t get the whole "fitting the challenge category" idea. I mean, is the camera supposed to be on the ground, showing the ground, and looking up? And if it doesn''t do that, it''s not a good picture? I don''t know. Nice coloring in this photo. I would have tried to zoom in a bit more on the smoke, and tried to get more of the texture defined. I did like it off center with the sun coming up on the right, though... just a slightly tighter cropping. Nice color transition, too, by the way. Sharp photo.</td>', 'I don''t get the whole "fitting the challenge category" idea. I mean, is the camera supposed to be on the ground, showing the ground, and looking up? And if it doesn''t do that, it''s not a good picture? I don''t know. Nice coloring in this photo. I would have tried to zoom in a bit more on the smoke, and tried to get more of the texture defined. I did like it off center with the sun coming up on the right, though... just a slightly tighter cropping. Nice color transition, too, by the way. Sharp photo.', '2002-04-29 13:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
