(55164, 1269, 886, '<td valign="top">Wow! The black water down there is so ominous! But, formally speaking, the shot should be made from the ground up, not the subject. Well, it''s still so good!</td>', 'Wow! The black water down there is so ominous! But, formally speaking, the shot should be made from the ground up, not the subject. Well, it''s still so good!', '2002-05-04 02:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
