(55191, 1270, 1233, '<td valign="top">Now we''re talking.  Here''s a great shot and very well within topic.  10.</td>', 'Now we''re talking.  Here''s a great shot and very well within topic.  10.', '2002-04-29 18:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55192, 1270, 142, '<td valign="top">Great perspective!  This is a majestic looking photo.</td>', 'Great perspective!  This is a majestic looking photo.', '2002-04-29 21:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55193, 1270, 674, '<td valign="top">I like the way you have composed the picture</td>', 'I like the way you have composed the picture', '2002-04-30 06:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55194, 1270, 640, '<td valign="top">I like this! Very nice how you not only caught "up", but it is nicely framed with the sculpture.</td>', 'I like this! Very nice how you not only caught "up", but it is nicely framed with the sculpture.', '2002-04-30 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55195, 1270, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice!  This is one of the best ''depth of field'' shots I have seen in this challenge.  Your focus is clean all the way to the top.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is nice!  This is one of the best ''depth of field'' shots I have seen in this challenge.  Your focus is clean all the way to the top.  Nice job!', '2002-04-30 10:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55196, 1270, 1041, '<td valign="top">Was there any way of photographing this w/out a building in the background?  Probably not, but worth asking.  Like the idea by the way, but the statue is a little to dark in places.  Use a flash or different time of day?</td>', 'Was there any way of photographing this w/out a building in the background?  Probably not, but worth asking.  Like the idea by the way, but the statue is a little to dark in places.  Use a flash or different time of day?', '2002-04-30 13:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55197, 1270, 888, '<td valign="top">I love it.  I predict this to win the challenge, a bit more detail on the statue instead of dark patches would be nice though.</td>', 'I love it.  I predict this to win the challenge, a bit more detail on the statue instead of dark patches would be nice though.', '2002-04-30 13:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55198, 1270, 441, '<td valign="top">good composition just over-cropped, good submission</td>', 'good composition just over-cropped, good submission', '2002-04-30 18:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55199, 1270, 748, '<td valign="top">This is good work.  One of my faves!</td>', 'This is good work.  One of my faves!', '2002-05-01 15:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55200, 1270, 1066, '<td valign="top">This had a lot of potential to be one of my favorites if you could have focused mor on the statue and less on the building.  Tall buildings are a dime a dozen but interesting sculptures are unique.  Either way I like the photo..just wished for a slightley different perspective.</td>', 'This had a lot of potential to be one of my favorites if you could have focused mor on the statue and less on the building.  Tall buildings are a dime a dozen but interesting sculptures are unique.  Either way I like the photo..just wished for a slightley different perspective.', '2002-05-01 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55201, 1270, 790, '<td valign="top">classic</td>', 'classic', '2002-05-01 22:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55202, 1270, 933, '<td valign="top">A well thought out piece.  Nice work.</td>', 'A well thought out piece.  Nice work.', '2002-05-02 14:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55203, 1270, 1191, '<td valign="top">Simply brilliant</td>', 'Simply brilliant', '2002-05-02 16:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55204, 1270, 330, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, angle, subject, and how it meets the challenge.</td>', 'I like the composition, angle, subject, and how it meets the challenge.', '2002-05-03 08:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55205, 1270, 739, '<td valign="top">Incredible subject.  The framing effect is great.</td>', 'Incredible subject.  The framing effect is great.', '2002-05-03 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55206, 1270, 1202, '<td valign="top">A strong Ground up shot.   Well composed and exposed.</td>', 'A strong Ground up shot.   Well composed and exposed.', '2002-05-04 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55207, 1270, 718, '<td valign="top">Nice find!</td>', 'Nice find!', '2002-05-04 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55208, 1270, 1457, '<td valign="top">no offence but i seen this shot in a textbook</td>', 'no offence but i seen this shot in a textbook', '2002-05-04 23:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55209, 1270, 2, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here, but I wish the picture was more well-balanced.  You''re pointing a little too much to the left.</td>', 'I like the idea here, but I wish the picture was more well-balanced.  You''re pointing a little too much to the left.', '2002-05-05 13:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55210, 1270, 1, '<td valign="top">Nicely framed.  More detail on the statue would''ve been nicer.</td>', 'Nicely framed.  More detail on the statue would''ve been nicer.', '2002-05-05 22:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55211, 1270, 430, '<td valign="top">I wanted to use the title Atlas Shrugged, as in the Ayn Rand book, but I just put something a little more normal.  When I lied on the ground to take the pic.  People were just passing by looking at me for a quick glance.  If I wasn''t in NYC, then I would have probably caught a beat down!</td>', 'I wanted to use the title Atlas Shrugged, as in the Ayn Rand book, but I just put something a little more normal.  When I lied on the ground to take the pic.  People were just passing by looking at me for a quick glance.  If I wasn''t in NYC, then I would have probably caught a beat down!', '2002-05-06 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55212, 1270, 215, '<td valign="top">from last place to second... that is quite an imporvement.<br/><br/>way to go!</td>', 'from last place to second... that is quite an imporvement.way to go!', '2002-05-06 14:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55213, 1270, 430, '<td valign="top">true.</td>', 'true.', '2002-05-06 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55214, 1272, 1024, '<td valign="top">The colors are a little too muted for my taste.</td>', 'The colors are a little too muted for my taste.', '2002-04-29 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55215, 1272, 656, '<td valign="top">phone lines are always horrible in a picture like this - hard to get rid of with this subject though.</td>', 'phone lines are always horrible in a picture like this - hard to get rid of with this subject though.', '2002-04-29 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55216, 1272, 675, '<td valign="top">is that like an underground railroad? man i wish those power lines weren''t in the shot...</td>', 'is that like an underground railroad? man i wish those power lines weren''t in the shot...', '2002-04-29 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55217, 1272, 189, '<td valign="top">um. This is a contest. Try harder.</td>', 'um. This is a contest. Try harder.', '2002-04-29 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55218, 1272, 259, '<td valign="top">like the creativity, but the picture is lacking in execution.</td>', 'like the creativity, but the picture is lacking in execution.', '2002-04-29 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55219, 1272, 138, '<td valign="top">i live in a springfield.. but its not that one</td>', 'i live in a springfield.. but its not that one', '2002-04-29 12:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55220, 1272, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting interpretation of this challenge but the photograph just doesn''t grab me.  The contrast is weak...</td>', 'This is an interesting interpretation of this challenge but the photograph just doesn''t grab me.  The contrast is weak...', '2002-04-29 13:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55221, 1272, 862, '<td valign="top">Your subject is too dark.  You need to compensate for the bright background.</td>', 'Your subject is too dark.  You need to compensate for the bright background.', '2002-04-30 08:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55222, 1272, 1078, '<td valign="top">this could use some contrast work -- the sign and shrubs are all so dark -- the power/phone lines are also distracting</td>', 'this could use some contrast work -- the sign and shrubs are all so dark -- the power/phone lines are also distracting', '2002-04-30 12:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55223, 1272, 1041, '<td valign="top">I find the powerlines and the cut-off number a little distracting.  But definitely fulfills the challenge requirements.</td>', 'I find the powerlines and the cut-off number a little distracting.  But definitely fulfills the challenge requirements.', '2002-04-30 13:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55224, 1272, 885, '<td valign="top">Power line is distracting.  I think a more dynamic angle would improve this witty photo.</td>', 'Power line is distracting.  I think a more dynamic angle would improve this witty photo.', '2002-05-01 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55225, 1272, 280, '<td valign="top">a shame about the dull sky and the cables in the background.</td>', 'a shame about the dull sky and the cables in the background.', '2002-05-01 17:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55226, 1272, 640, '<td valign="top">a bit dark</td>', 'a bit dark', '2002-05-02 08:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55227, 1272, 933, '<td valign="top">The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.</td>', 'The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.', '2002-05-02 15:13:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(55228, 1272, 1, '<td valign="top">Subject matter seems a bit bland.</td>', 'Subject matter seems a bit bland.', '2002-05-05 23:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55229, 1273, 92, '<td valign="top">I like this! I think it would be a little better if you had taken it from laying on the ground  and got all of her.  So she seemed higher. It''s good all the same:))))</td>', 'I like this! I think it would be a little better if you had taken it from laying on the ground  and got all of her.  So she seemed higher. It''s good all the same:))))', '2002-04-29 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55230, 1273, 544, '<td valign="top">This is another photo that, I am guessing, you''ll probably lose points on to the crowd at large because of a lack of a neck-straining sense of UP in the picture, though the subject does a great job of giving you that feeling :) There is amazing focus in this picture... I mean, even the background trees have a fairly rich texture to them, and the picture is amazingly colorful and fairly well framed. It looks like, from the quality, that you probably know how to improve this one better than I :) Good effort :)</td>', 'This is another photo that, I am guessing, you''ll probably lose points on to the crowd at large because of a lack of a neck-straining sense of UP in the picture, though the subject does a great job of giving you that feeling :) There is amazing focus in this picture... I mean, even the background trees have a fairly rich texture to them, and the picture is amazingly colorful and fairly well framed. It looks like, from the quality, that you probably know how to improve this one better than I :) Good effort :)', '2002-04-29 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55231, 1273, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice shot!  Did you try catching her on the upswing from a low perspective to enhance the "ground up" feeling?</td>', 'This is a nice shot!  Did you try catching her on the upswing from a low perspective to enhance the "ground up" feeling?', '2002-04-29 15:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55232, 1273, 656, '<td valign="top">framing is a bit too centered - could be framed more to the right and down to get the whole subject and the face more off center...</td>', 'framing is a bit too centered - could be framed more to the right and down to get the whole subject and the face more off center...', '2002-04-29 16:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55233, 1273, 327, '<td valign="top">Cute expression.</td>', 'Cute expression.', '2002-04-29 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55234, 1273, 885, '<td valign="top">great shot, I wish it were just a little less overexposed</td>', 'great shot, I wish it were just a little less overexposed', '2002-04-29 17:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55235, 1273, 661, '<td valign="top">Looks slightly over exposed to me.  Great expression on the face.</td>', 'Looks slightly over exposed to me.  Great expression on the face.', '2002-04-29 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55236, 1273, 724, '<td valign="top">I worked with the swing idea but just couldn''t find a super looking kid to sit in it.  You sure did!!  Her shirt and pants are a bit blown out though, too bad.</td>', 'I worked with the swing idea but just couldn''t find a super looking kid to sit in it.  You sure did!!  Her shirt and pants are a bit blown out though, too bad.', '2002-04-29 21:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55237, 1273, 587, '<td valign="top">cute!</td>', 'cute!', '2002-04-30 07:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55238, 1273, 459, '<td valign="top">Beautiful ! You caught her facial expression perfectly.  The background is a little distracting, though.  Maybe creative cropping?  Overall, a great shot.  If she were my kid, I''d hang this picture on the wall.</td>', 'Beautiful ! You caught her facial expression perfectly.  The background is a little distracting, though.  Maybe creative cropping?  Overall, a great shot.  If she were my kid, I''d hang this picture on the wall.', '2002-04-30 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55239, 1273, 1078, '<td valign="top">not a bad idea at all -- but I think 2 things detract -- first, it appears the trees in the background are more in focus than your subject -- second, I think a more interesting angle (and one that closer hits the spirit of the challenge) would have been to get closer to the ground (maybe even to lie directly underneath the path of the swing) and catch the little girl at the other end of the arc when she''s more directly facing the ground</td>', 'not a bad idea at all -- but I think 2 things detract -- first, it appears the trees in the background are more in focus than your subject -- second, I think a more interesting angle (and one that closer hits the spirit of the challenge) would have been to get closer to the ground (maybe even to lie directly underneath the path of the swing) and catch the little girl at the other end of the arc when she''s more directly facing the ground', '2002-04-30 12:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55240, 1273, 1135, '<td valign="top">Cute Kid! Maybe a bit over exposed.</td>', 'Cute Kid! Maybe a bit over exposed.', '2002-04-30 16:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
