(55242, 1273, 1209, '<td valign="top">Oh, to be a kid again!  Nice color and composition. I would prefer that her feet were also visible to complete the picture.</td>', 'Oh, to be a kid again!  Nice color and composition. I would prefer that her feet were also visible to complete the picture.', '2002-04-30 20:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
