(55282, 1274, 1042, '<td valign="top">Thanks all for the constructive and positive comments....this was my first challenge and it was fun reading the comments every day....um...ok, every hour. :) <br/>By the way, I LOVE this site...!!</td>', 'Thanks all for the constructive and positive comments....this was my first challenge and it was fun reading the comments every day....um...ok, every hour. :) By the way, I LOVE this site...!!', '2002-05-06 04:49:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55283, 1279, 352, '<td valign="top">What happened to the lines?  Do you know why they''re jaggy?</td>', 'What happened to the lines?  Do you know why they''re jaggy?', '2002-04-29 02:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55284, 1279, 107, '<td valign="top">I think the flash took away from this picture.. perhaps a longer exposure instead would have been of better benefit.  On the other hand, if your camera can''t do that... not a bad job done..</td>', 'I think the flash took away from this picture.. perhaps a longer exposure instead would have been of better benefit.  On the other hand, if your camera can''t do that... not a bad job done..', '2002-04-29 04:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55285, 1279, 656, '<td valign="top">Don''t know that the flash really works for this, you''d need a more powerful flash to illuminate the whole thing.</td>', 'Don''t know that the flash really works for this, you''d need a more powerful flash to illuminate the whole thing.', '2002-04-29 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55286, 1279, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good interpreation of the challenge.  I think a day time shot would have appealed a little more to me.  The flash is focusing the attention on the bottom part of this pole and distracting a little from its height....</td>', 'This is a good interpreation of the challenge.  I think a day time shot would have appealed a little more to me.  The flash is focusing the attention on the bottom part of this pole and distracting a little from its height....', '2002-04-29 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
