(55303, 1279, 640, '<td valign="top">I think I would have prefered this in the daytime with some more color in it--like against a blue sky.</td>', 'I think I would have prefered this in the daytime with some more color in it--like against a blue sky.', '2002-05-03 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
