(55305, 1279, 1, '<td valign="top">Very bad lighting.  Loks like you flashed it at night and didn''t let the flash fill the subject.  Longer shutter, smaller aperature could''ve fixed it.</td>', 'Very bad lighting.  Loks like you flashed it at night and didn''t let the flash fill the subject.  Longer shutter, smaller aperature could''ve fixed it.', '2002-05-04 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55306, 1280, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very interesting photograph.  I think that it closely resembles the concept of Mousie''s Night Shot entry.  If this was the intent, you have selected a great photographer as a model for your work.  If the fence in this photo were a little more in focus, I think you would have a much better image.  Good work!</td>', 'This is a very interesting photograph.  I think that it closely resembles the concept of Mousie''s Night Shot entry.  If this was the intent, you have selected a great photographer as a model for your work.  If the fence in this photo were a little more in focus, I think you would have a much better image.  Good work!', '2002-04-29 08:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55307, 1280, 656, '<td valign="top">like the orange colours, moon is too centered though</td>', 'like the orange colours, moon is too centered though', '2002-04-29 10:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
