(55329, 1281, 675, '<td valign="top">interesting picture, good job with the challenge</td>', 'interesting picture, good job with the challenge', '2002-04-29 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55330, 1281, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the angles in this photo</td>', 'i like the angles in this photo', '2002-04-29 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55331, 1281, 544, '<td valign="top">I can see why people might say they get dizzy looking at this picture. It''s an odd angle - this takes away the sense of up and down. It definitely suggest UP, but a falling out of a parachute up, if that makes sense. I might have tried to get better lighting for this picture, if that was at all possible, and I might have tried to get the main beam (and the secondary, smaller ones) in better focus, either with manual focus or macro, to see if you could capture more of the nice texture from the picture. I wish you could have brought out the foliage more, and maybe dulled the bleached out section in the lower left hand corner of the picture, maybe cropped the lower-right hand some to bring more attention to the main beam, and somehow brought out the nice colors, too. That''s a lot to ask, and I have no idea how I would even hope to accomplish it. This is a very good picture overall, and a very challenging one at that. You deserve a good score for this one.</td>', 'I can see why people might say they get dizzy looking at this picture. It''s an odd angle - this takes away the sense of up and down. It definitely suggest UP, but a falling out of a parachute up, if that makes sense. I might have tried to get better lighting for this picture, if that was at all possible, and I might have tried to get the main beam (and the secondary, smaller ones) in better focus, either with manual focus or macro, to see if you could capture more of the nice texture from the picture. I wish you could have brought out the foliage more, and maybe dulled the bleached out section in the lower left hand corner of the picture, maybe cropped the lower-right hand some to bring more attention to the main beam, and somehow brought out the nice colors, too. That''s a lot to ask, and I have no idea how I would even hope to accomplish it. This is a very good picture overall, and a very challenging one at that. You deserve a good score for this one.', '2002-04-29 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55332, 1281, 1336, '<td valign="top">is this picture sideways?</td>', 'is this picture sideways?', '2002-04-29 14:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55333, 1281, 131, '<td valign="top">looks uupside down</td>', 'looks uupside down', '2002-04-29 18:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55334, 1281, 1, '<td valign="top">The angle does not justice to the pillar.  If you rotated 90 CW, it might.</td>', 'The angle does not justice to the pillar.  If you rotated 90 CW, it might.', '2002-04-29 20:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55335, 1281, 843, '<td valign="top">Good contrasting angles. The trees in the back are too distracting though.</td>', 'Good contrasting angles. The trees in the back are too distracting though.', '2002-04-29 22:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55336, 1281, 1344, '<td valign="top">If only this pic was rotated 90 degrees.... Ya coulda been a contender!</td>', 'If only this pic was rotated 90 degrees.... Ya coulda been a contender!', '2002-04-29 22:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55337, 1281, 640, '<td valign="top">Yes, its up.However I find all the lines in different directions distracting</td>', 'Yes, its up.However I find all the lines in different directions distracting', '2002-04-30 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55338, 1281, 1078, '<td valign="top">wow -- does some interesting things to leave it as a horizontal like that -- looks like you had a little bit of a problem shooting in a darkishh space on a bright day?  I''d like to see the midtones and shadows in this lightened up a little and the highlights toned down. (Hope that''s not too Photoshop geek...)</td>', 'wow -- does some interesting things to leave it as a horizontal like that -- looks like you had a little bit of a problem shooting in a darkishh space on a bright day?  I''d like to see the midtones and shadows in this lightened up a little and the highlights toned down. (Hope that''s not too Photoshop geek...)', '2002-04-30 12:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55339, 1281, 280, '<td valign="top">The angle seems a little awkward maybe if this shot was rotated by 90 clockwise?</td>', 'The angle seems a little awkward maybe if this shot was rotated by 90 clockwise?', '2002-04-30 16:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55340, 1281, 888, '<td valign="top">I assume this is a vertical pillar so why have you show it on its side?</td>', 'I assume this is a vertical pillar so why have you show it on its side?', '2002-04-30 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55341, 1281, 782, '<td valign="top">rotate 90° clockwise</td>', 'rotate 90° clockwise', '2002-04-30 19:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55342, 1281, 885, '<td valign="top">Took me a minute to realize that this picture is turned sideways than how most would normally orient it.  Nice use of lines.  I think you might want to see how it looks in black and white...just because there isn''t much color and taking out that hint of green might put the emphasis more on the lines.</td>', 'Took me a minute to realize that this picture is turned sideways than how most would normally orient it.  Nice use of lines.  I think you might want to see how it looks in black and white...just because there isn''t much color and taking out that hint of green might put the emphasis more on the lines.', '2002-05-01 09:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55343, 1281, 1041, '<td valign="top">Should this one be a portrait?  The angle makes me dizzy.  Good shot!  One of my top 10!</td>', 'Should this one be a portrait?  The angle makes me dizzy.  Good shot!  One of my top 10!', '2002-05-01 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55344, 1281, 813, '<td valign="top">Which way is up? It looks like the picture should be rotated right.</td>', 'Which way is up? It looks like the picture should be rotated right.', '2002-05-01 18:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55345, 1281, 301, '<td valign="top">weird angle. Doesn''t really work for me though</td>', 'weird angle. Doesn''t really work for me though', '2002-05-02 08:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55346, 1281, 715, '<td valign="top">Very good photo. Personally I would have rotated the picture 90 degrees clockwise.</td>', 'Very good photo. Personally I would have rotated the picture 90 degrees clockwise.', '2002-05-02 12:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55347, 1281, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting title and perspective.</td>', 'Interesting title and perspective.', '2002-05-02 15:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55348, 1281, 748, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot.  Did you forget to turn it 90 CW, or did you intend for us to figure what was up and down?  Good idea, and nice shot.</td>', 'This is an interesting shot.  Did you forget to turn it 90 CW, or did you intend for us to figure what was up and down?  Good idea, and nice shot.', '2002-05-02 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55349, 1281, 330, '<td valign="top">Odd angle seems a little distracting to me.</td>', 'Odd angle seems a little distracting to me.', '2002-05-03 11:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55350, 1281, 637, '<td valign="top">Weird and crooked... but cool angle... not so sure its looking up.</td>', 'Weird and crooked... but cool angle... not so sure its looking up.', '2002-05-03 19:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55351, 1281, 173, '<td valign="top">Nice angle! Great shot<br/></td>', 'Nice angle! Great shot', '2002-05-04 21:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55352, 1281, 1457, '<td valign="top">where the heck is that, it''s cool</td>', 'where the heck is that, it''s cool', '2002-05-04 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55353, 1281, 749, '<td valign="top">I like the choice of angle - makes it seem escher-like at first glance! The light feels a bit gloomy though</td>', 'I like the choice of angle - makes it seem escher-like at first glance! The light feels a bit gloomy though', '2002-05-05 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55354, 1281, 689, '<td valign="top">I think you should have rotated this image before you submitted it ......</td>', 'I think you should have rotated this image before you submitted it ......', '2002-05-05 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55355, 1281, 1379, '<td valign="top">The mathematics of this photograph absolutely ROCK!  I love it!</td>', 'The mathematics of this photograph absolutely ROCK!  I love it!', '2002-05-05 21:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55356, 1281, 536, '<td valign="top">Thanks everyone for your comments and votes.  I see a lot of people felt I should have rotated this photo.  Rotating it would not have made it the photo I laid on the cold wet ground to get.  : ) It is not a photo of a pillar from the ground up. It is what the title says.  I loved the "math" in this photo and felt it was very much like something Escher would have drawn..  For those that felt the lines were distracting or made you dizzy - they were suppose to. : )</td>', 'Thanks everyone for your comments and votes.  I see a lot of people felt I should have rotated this photo.  Rotating it would not have made it the photo I laid on the cold wet ground to get.  : ) It is not a photo of a pillar from the ground up. It is what the title says.  I loved the "math" in this photo and felt it was very much like something Escher would have drawn..  For those that felt the lines were distracting or made you dizzy - they were suppose to. : )', '2002-05-06 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55357, 1282, 117, '<td valign="top">I took pictures of the tower from several angles. I was underneath it and from all sides. The reason that I submitted this one is the road is going uphill and everything around it is going up. Thus from the ground up. I had close-ups of the tower and I could have blown this one up. The road is at an angle draining to the left. The tower naturally tilts to the right, so why would I want to straighten the tower? All towers don''t go straight up and down. I think there is a famous one in Italy that does not.</td>', 'I took pictures of the tower from several angles. I was underneath it and from all sides. The reason that I submitted this one is the road is going uphill and everything around it is going up. Thus from the ground up. I had close-ups of the tower and I could have blown this one up. The road is at an angle draining to the left. The tower naturally tilts to the right, so why would I want to straighten the tower? All towers don''t go straight up and down. I think there is a famous one in Italy that does not.', '2002-05-06 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55358, 1282, 1233, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Maybe should have been taken closer to better reflect the subject of the challenge.</td>', 'Nice sky.  Maybe should have been taken closer to better reflect the subject of the challenge.', '2002-04-29 07:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55359, 1282, 1024, '<td valign="top">Having people in this picture adds a certain interest, makes it more than your typical building photo.</td>', 'Having people in this picture adds a certain interest, makes it more than your typical building photo.', '2002-04-29 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55360, 1282, 885, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t feel very close to the ground?  Also, might have emphasized the tower more to be closer and to frame vertically.</td>', 'Doesn''t feel very close to the ground?  Also, might have emphasized the tower more to be closer and to frame vertically.', '2002-04-29 09:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55361, 1282, 656, '<td valign="top">maybe try turning the camera and shooting this vertically ?</td>', 'maybe try turning the camera and shooting this vertically ?', '2002-04-29 09:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55362, 1282, 675, '<td valign="top">picture is tilited, yes the ground is in the picture, but is this really what the contest is getting at? i don''t think so</td>', 'picture is tilited, yes the ground is in the picture, but is this really what the contest is getting at? i don''t think so', '2002-04-29 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55363, 1282, 2, '<td valign="top">Ack -- you''re crooked.  And the camera isn''t giving us a ''ground up'' perspective.</td>', 'Ack -- you''re crooked.  And the camera isn''t giving us a ''ground up'' perspective.', '2002-04-29 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55364, 1282, 259, '<td valign="top">i know that you are going to get a lot of comments about it not being from the ground up, and i would also have to agree.</td>', 'i know that you are going to get a lot of comments about it not being from the ground up, and i would also have to agree.', '2002-04-29 10:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55365, 1282, 189, '<td valign="top">This isn''t from the ground. i don''t htink.</td>', 'This isn''t from the ground. i don''t htink.', '2002-04-29 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55366, 1282, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice photo... i see your "ground up" subject but I wish this particular photo had a higher camera angle and was shooting towards a higher elevation.  *My* interpretation of this challenge is not well displayed in this shot, but I don''t expect everyone to see things like I do!  Good job...</td>', 'This is a nice photo... i see your "ground up" subject but I wish this particular photo had a higher camera angle and was shooting towards a higher elevation.  *My* interpretation of this challenge is not well displayed in this shot, but I don''t expect everyone to see things like I do!  Good job...', '2002-04-29 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55367, 1282, 203, '<td valign="top">Where is the naked guy?</td>', 'Where is the naked guy?', '2002-04-29 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55368, 1282, 1336, '<td valign="top">this is more of a straight-ahead shot.  i think it would have been better to be close to the tower, looking up</td>', 'this is more of a straight-ahead shot.  i think it would have been better to be close to the tower, looking up', '2002-04-29 15:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55369, 1282, 962, '<td valign="top">Not related to the topic........</td>', 'Not related to the topic........', '2002-04-29 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55370, 1282, 1005, '<td valign="top">College campus''s, gotta love ''em!</td>', 'College campus''s, gotta love ''em!', '2002-04-29 17:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55371, 1282, 536, '<td valign="top">I don''t see it. Pleasing photo but I don''t see the angle that makes me feel the challenge was met.</td>', 'I don''t see it. Pleasing photo but I don''t see the angle that makes me feel the challenge was met.', '2002-04-30 00:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55372, 1282, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very pretty... the framing seems awkward to me though. I think ti could do with being a closer shot of the tower with less around it, and if it''s going to be positioned away from the centre it should be further to one side, otherwise it kinda seems like an accident.</td>', 'Very pretty... the framing seems awkward to me though. I think ti could do with being a closer shot of the tower with less around it, and if it''s going to be positioned away from the centre it should be further to one side, otherwise it kinda seems like an accident.', '2002-04-30 02:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55373, 1282, 714, '<td valign="top">I would have like the shot better if you would have been right under the tower.  Did you try that?</td>', 'I would have like the shot better if you would have been right under the tower.  Did you try that?', '2002-04-30 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55374, 1282, 1041, '<td valign="top">I understand that this could be interpreted as "from the ground up", too, but it does not fit with my interpretation of the challenge and that of many others.  Also has a snapshot feel to it - the photo leans to the left.  A portrait format would probably have worked better for hte tower.</td>', 'I understand that this could be interpreted as "from the ground up", too, but it does not fit with my interpretation of the challenge and that of many others.  Also has a snapshot feel to it - the photo leans to the left.  A portrait format would probably have worked better for hte tower.', '2002-04-30 11:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55375, 1282, 888, '<td valign="top">I think it would be better if you were closer and had the camera vertical, other wise its lost in the picture</td>', 'I think it would be better if you were closer and had the camera vertical, other wise its lost in the picture', '2002-04-30 16:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55376, 1282, 1078, '<td valign="top">not entirely certain I see how this is ground up -- but be that as it may...  the picture doesn''t feel quite level -- everything seems to be leaning to the left -- I''m also a little distracted by the people, and other buildings, and light post -- maybe a tighter crop on the tower, as well as emphasizing the height of the tower by making the shot vert?</td>', 'not entirely certain I see how this is ground up -- but be that as it may...  the picture doesn''t feel quite level -- everything seems to be leaning to the left -- I''m also a little distracted by the people, and other buildings, and light post -- maybe a tighter crop on the tower, as well as emphasizing the height of the tower by making the shot vert?', '2002-05-01 13:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55377, 1282, 933, '<td valign="top">looks like California... what school is this?  Composition could improve by maybe moving the tower to the left a bit.</td>', 'looks like California... what school is this?  Composition could improve by maybe moving the tower to the left a bit.', '2002-05-02 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55378, 1282, 1, '<td valign="top">Seems more head/on than ground/up.</td>', 'Seems more head/on than ground/up.', '2002-05-05 23:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55379, 1282, 671, '<td valign="top">I agree.  A closer shot would have been more dramatic.  Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'I agree.  A closer shot would have been more dramatic.  Otherwise, very nice.', '2002-05-07 00:43:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55380, 1285, 689, '<td valign="top">Needs more depth of field ... try using an f-stop of 8 or 11.</td>', 'Needs more depth of field ... try using an f-stop of 8 or 11.', '2002-04-29 01:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55381, 1285, 352, '<td valign="top">Looks like B&amp;W mode on the G2.  B&amp;W here would probably have been done better by taking a color shot and converting in an image editing program after the fact.</td>', 'Looks like B&W mode on the G2.  B&W here would probably have been done better by taking a color shot and converting in an image editing program after the fact.', '2002-04-29 01:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55382, 1285, 107, '<td valign="top">I dont know if the colour cast on this photograph was intentional, but I find it takes away from the image.  Really nice strong and vibrant colours would have added another dimension to this one.</td>', 'I dont know if the colour cast on this photograph was intentional, but I find it takes away from the image.  Really nice strong and vibrant colours would have added another dimension to this one.', '2002-04-29 04:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55383, 1285, 1024, '<td valign="top">Sepia works well in this photo.</td>', 'Sepia works well in this photo.', '2002-04-29 08:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55384, 1285, 656, '<td valign="top">good colours, needs work on the focus</td>', 'good colours, needs work on the focus', '2002-04-29 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55385, 1285, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful :). The curvy lines of the fixture on the wall draw the eye up to the flowers which burst out in all directions in a really dynamic way. My only criticism is that it seems a little bit blurry.</td>', 'Beautiful :). The curvy lines of the fixture on the wall draw the eye up to the flowers which burst out in all directions in a really dynamic way. My only criticism is that it seems a little bit blurry.', '2002-04-29 11:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55386, 1285, 714, '<td valign="top">I like the sepia look, but looks out of focus in some areas.</td>', 'I like the sepia look, but looks out of focus in some areas.', '2002-04-29 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55387, 1285, 1379, '<td valign="top"><br/>Did you lose the depth of field intentionally?  It''s a cool piece of art on your wall, but more in-focus would have enhanced this pic.</td>', 'Did you lose the depth of field intentionally?  It''s a cool piece of art on your wall, but more in-focus would have enhanced this pic.', '2002-04-29 14:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55388, 1285, 1336, '<td valign="top">could be sharper</td>', 'could be sharper', '2002-04-29 14:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55389, 1285, 772, '<td valign="top">This shot looked much better from the thumbnai perspective...  There are some definite focus issues on the plant branches.  Achieving good depth of field is hard sometimes but it''s worth the effort on a shot like this.  I don''t know what kind of camera you use, but a shot like this could have easily been made from a tripod with a smaller aperture to achieve full focus on this shot.  If your camera doesn''t allow this, you may wish to consider evaluating your subjects and working exclusively within the range of your camera''s capabilities.  Try this same shot again and move back from the wall about 18" and see if th focus doesn''t improve some :)</td>', 'This shot looked much better from the thumbnai perspective...  There are some definite focus issues on the plant branches.  Achieving good depth of field is hard sometimes but it''s worth the effort on a shot like this.  I don''t know what kind of camera you use, but a shot like this could have easily been made from a tripod with a smaller aperture to achieve full focus on this shot.  If your camera doesn''t allow this, you may wish to consider evaluating your subjects and working exclusively within the range of your camera''s capabilities.  Try this same shot again and move back from the wall about 18" and see if th focus doesn''t improve some :)', '2002-04-29 15:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55390, 1285, 962, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.</td>', 'Interesting composition.', '2002-04-29 16:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55391, 1285, 1242, '<td valign="top">Nice angle, but I''d like to see it more in focus.</td>', 'Nice angle, but I''d like to see it more in focus.', '2002-04-29 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55392, 1285, 885, '<td valign="top">Might be a little flat.  The focus seems like it should be more on the leaves at the top.  I like the composition though, but I''m not convined that sepia was the best choice, I''d like to see it in color</td>', 'Might be a little flat.  The focus seems like it should be more on the leaves at the top.  I like the composition though, but I''m not convined that sepia was the best choice, I''d like to see it in color', '2002-04-29 17:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55393, 1285, 675, '<td valign="top">plant is out of focus, not a real interesting shot</td>', 'plant is out of focus, not a real interesting shot', '2002-04-29 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55394, 1285, 843, '<td valign="top">Could use better focusing and a crop to get rid of that branch on the left.</td>', 'Could use better focusing and a crop to get rid of that branch on the left.', '2002-04-29 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55395, 1285, 587, '<td valign="top">I wish this was less blurry and brighter.</td>', 'I wish this was less blurry and brighter.', '2002-04-30 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55396, 1285, 862, '<td valign="top">Subject is fuzzy.  More light on the subject would help focus and enhance the subject.</td>', 'Subject is fuzzy.  More light on the subject would help focus and enhance the subject.', '2002-04-30 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55397, 1285, 1041, '<td valign="top">Love the vase!  Shame the top of the flower is cut off, and there are the other leaves poking into the picture on the left.  For a non-challenge (where you can''t do it) I would edit those out.</td>', 'Love the vase!  Shame the top of the flower is cut off, and there are the other leaves poking into the picture on the left.  For a non-challenge (where you can''t do it) I would edit those out.', '2002-04-30 12:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55398, 1285, 888, '<td valign="top">the colours a bit funny, would be nicer if the wall was whiter and there was some colour in the flowers</td>', 'the colours a bit funny, would be nicer if the wall was whiter and there was some colour in the flowers', '2002-04-30 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55399, 1285, 1135, '<td valign="top">Don''t care for the lighting and Focus.</td>', 'Don''t care for the lighting and Focus.', '2002-04-30 19:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55400, 1285, 543, '<td valign="top">The field of focus peters out just up where things start to get interesting.  This would be a tough shot to make work, as the texture of the ceiling is going to compete with the foliage no matter what you do.</td>', 'The field of focus peters out just up where things start to get interesting.  This would be a tough shot to make work, as the texture of the ceiling is going to compete with the foliage no matter what you do.', '2002-05-01 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55401, 1285, 1078, '<td valign="top">For me, the focus on this one just doesn''t work.  I like the way the walls and ceiling and corners contribute overall, but I want the vase, holder, and plant all to be in focus.  I also would like to see those two branches coming in from the left removed.</td>', 'For me, the focus on this one just doesn''t work.  I like the way the walls and ceiling and corners contribute overall, but I want the vase, holder, and plant all to be in focus.  I also would like to see those two branches coming in from the left removed.', '2002-05-01 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55402, 1285, 436, '<td valign="top">change setting for incandescent lighting maybe?  Purplish cast here</td>', 'change setting for incandescent lighting maybe?  Purplish cast here', '2002-05-03 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55403, 1285, 1, '<td valign="top">For a shot like this, I feel more DOF is necessary to focus the flowers as well as the vase.</td>', 'For a shot like this, I feel more DOF is necessary to focus the flowers as well as the vase.', '2002-05-03 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55404, 1285, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the simplicity and angles in this photo.  The focus doesn''t seem to be quite right though.</td>', 'I like the simplicity and angles in this photo.  The focus doesn''t seem to be quite right though.', '2002-05-03 11:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55405, 1285, 718, '<td valign="top">Not really in focus.</td>', 'Not really in focus.', '2002-05-04 13:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55406, 1287, 352, '<td valign="top">Cool shot!  Bring the brightness down o this and it''d make a good check picture.</td>', 'Cool shot!  Bring the brightness down o this and it''d make a good check picture.', '2002-04-29 02:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55407, 1287, 301, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and colours.  Dunno if you''ve over-sharpened or lost quality on compression, but this seems very jagged.</td>', 'I like the idea and colours.  Dunno if you''ve over-sharpened or lost quality on compression, but this seems very jagged.', '2002-04-29 04:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55408, 1287, 772, '<td valign="top">The flowers are nice... I can''t put my finger on it but there is something wrong with this photo.  It looks very grainy.  There is no sharpness...</td>', 'The flowers are nice... I can''t put my finger on it but there is something wrong with this photo.  It looks very grainy.  There is no sharpness...', '2002-04-29 05:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55409, 1287, 885, '<td valign="top">Odd texture.  Is it artifacting?  I like how the flowers extend all the way out into the background.  It''s too bad that the sky wasn''t a deeper blue, I think it might have been a better contrast to the red and yellow flowers.  If your camera supports it, a polarizer might have helped.</td>', 'Odd texture.  Is it artifacting?  I like how the flowers extend all the way out into the background.  It''s too bad that the sky wasn''t a deeper blue, I think it might have been a better contrast to the red and yellow flowers.  If your camera supports it, a polarizer might have helped.', '2002-04-29 09:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55410, 1287, 656, '<td valign="top">good texan shot - have to score that highly :)  Picture seems to have suffered in the conversion to JPEG.</td>', 'good texan shot - have to score that highly :)  Picture seems to have suffered in the conversion to JPEG.', '2002-04-29 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55411, 1287, 1037, '<td valign="top">Most things about this photo are great... the only thing is that it seems flat and uniform. If it had been cropped so that it was a vertical rectangle, with more sky, and a tighter focus on a few flowers, it would be more interesting to look at, maybe.</td>', 'Most things about this photo are great... the only thing is that it seems flat and uniform. If it had been cropped so that it was a vertical rectangle, with more sky, and a tighter focus on a few flowers, it would be more interesting to look at, maybe.', '2002-04-29 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55412, 1287, 259, '<td valign="top">nice color</td>', 'nice color', '2002-04-29 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55413, 1287, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nice bright and clear.</td>', 'Nice bright and clear.', '2002-04-29 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55414, 1287, 509, '<td valign="top">Lots of compression artifacts here, but the colors are nice</td>', 'Lots of compression artifacts here, but the colors are nice', '2002-04-29 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55415, 1287, 1336, '<td valign="top">very nice.  i like this a lot</td>', 'very nice.  i like this a lot', '2002-04-29 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55416, 1287, 689, '<td valign="top">You have a great photo, except you have some extreme pixelization going on ... I am not sure why, but once the challenge voting is over, I''ll help you any way I can.</td>', 'You have a great photo, except you have some extreme pixelization going on ... I am not sure why, but once the challenge voting is over, I''ll help you any way I can.', '2002-04-29 15:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55417, 1287, 962, '<td valign="top">Clarity not good......</td>', 'Clarity not good......', '2002-04-29 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55418, 1287, 675, '<td valign="top">may not be the best example of from the ground up, but still a nice picture</td>', 'may not be the best example of from the ground up, but still a nice picture', '2002-04-29 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55419, 1287, 1034, '<td valign="top">hmm... not bad, but then again not that great either.  The image is a bit to umm... pixely?  Nice shot of the flowers though.</td>', 'hmm... not bad, but then again not that great either.  The image is a bit to umm... pixely?  Nice shot of the flowers though.', '2002-04-29 19:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55420, 1287, 843, '<td valign="top">Looks like a pretty picture but the compression almost ruins it.</td>', 'Looks like a pretty picture but the compression almost ruins it.', '2002-04-29 22:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55421, 1287, 1323, '<td valign="top">Ah! Wish I were back in Texas!</td>', 'Ah! Wish I were back in Texas!', '2002-04-29 23:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55422, 1287, 459, '<td valign="top">Pretty</td>', 'Pretty', '2002-04-30 10:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55423, 1287, 1041, '<td valign="top">The photo looks like it has been compressed a little too much?  Edges are jagged and focal point can''t be pinpointed.  I think it is a nice photo, just try processing it again.</td>', 'The photo looks like it has been compressed a little too much?  Edges are jagged and focal point can''t be pinpointed.  I think it is a nice photo, just try processing it again.', '2002-04-30 12:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55424, 1287, 1078, '<td valign="top">pretty flowerscape -- seems like a really high degree of pixelation though.  I bet you''re getting a lot of those comments -- low end camera?</td>', 'pretty flowerscape -- seems like a really high degree of pixelation though.  I bet you''re getting a lot of those comments -- low end camera?', '2002-04-30 12:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55425, 1287, 724, '<td valign="top">Oh how I miss the Texas wildflowers!  It looks like your image is over sharpened though.</td>', 'Oh how I miss the Texas wildflowers!  It looks like your image is over sharpened though.', '2002-04-30 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55426, 1287, 1209, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition and color. The only thing I found wrong, is that it seems to have been "sharpened" to the point of beginning to "break up" the image. Can you see it?</td>', 'Wonderful composition and color. The only thing I found wrong, is that it seems to have been "sharpened" to the point of beginning to "break up" the image. Can you see it?', '2002-04-30 16:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55427, 1287, 1135, '<td valign="top">Lots of compression artifacts. Hard to do within the size allowed.</td>', 'Lots of compression artifacts. Hard to do within the size allowed.', '2002-04-30 17:06:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(55428, 1287, 616, '<td valign="top">kind of fuzzy</td>', 'kind of fuzzy', '2002-04-30 21:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55429, 1287, 446, '<td valign="top">This photo almost looks like a painting.  The flowers look like they are dancing in celebration of spring.  I typically would be critical of the lack of sharp focus on the subject, however in this case the soft focus seems to work for me.  There seem to be quite a few artifacts in the image.  I''m not sure whether they are due to post processing or jpeg compression?  Having said all of that, I still like the photo overall and rated it high.</td>', 'This photo almost looks like a painting.  The flowers look like they are dancing in celebration of spring.  I typically would be critical of the lack of sharp focus on the subject, however in this case the soft focus seems to work for me.  There seem to be quite a few artifacts in the image.  I''m not sure whether they are due to post processing or jpeg compression?  Having said all of that, I still like the photo overall and rated it high.', '2002-05-01 08:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55430, 1287, 1066, '<td valign="top">One of the better shots in this challenge and actually I had a whole series of shots that looked almost identical to this :-)  I used a different subject matter entirely instead but I still like this composition.  Good work</td>', 'One of the better shots in this challenge and actually I had a whole series of shots that looked almost identical to this :-)  I used a different subject matter entirely instead but I still like this composition.  Good work', '2002-05-01 08:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55431, 1287, 878, '<td valign="top">There was potential for this shot, the flowers and the sky look really nice but...<br/><br/>You could of used a lower angle on the ground with this shot and gotten more of the sky in the frame.  The shot is 3/4 ground and hardly any "up". <br/><br/>The software that you used to resize the photo terribly distorted the image, go to the forums and look at what software others are using.  It also appears that there is a quite a bit of JPG compressions on this photo, another software issue.<br/></td>', 'There was potential for this shot, the flowers and the sky look really nice but...You could of used a lower angle on the ground with this shot and gotten more of the sky in the frame.  The shot is 3/4 ground and hardly any "up". The software that you used to resize the photo terribly distorted the image, go to the forums and look at what software others are using.  It also appears that there is a quite a bit of JPG compressions on this photo, another software issue.', '2002-05-01 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55432, 1287, 748, '<td valign="top">Looking up a hill?  I like the shot, but the resolution looks a bit short.  Are you using all of your megapixels?</td>', 'Looking up a hill?  I like the shot, but the resolution looks a bit short.  Are you using all of your megapixels?', '2002-05-01 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55433, 1287, 1325, '<td valign="top">Connection to the theme is not to great but I do love the splendor of Texas wild flowers.  The color is wonderful.</td>', 'Connection to the theme is not to great but I do love the splendor of Texas wild flowers.  The color is wonderful.', '2002-05-01 17:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55434, 1287, 244, '<td valign="top">I love the colors in this shot, what are those flowers called?  I wish this shot was compressed better, the digital jagginess of it really pulls away from the overall image.</td>', 'I love the colors in this shot, what are those flowers called?  I wish this shot was compressed better, the digital jagginess of it really pulls away from the overall image.', '2002-05-01 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55435, 1287, 330, '<td valign="top">Makes me feel like I''m looking down not up.</td>', 'Makes me feel like I''m looking down not up.', '2002-05-03 07:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55436, 1287, 1, '<td valign="top">This seems more head-on than ground up.  The iamge seems little over-sharpened as well.</td>', 'This seems more head-on than ground up.  The iamge seems little over-sharpened as well.', '2002-05-04 11:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55437, 1287, 1457, '<td valign="top">not really from the ground up is</td>', 'not really from the ground up is', '2002-05-04 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55438, 1288, 689, '<td valign="top">Interesting title ....</td>', 'Interesting title ....', '2002-04-29 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55439, 1288, 1360, '<td valign="top">gets a 9 only because of the pun</td>', 'gets a 9 only because of the pun', '2002-04-29 02:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55440, 1288, 656, '<td valign="top">Background seems a bit busy, with the fence and the wood pile.  Maybe need to isolate the dog &amp; pony a bit more cleanly.  Also, composition seems very central - move the camera to the left a bit, and you could have had the dog on the right of the shot, looking to the left to the tree/ horse and it might have been a more interesting structure ?</td>', 'Background seems a bit busy, with the fence and the wood pile.  Maybe need to isolate the dog & pony a bit more cleanly.  Also, composition seems very central - move the camera to the left a bit, and you could have had the dog on the right of the shot, looking to the left to the tree/ horse and it might have been a more interesting structure ?', '2002-04-29 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55441, 1288, 772, '<td valign="top">Poor dog... I think he needs more love...</td>', 'Poor dog... I think he needs more love...', '2002-04-29 09:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55442, 1288, 509, '<td valign="top">lol.  good ground shot while maintaining a sense of humor.  I like how the horse looks as though the dog is thinking about it, sorta like how characters talk in comic strips.</td>', 'lol.  good ground shot while maintaining a sense of humor.  I like how the horse looks as though the dog is thinking about it, sorta like how characters talk in comic strips.', '2002-04-29 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55443, 1288, 1037, '<td valign="top">I love the way you captured this dog''s expression :). The horse in the tree gives the photo a surreal aspect, like a Chagall painting or something. I think though that it would be cool if the dog was more definitely the subject of the photo.</td>', 'I love the way you captured this dog''s expression :). The horse in the tree gives the photo a surreal aspect, like a Chagall painting or something. I think though that it would be cool if the dog was more definitely the subject of the photo.', '2002-04-29 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55444, 1288, 1034, '<td valign="top">seems a little more straight on, ya think?</td>', 'seems a little more straight on, ya think?', '2002-04-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55445, 1288, 1379, '<td valign="top">Your title is so witty!  This pup does not seem to mind the content of his chow...<br/><br/>Nice crispness on your pooch''s face.  Makes me want to kiss him!</td>', 'Your title is so witty!  This pup does not seem to mind the content of his chow...Nice crispness on your pooch''s face.  Makes me want to kiss him!', '2002-04-29 14:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55446, 1288, 1, '<td valign="top">It seems that this shot is more of "From the Ground, Over".  Looks like David Ey''s dog?</td>', 'It seems that this shot is more of "From the Ground, Over".  Looks like David Ey''s dog?', '2002-04-29 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55447, 1288, 962, '<td valign="top">No relation to the topic...</td>', 'No relation to the topic...', '2002-04-29 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55448, 1288, 675, '<td valign="top">haha, funny title, nice dog too</td>', 'haha, funny title, nice dog too', '2002-04-29 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55449, 1288, 459, '<td valign="top">Why the wood?</td>', 'Why the wood?', '2002-04-30 10:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55450, 1288, 885, '<td valign="top">It''s hard to tell if that horse is hanging from the tree or where it''s coming from...am I correct if I think it''s a small ornament hanging over the dog''s head to make him look like he''s dreaming of dog food?  I can see a faint white line.  If I''m not totally missing something (and if I am, I apologize), I think this would have been a lot better with a less busy, lighter colored background.</td>', 'It''s hard to tell if that horse is hanging from the tree or where it''s coming from...am I correct if I think it''s a small ornament hanging over the dog''s head to make him look like he''s dreaming of dog food?  I can see a faint white line.  If I''m not totally missing something (and if I am, I apologize), I think this would have been a lot better with a less busy, lighter colored background.', '2002-04-30 11:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55451, 1288, 1041, '<td valign="top">Would''ve preferred this w/out the groundup horse (but of course that would mean you''d need a new title, too) . . . and I''m not even a vegetarian!  Love the shot of the dog though, great perspective.</td>', 'Would''ve preferred this w/out the groundup horse (but of course that would mean you''d need a new title, too) . . . and I''m not even a vegetarian!  Love the shot of the dog though, great perspective.', '2002-04-30 17:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55452, 1288, 543, '<td valign="top">Okay... the horse is really intriguing.  The flash is very hard, and what caused the vignetting in the lower corners?  Good thing you didn''t try to ride just on the pun.</td>', 'Okay... the horse is really intriguing.  The flash is very hard, and what caused the vignetting in the lower corners?  Good thing you didn''t try to ride just on the pun.', '2002-05-01 11:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55453, 1288, 156, '<td valign="top">heehee, looks like SOMEone was avoiding looking at that big black eye...</td>', 'heehee, looks like SOMEone was avoiding looking at that big black eye...', '2002-05-01 12:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55454, 1288, 1078, '<td valign="top">it almost looks like the dog is "dreaming" of the horse -- I find the logs on the right, and all the space on the left unnecessary to the idea you seem to be presenting, perhaps a vertical crop?  The dog is also a lot brighter than the rest of the image (a flash, I''d guess) which would maybe be OK, except the horse seems to be the same color, just unlit...</td>', 'it almost looks like the dog is "dreaming" of the horse -- I find the logs on the right, and all the space on the left unnecessary to the idea you seem to be presenting, perhaps a vertical crop?  The dog is also a lot brighter than the rest of the image (a flash, I''d guess) which would maybe be OK, except the horse seems to be the same color, just unlit...', '2002-05-01 13:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55455, 1288, 878, '<td valign="top">The horse and photo title is slightly silly but this is a good shot.<br/></td>', 'The horse and photo title is slightly silly but this is a good shot.', '2002-05-01 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55456, 1288, 301, '<td valign="top">Would love the pic of the dog just by itself - show all of its paws and don''t worry about the pinata in the background.  Lighting is nice and even around the dog</td>', 'Would love the pic of the dog just by itself - show all of its paws and don''t worry about the pinata in the background.  Lighting is nice and even around the dog', '2002-05-02 06:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55457, 1288, 640, '<td valign="top">cute idea</td>', 'cute idea', '2002-05-02 08:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55458, 1288, 714, '<td valign="top">lol this is to funny.  Is he thinking the title?</td>', 'lol this is to funny.  Is he thinking the title?', '2002-05-02 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55459, 1288, 1414, '<td valign="top">They shoot horses don''t they?  Good Shot wing nut.      yuk.. yuk... yuk.</td>', 'They shoot horses don''t they?  Good Shot wing nut.      yuk.. yuk... yuk.', '2002-05-03 21:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55460, 1288, 1457, '<td valign="top">funny</td>', 'funny', '2002-05-04 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55461, 1288, 1070, '<td valign="top">I must admit the dog is way cute but the overall images doesnt do any thing for me. I would also have to say that the filling flash was a little harsh to look natural.</td>', 'I must admit the dog is way cute but the overall images doesnt do any thing for me. I would also have to say that the filling flash was a little harsh to look natural.', '2002-05-05 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55462, 1288, 813, '<td valign="top">The title suggests someting the picture does not really reveal. Good idea though, keep thinking like this and make the picture say the idea more clearly. :)</td>', 'The title suggests someting the picture does not really reveal. Good idea though, keep thinking like this and make the picture say the idea more clearly. :)', '2002-05-05 14:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55463, 1288, 2, '<td valign="top">I love the emotion of the dog in this picture, though I''m definitely thrown off by the flying horse.  What''s up with that?  Very cool picture, though.  Also, the slight hint of a dark corner in the bottom right... are you using a lens for this shot?</td>', 'I love the emotion of the dog in this picture, though I''m definitely thrown off by the flying horse.  What''s up with that?  Very cool picture, though.  Also, the slight hint of a dark corner in the bottom right... are you using a lens for this shot?', '2002-05-06 01:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55464, 1289, 1360, '<td valign="top">I thought the spirit of st. louis didnt have a radio in it...</td>', 'I thought the spirit of st. louis didnt have a radio in it...', '2002-04-29 02:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55465, 1289, 1070, '<td valign="top">amazing effects achieved in this photo<br/>The impression of aeronautical really adds to the shot<br/>I like it when the photograoher has put that little bit extra thought into their image to add an extrea dimention to the challange... well done... top marks</td>', 'amazing effects achieved in this photoThe impression of aeronautical really adds to the shotI like it when the photograoher has put that little bit extra thought into their image to add an extrea dimention to the challange... well done... top marks', '2002-04-29 03:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55466, 1289, 1233, '<td valign="top">Colors are a bit off.  Would have been nice to have more focus.</td>', 'Colors are a bit off.  Would have been nice to have more focus.', '2002-04-29 07:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55467, 1289, 301, '<td valign="top">too much reflection from shiny objects</td>', 'too much reflection from shiny objects', '2002-04-29 07:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55468, 1289, 885, '<td valign="top">The burned out dials really work, as well as the high contrast and sparse but bright colors.  It''s just to ever-so-slightly off-center as to seem like a mistake though - I might have liked it better had it been exactly symmetrical or more off-center.</td>', 'The burned out dials really work, as well as the high contrast and sparse but bright colors.  It''s just to ever-so-slightly off-center as to seem like a mistake though - I might have liked it better had it been exactly symmetrical or more off-center.', '2002-04-29 08:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55469, 1289, 1024, '<td valign="top">The contrast 0on this is rather harsh.</td>', 'The contrast 0on this is rather harsh.', '2002-04-29 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55470, 1289, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a neat photo but I am having trouble relating it to the challenge.  The foreground is out of focus.  It looks like your editing software got a little out of control with you as well.  The contrast here is very harsh.  I know that the Spirit of St Louis was an airplane but I don''t see an airplane in this photo.  Centering up those knobs at the bottom would have been helpful as well.</td>', 'This is a neat photo but I am having trouble relating it to the challenge.  The foreground is out of focus.  It looks like your editing software got a little out of control with you as well.  The contrast here is very harsh.  I know that the Spirit of St Louis was an airplane but I don''t see an airplane in this photo.  Centering up those knobs at the bottom would have been helpful as well.', '2002-04-29 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55471, 1289, 656, '<td valign="top">over processed, or over exposed ? Not quite sure.</td>', 'over processed, or over exposed ? Not quite sure.', '2002-04-29 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55472, 1289, 509, '<td valign="top">Interesting exposure.  Not sure how the title relates, the guages seem a little advanced to have come from the actual plane.....plus I don''t think they let people in the cockpit.  Doesn''t really fit my definition of the challenge</td>', 'Interesting exposure.  Not sure how the title relates, the guages seem a little advanced to have come from the actual plane.....plus I don''t think they let people in the cockpit.  Doesn''t really fit my definition of the challenge', '2002-04-29 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55473, 1289, 675, '<td valign="top">there are a few problems here...1)picture is offcenter...2)picture is washed out...3)picture isn''t really from the ground up...4)some of the dials aren''t even in focus</td>', 'there are a few problems here...1)picture is offcenter...2)picture is washed out...3)picture isn''t really from the ground up...4)some of the dials aren''t even in focus', '2002-04-29 10:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55474, 1289, 259, '<td valign="top">nice overexposure, you are probably getting a lot of comments about what you should have done to prevent it, like you are some sort of moron for not knowing what you have done.  people here only vote on what makes them feel good and warm inside, and not on originality or substance.  ignore the masses and do what you want.</td>', 'nice overexposure, you are probably getting a lot of comments about what you should have done to prevent it, like you are some sort of moron for not knowing what you have done.  people here only vote on what makes them feel good and warm inside, and not on originality or substance.  ignore the masses and do what you want.', '2002-04-29 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55475, 1289, 1368, '<td valign="top">cool</td>', 'cool', '2002-04-29 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55476, 1289, 203, '<td valign="top">AT least it''s not another guitar dude.</td>', 'AT least it''s not another guitar dude.', '2002-04-29 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55477, 1289, 1336, '<td valign="top">i dont see how this fits "from the ground up"</td>', 'i dont see how this fits "from the ground up"', '2002-04-29 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55478, 1289, 1175, '<td valign="top">That rocks.  I love the high saturation.</td>', 'That rocks.  I love the high saturation.', '2002-04-29 15:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55479, 1289, 962, '<td valign="top">Not sure how this is linked to "From The Ground Up"</td>', 'Not sure how this is linked to "From The Ground Up"', '2002-04-29 15:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55480, 1289, 933, '<td valign="top">Very very cool shot.  I like the visual effects applied to the photo - creates a great retro mood &amp; feel.  Nice job!</td>', 'Very very cool shot.  I like the visual effects applied to the photo - creates a great retro mood & feel.  Nice job!', '2002-04-29 23:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55481, 1289, 459, '<td valign="top">I like the high contrast look.  It makes the photo very "retro" looking.</td>', 'I like the high contrast look.  It makes the photo very "retro" looking.', '2002-04-30 10:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55482, 1289, 472, '<td valign="top">neat photo. i like the burnt out quality.  is this the actual plane?</td>', 'neat photo. i like the burnt out quality.  is this the actual plane?', '2002-04-30 11:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55483, 1289, 1041, '<td valign="top">Some of the colors are too blown out - you can''t really see the objects.  Also, the foreground isn''t all the way in focus.  Neat idea though.</td>', 'Some of the colors are too blown out - you can''t really see the objects.  Also, the foreground isn''t all the way in focus.  Neat idea though.', '2002-04-30 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55484, 1289, 387, '<td valign="top">great concept. I''m just not a fan of over-exposure.</td>', 'great concept. I''m just not a fan of over-exposure.', '2002-04-30 19:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55485, 1289, 543, '<td valign="top">The overexposure almost works here, but not (IMO) in combination with the oversharpening (looks pretty jaggy).  Symmetrical subjects like this usually look better centered, as well.</td>', 'The overexposure almost works here, but not (IMO) in combination with the oversharpening (looks pretty jaggy).  Symmetrical subjects like this usually look better centered, as well.', '2002-05-01 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55486, 1289, 1078, '<td valign="top">Initially, I wasn''t certain I liked the way this was so over adjusted (whether in camera or in computer doesn''t matter) but the lok grew on me.  I think I''d like it better if it were either more centered on the two middle switches or more off center.</td>', 'Initially, I wasn''t certain I liked the way this was so over adjusted (whether in camera or in computer doesn''t matter) but the lok grew on me.  I think I''d like it better if it were either more centered on the two middle switches or more off center.', '2002-05-01 14:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55487, 1289, 640, '<td valign="top">is it our of focus on purpose?</td>', 'is it our of focus on purpose?', '2002-05-03 01:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55488, 1289, 330, '<td valign="top">Not sure I get it. Too much contrast also hurts this picture.</td>', 'Not sure I get it. Too much contrast also hurts this picture.', '2002-05-03 07:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55489, 1289, 1, '<td valign="top">seems a little off-center.  nice over exposure and focus though.  not sure how you achieved this look, but it''s pretty nice.</td>', 'seems a little off-center.  nice over exposure and focus though.  not sure how you achieved this look, but it''s pretty nice.', '2002-05-04 11:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55490, 1289, 718, '<td valign="top">Nice contrast. Interesting pic.</td>', 'Nice contrast. Interesting pic.', '2002-05-04 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55491, 1289, 933, '<td valign="top">Utterly and completely baffled how this shot could have finished so low.  Wow....</td>', 'Utterly and completely baffled how this shot could have finished so low.  Wow....', '2002-05-06 09:40:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55492, 1289, 107, '<td valign="top">I do appreciate that Moondoggie-- and for everyone else, I''m going to take a minute to explain.<br/><br/>1.  The spirit of st.louis probably didn''t have a radio in it.. don''t pay so much attention to the title.. it''s simply a radio, and it is the Name of the radio.  It''s embossed on it.. thats what the design was based on.<br/><br/>2. No, I wasn''t in the cockpit of the airplane.<br/><br/>3.  This shot DID meet the criteria of the "ground up" challenge..  This radio was on a shelf, above my head, I layed on the floor below it (the ground), and took the picture from under the radio, hence the dramatic upwards angle.  It honestly seemed to me like if it wasn''t a picture with some sky in it, people didn''t think it was "from the ground up."<br/><br/>4.  I know it was over exposed and over sharpened with a really high contrast.   I personally liked that.. the origional image was rather dull, and it added some interest into it.  <br/><br/>5.  Symmetry is highly over-rated.</td>', 'I do appreciate that Moondoggie-- and for everyone else, I''m going to take a minute to explain.1.  The spirit of st.louis probably didn''t have a radio in it.. don''t pay so much attention to the title.. it''s simply a radio, and it is the Name of the radio.  It''s embossed on it.. thats what the design was based on.2. No, I wasn''t in the cockpit of the airplane.3.  This shot DID meet the criteria of the "ground up" challenge..  This radio was on a shelf, above my head, I layed on the floor below it (the ground), and took the picture from under the radio, hence the dramatic upwards angle.  It honestly seemed to me like if it wasn''t a picture with some sky in it, people didn''t think it was "from the ground up."4.  I know it was over exposed and over sharpened with a really high contrast.   I personally liked that.. the origional image was rather dull, and it added some interest into it.  5.  Symmetry is highly over-rated.', '2002-05-06 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55493, 1289, 1, '<td valign="top">5. Symmetry is highly over-rated.<br/><br/>lies.<br/></td>', '5. Symmetry is highly over-rated.lies.', '2002-05-08 06:46:00.000000', NULL, 0),
