(55504, 1293, 301, '<td valign="top">he he ... I was thinking of doing something similar.  Nicely done.  Good job on the focussing too.  I would have moved/ripped out some of the grass on the left so that they didn''t get in the way of the shoe, and showed a little bit more sky.  Just my opinion tho''</td>', 'he he ... I was thinking of doing something similar.  Nicely done.  Good job on the focussing too.  I would have moved/ripped out some of the grass on the left so that they didn''t get in the way of the shoe, and showed a little bit more sky.  Just my opinion tho''', '2002-04-30 07:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
