(55513, 1293, 885, '<td valign="top">Cute.  Well exposed, I think.  The lighting on the bottom of the book works well to emphasize its texture, as well as that of the grass.  You could easily have ended up with a blown out or completely white sky, but it looks pretty good.</td>', 'Cute.  Well exposed, I think.  The lighting on the bottom of the book works well to emphasize its texture, as well as that of the grass.  You could easily have ended up with a blown out or completely white sky, but it looks pretty good.', '2002-05-03 15:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
