(55520, 1294, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice interpreation of this challenge.  I don''t know why but this photo just doesn''t grab me.  I don''t see anything wrong with it on the technical side, so my distaste is on the subjective side.  I wonder what I am looking at.  It appears to be a wall of some sort but I''m not entirely sure.  Maybe in the future, the subject of your challenge could be more distinct and more visually impacting.  Keep up the good work!</td>', 'This is a nice interpreation of this challenge.  I don''t know why but this photo just doesn''t grab me.  I don''t see anything wrong with it on the technical side, so my distaste is on the subjective side.  I wonder what I am looking at.  It appears to be a wall of some sort but I''m not entirely sure.  Maybe in the future, the subject of your challenge could be more distinct and more visually impacting.  Keep up the good work!', '2002-04-29 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
