(55574, 1297, 962, '<td valign="top">What a title !!! Scooter-chicks look cool !!!</td>', 'What a title !!! Scooter-chicks look cool !!!', '2002-04-29 16:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55575, 1297, 327, '<td valign="top">Looks like fun. Love the colors but their heads are cut off?<br/>Nice photo all the same.</td>', 'Looks like fun. Love the colors but their heads are cut off?Nice photo all the same.', '2002-04-29 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55576, 1297, 1034, '<td valign="top">this looks more like a straight forward shot than ''from the ground UP.''  you can''t even see above their heads.  sorry.</td>', 'this looks more like a straight forward shot than ''from the ground UP.''  you can''t even see above their heads.  sorry.', '2002-04-29 16:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55577, 1297, 117, '<td valign="top">bandits i like that</td>', 'bandits i like that', '2002-04-29 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55578, 1297, 1381, '<td valign="top">WTF</td>', 'WTF', '2002-04-29 20:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55579, 1297, 1283, '<td valign="top">Great effect shot......Very clear in the centre..Good work....</td>', 'Great effect shot......Very clear in the centre..Good work....', '2002-04-30 03:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55580, 1297, 587, '<td valign="top">I want her shoes! :)  Nifty pic, however - from the ground up?</td>', 'I want her shoes! :)  Nifty pic, however - from the ground up?', '2002-04-30 07:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55581, 1297, 885, '<td valign="top">Cool colors, impressive technique.  Why is she wearing a mask, she looks like a bandit?  Minor nitpicks: white sneakers are a big overexposed and the top of the girl''s head is cut off.  Otherwise, very nice.</td>', 'Cool colors, impressive technique.  Why is she wearing a mask, she looks like a bandit?  Minor nitpicks: white sneakers are a big overexposed and the top of the girl''s head is cut off.  Otherwise, very nice.', '2002-04-30 08:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55582, 1297, 472, '<td valign="top">love this pic, didnt know they rode those things sidesaddle.  too bad you had to photoshop the whole thing to make it look like that ;) .. btw, have you ever used a samick strat with a peavey 15?  sounds RAD.  o, what''s a camera?  thanks ;)</td>', 'love this pic, didnt know they rode those things sidesaddle.  too bad you had to photoshop the whole thing to make it look like that ;) .. btw, have you ever used a samick strat with a peavey 15?  sounds RAD.  o, what''s a camera?  thanks ;)', '2002-04-30 09:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55583, 1297, 459, '<td valign="top">Nice motion shot.  Great colors!  Just missed on the framing</td>', 'Nice motion shot.  Great colors!  Just missed on the framing', '2002-04-30 10:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55584, 1297, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very cool idea and would''ve been awesome photo if the girl''s head wasn''t half chopped off.  Love the panning - crisp girls and scooter, blurry background.  IMO, it doesn''t really fulfill the challenge as it was intended.</td>', 'Very cool idea and would''ve been awesome photo if the girl''s head wasn''t half chopped off.  Love the panning - crisp girls and scooter, blurry background.  IMO, it doesn''t really fulfill the challenge as it was intended.', '2002-04-30 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55585, 1297, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice photo but weak on the ''Ground Up''.</td>', 'Very nice photo but weak on the ''Ground Up''.', '2002-04-30 17:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55586, 1297, 1078, '<td valign="top">nice pan -- not sure I dig the way the girl''s head has been cropped out of the picture -- also, while the camera angle is low, I''m not entirely certain how this meets the challenge objective, even though it''s an overall well done photo</td>', 'nice pan -- not sure I dig the way the girl''s head has been cropped out of the picture -- also, while the camera angle is low, I''m not entirely certain how this meets the challenge objective, even though it''s an overall well done photo', '2002-05-01 14:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55587, 1297, 748, '<td valign="top">Don''t see much "up" in here, but a nice shot nevertheless.</td>', 'Don''t see much "up" in here, but a nice shot nevertheless.', '2002-05-01 15:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55588, 1297, 142, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo.  I''m not really too sure it is what the challenge was asking for though.  Perhaps a lower angle pointing upwards would remove that doubt.  I would also try to frame the women better to avoid cropping any heads.</td>', 'This is an interesting photo.  I''m not really too sure it is what the challenge was asking for though.  Perhaps a lower angle pointing upwards would remove that doubt.  I would also try to frame the women better to avoid cropping any heads.', '2002-05-01 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55589, 1297, 933, '<td valign="top">Certainly is an interesting title.  I like the sense of motion created in this shot.  But not too consistent with this weeks challenge topic.</td>', 'Certainly is an interesting title.  I like the sense of motion created in this shot.  But not too consistent with this weeks challenge topic.', '2002-05-02 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55590, 1297, 811, '<td valign="top">Nice colors, good idea.  Would have liked to see both faces</td>', 'Nice colors, good idea.  Would have liked to see both faces', '2002-05-02 15:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55591, 1297, 330, '<td valign="top">Good picture, but doesn''t jump out as a from the groound up shot.</td>', 'Good picture, but doesn''t jump out as a from the groound up shot.', '2002-05-03 07:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55592, 1297, 637, '<td valign="top">Yes its all that but its not really a severe enuf angle from the ground up.</td>', 'Yes its all that but its not really a severe enuf angle from the ground up.', '2002-05-04 00:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55593, 1297, 718, '<td valign="top">I like this one. Where is this at? Sexy girls!</td>', 'I like this one. Where is this at? Sexy girls!', '2002-05-04 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55594, 1297, 1457, '<td valign="top">there''s a lot skill there, colors are rad, subject is interesting</td>', 'there''s a lot skill there, colors are rad, subject is interesting', '2002-05-04 23:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55595, 1297, 910, '<td valign="top">amazing pic.</td>', 'amazing pic.', '2002-05-05 03:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55596, 1297, 1469, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!  Looks like something out of an Austin Powers movie!</td>', 'Very interesting!  Looks like something out of an Austin Powers movie!', '2002-05-05 18:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55597, 1297, 1, '<td valign="top">from ground up isn''t really represented here.</td>', 'from ground up isn''t really represented here.', '2002-05-05 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55598, 1298, 656, '<td valign="top">hard to expose this well.</td>', 'hard to expose this well.', '2002-04-29 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55599, 1298, 675, '<td valign="top">doubt this is actually meeting the challenge...otherwise this shot rules</td>', 'doubt this is actually meeting the challenge...otherwise this shot rules', '2002-04-29 10:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55600, 1298, 1269, '<td valign="top">Nice flare.  I like the exposure control... Not underexposed, but i can see something besides sun.  Very nice.  Critique?  Um.....   I''m thinking...  Okay, I dont know how it could be improved in such a difficult setting, cause i''m not exactly an expert... But there is a lot of pixelation on the trees.</td>', 'Nice flare.  I like the exposure control... Not underexposed, but i can see something besides sun.  Very nice.  Critique?  Um.....   I''m thinking...  Okay, I dont know how it could be improved in such a difficult setting, cause i''m not exactly an expert... But there is a lot of pixelation on the trees.', '2002-04-29 14:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55601, 1298, 1379, '<td valign="top">Blaze!</td>', 'Blaze!', '2002-04-29 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55602, 1298, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting shot!  The sun is off center... in a shot liek this, I would prefer to see the sun either centered or at one of the ''thirds'' intersection points as described in the rule of thirds...</td>', 'This is an interesting shot!  The sun is off center... in a shot liek this, I would prefer to see the sun either centered or at one of the ''thirds'' intersection points as described in the rule of thirds...', '2002-04-29 15:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55603, 1298, 962, '<td valign="top">Did you burn/degrade your camera CCD after taking this shot ?</td>', 'Did you burn/degrade your camera CCD after taking this shot ?', '2002-04-29 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55604, 1298, 142, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.  I like the starburst effect of the sun.  I hope you will share with us the technique you used for this.</td>', 'Very pretty.  I like the starburst effect of the sun.  I hope you will share with us the technique you used for this.', '2002-04-29 21:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55605, 1298, 1041, '<td valign="top">Very definitely a "from the ground up" shot.  Personally, I think though that the sun and flare it too overpowering.  The tree branches are a little soft, too.</td>', 'Very definitely a "from the ground up" shot.  Personally, I think though that the sun and flare it too overpowering.  The tree branches are a little soft, too.', '2002-04-30 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55606, 1298, 885, '<td valign="top">You''ll ruin your eyes looking straight at the sun like that :-)  Was the pinkish cast there, or is that some sort of lens effect comparable to what happens to your eyes when you do that?</td>', 'You''ll ruin your eyes looking straight at the sun like that :-)  Was the pinkish cast there, or is that some sort of lens effect comparable to what happens to your eyes when you do that?', '2002-04-30 12:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55607, 1298, 554, '<td valign="top">I thought you weren''t supost to do that. Did you use a filter? Nice one.</td>', 'I thought you weren''t supost to do that. Did you use a filter? Nice one.', '2002-04-30 21:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55608, 1298, 543, '<td valign="top">Subtitle: the last thing a digicam ever sees.  If you don''t have a ttl, optical viewfinder (ie. you have to compose using the LCD with the CCD exposed to the sun for more than an instant), this can destroy your CCD, and if you do it can destroy your eye (at least so I''ve heard).  That said, not a bad image.</td>', 'Subtitle: the last thing a digicam ever sees.  If you don''t have a ttl, optical viewfinder (ie. you have to compose using the LCD with the CCD exposed to the sun for more than an instant), this can destroy your CCD, and if you do it can destroy your eye (at least so I''ve heard).  That said, not a bad image.', '2002-05-01 10:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55609, 1298, 1078, '<td valign="top">personally, I''d like to see the branches be a little crisper -- maybe a little sharpen?</td>', 'personally, I''d like to see the branches be a little crisper -- maybe a little sharpen?', '2002-05-01 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55610, 1298, 1191, '<td valign="top">Well exposed considering the subject.</td>', 'Well exposed considering the subject.', '2002-05-02 16:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55611, 1298, 330, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t jump out as a from the ground up picture, just up.</td>', 'Doesn''t jump out as a from the ground up picture, just up.', '2002-05-03 06:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55612, 1298, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, decently centered (could move it a little upwards).  Maybe a little less exposure to reduce the vertical line a bit (though not completely).</td>', 'Cool shot, decently centered (could move it a little upwards).  Maybe a little less exposure to reduce the vertical line a bit (though not completely).', '2002-05-03 09:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55613, 1298, 886, '<td valign="top">"Never point your digital camera directly at the sun"... unless you are sure you are going to get an outstanding picture!</td>', '"Never point your digital camera directly at the sun"... unless you are sure you are going to get an outstanding picture!', '2002-05-04 02:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55614, 1298, 1070, '<td valign="top">Good shot with the silhouetted branches.<br/>But it has to be said be careful when taking shots like this, directly at the sun, DONT use the viewfinder !!!<br/></td>', 'Good shot with the silhouetted branches.But it has to be said be careful when taking shots like this, directly at the sun, DONT use the viewfinder !!!', '2002-05-05 11:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55615, 1298, 428, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments! I have a UV filter on my lens so hopefully that has helped to protect it. I was wearing my high powered UV blocker sunglasses too!  I haven''t noticed any degradation in my camera this week after taking this shot (and a few others) so hopefully I didn''t ruin my camera.  I wasn''t looking directly at the sun, (my camera has a LCD screen, (not a TTL viewfinder) .  After reading all these comments, I won''t recommend that you try and do this yourself!<br/><br/>But here are the details for those that asked...<br/>I used a -1.5 EV and set the camera on the "Beach &amp; Ski" mode (for taking photos in bright light). I used Microsoft PhotoEditor and cropped out a bit of the house, set the contrast at 60 and the brightness at 40 (default is 50) I reduced the red to .83 and increased the blue to 1.33 (default 1.0 on both).  Resized to 640x427<br/><br/>Thanks again for the comments!</td>', 'Thanks for the comments! I have a UV filter on my lens so hopefully that has helped to protect it. I was wearing my high powered UV blocker sunglasses too!  I haven''t noticed any degradation in my camera this week after taking this shot (and a few others) so hopefully I didn''t ruin my camera.  I wasn''t looking directly at the sun, (my camera has a LCD screen, (not a TTL viewfinder) .  After reading all these comments, I won''t recommend that you try and do this yourself!But here are the details for those that asked...I used a -1.5 EV and set the camera on the "Beach & Ski" mode (for taking photos in bright light). I used Microsoft PhotoEditor and cropped out a bit of the house, set the contrast at 60 and the brightness at 40 (default is 50) I reduced the red to .83 and increased the blue to 1.33 (default 1.0 on both).  Resized to 640x427Thanks again for the comments!', '2002-05-06 13:29:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55616, 1299, 352, '<td valign="top">Very nice!!</td>', 'Very nice!!', '2002-04-29 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55617, 1299, 1024, '<td valign="top">Great use of depth of field.  Nice photo.</td>', 'Great use of depth of field.  Nice photo.', '2002-04-29 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55618, 1299, 656, '<td valign="top">Nice depth of field, but the blade on the right is distracting.  Maybe cropping it vertically and just the left side would have been stronger ?</td>', 'Nice depth of field, but the blade on the right is distracting.  Maybe cropping it vertically and just the left side would have been stronger ?', '2002-04-29 09:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55619, 1299, 862, '<td valign="top">Excellent job.  Good depth of field and great color.</td>', 'Excellent job.  Good depth of field and great color.', '2002-04-29 10:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55620, 1299, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and nice bright blue sky.  The airplane line on the background is unfortunate.</td>', 'I like the composition and nice bright blue sky.  The airplane line on the background is unfortunate.', '2002-04-29 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55621, 1299, 259, '<td valign="top">everyone seems to like dandelions, but you did a better job.</td>', 'everyone seems to like dandelions, but you did a better job.', '2002-04-29 12:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55622, 1299, 1371, '<td valign="top">Nice job on the depth of field.</td>', 'Nice job on the depth of field.', '2002-04-29 12:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55623, 1299, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice, very nice.</td>', 'Nice, very nice.', '2002-04-29 13:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55624, 1299, 1175, '<td valign="top">The blades of grass on the right are distracting.  Other than this its a great photo.  Might have been nicer if the background was all blue sky.</td>', 'The blades of grass on the right are distracting.  Other than this its a great photo.  Might have been nicer if the background was all blue sky.', '2002-04-29 14:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55625, 1299, 813, '<td valign="top">OK, this photo breaks all the rules of compositon yet somehow it works very well. I think it''s the nearly horizontal line of the contrail in the sky that brings my eye back into to picture and keeps me looking at the subject. Bravo on an unusually terrific composition.</td>', 'OK, this photo breaks all the rules of compositon yet somehow it works very well. I think it''s the nearly horizontal line of the contrail in the sky that brings my eye back into to picture and keeps me looking at the subject. Bravo on an unusually terrific composition.', '2002-04-29 15:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55626, 1299, 327, '<td valign="top">Bravo! Nicely done.</td>', 'Bravo! Nicely done.', '2002-04-29 15:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55627, 1299, 544, '<td valign="top">What great focus you have in this picture! That dandelion is the focal point, and appropriately, it is in great great focus, while everything else has a nice blur to it. That''s great use of manual focus, and not a lot of people seem to be as good at it, which is why I have to bring it up :) Nice framing, though I would have waited for the airplane trail to dissolve, if I could have, as it is somewhat distracting (on the minor, nitpicky level). Good shot, and one that I am sure will be among the top contenders this week.</td>', 'What great focus you have in this picture! That dandelion is the focal point, and appropriately, it is in great great focus, while everything else has a nice blur to it. That''s great use of manual focus, and not a lot of people seem to be as good at it, which is why I have to bring it up :) Nice framing, though I would have waited for the airplane trail to dissolve, if I could have, as it is somewhat distracting (on the minor, nitpicky level). Good shot, and one that I am sure will be among the top contenders this week.', '2002-04-29 15:47:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(55628, 1299, 962, '<td valign="top">Good color &amp; control DOF. However, could not relate much to the topic.</td>', 'Good color & control DOF. However, could not relate much to the topic.', '2002-04-29 16:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55629, 1299, 675, '<td valign="top">i like this one because the dandy seems to be in between the blade of grass in the foreground and the tree in the background, nice creativity</td>', 'i like this one because the dandy seems to be in between the blade of grass in the foreground and the tree in the background, nice creativity', '2002-04-29 18:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55630, 1299, 724, '<td valign="top">You really got down with this challenge, Congrats, Nice Job!</td>', 'You really got down with this challenge, Congrats, Nice Job!', '2002-04-29 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55631, 1299, 772, '<td valign="top">This is nice!  The clarity on the dandilion is excellent.  Looks like a Boeing slipped into your photo!  Good job...</td>', 'This is nice!  The clarity on the dandilion is excellent.  Looks like a Boeing slipped into your photo!  Good job...', '2002-04-30 05:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55632, 1299, 640, '<td valign="top">beautiful! The focus and depth of field are terrific. the flower seems almost 3d.</td>', 'beautiful! The focus and depth of field are terrific. the flower seems almost 3d.', '2002-04-30 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55633, 1299, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective and framing.  The dandelion is very sharp!  The blurry blades of grass in the foreground on the rigth are pretty distracting though.</td>', 'Nice perspective and framing.  The dandelion is very sharp!  The blurry blades of grass in the foreground on the rigth are pretty distracting though.', '2002-04-30 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55634, 1299, 142, '<td valign="top">Nice focus.  I think the photo would have more balance if the right side was cropped where the out of focus leaves are.  The photo would probably end up as a 480x640 instead of 640x480 but it would have a little more impact.  Overall, great job.</td>', 'Nice focus.  I think the photo would have more balance if the right side was cropped where the out of focus leaves are.  The photo would probably end up as a 480x640 instead of 640x480 but it would have a little more impact.  Overall, great job.', '2002-04-30 16:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55635, 1299, 1135, '<td valign="top">Very nice Focus and color. The blade of grass on the right is a little distracting to me.</td>', 'Very nice Focus and color. The blade of grass on the right is a little distracting to me.', '2002-04-30 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55636, 1299, 543, '<td valign="top">Good color and clarity.  Don''t know if I''m for or against the dandelion being against the tree, but the blade of oof grass at R is way irritating.</td>', 'Good color and clarity.  Don''t know if I''m for or against the dandelion being against the tree, but the blade of oof grass at R is way irritating.', '2002-05-01 10:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55637, 1299, 301, '<td valign="top">great use of DOF in this shot.  Think I''d prefer to see a little more sky, and have the subject further down in the picture</td>', 'great use of DOF in this shot.  Think I''d prefer to see a little more sky, and have the subject further down in the picture', '2002-05-02 05:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55638, 1299, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice DOF, well framed by forground grass on the right.</td>', 'Nice DOF, well framed by forground grass on the right.', '2002-05-02 20:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55639, 1299, 330, '<td valign="top">I tried a similar shot, but didn''t really like it. Would be nice if you could have caught a few seeds "Blowin in the Wind". Good shot!</td>', 'I tried a similar shot, but didn''t really like it. Would be nice if you could have caught a few seeds "Blowin in the Wind". Good shot!', '2002-05-03 07:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55640, 1299, 1457, '<td valign="top">the jet stream is what does it for me</td>', 'the jet stream is what does it for me', '2002-05-04 23:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55641, 1299, 1, '<td valign="top">I like it, but the blade of grass on the right is distracting.</td>', 'I like it, but the blade of grass on the right is distracting.', '2002-05-05 23:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55642, 1299, 145, '<td valign="top">Thanks for all the constructive comments. I agree that the blade of grass at the bottom right is in the way, but I wanted it there to emphasize the relationships in the picture: blade of grass&amp;gt;dandilion&amp;gt;tree&amp;gt;jet trail. Again thanks for all the comments.</td>', 'Thanks for all the constructive comments. I agree that the blade of grass at the bottom right is in the way, but I wanted it there to emphasize the relationships in the picture: blade of grass&gt;dandilion&gt;tree&gt;jet trail. Again thanks for all the comments.', '2002-05-07 12:51:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55643, 1300, 1024, '<td valign="top">A little more depth of field would have made this a better photo.</td>', 'A little more depth of field would have made this a better photo.', '2002-04-29 08:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55644, 1300, 656, '<td valign="top">seems very busy without a real point</td>', 'seems very busy without a real point', '2002-04-29 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55645, 1300, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good interpretation of this challenge.  Good depth of field is difficult to achieve on a shot like this one.  I was successful on shots of this nature by setting my camera to macro mode and then using aperture priority to get the smallest aperture possible.  Also, if you would step back about a foot from the pole so the the camera lens is not right up against it, you would get the clean focus all the way up... Play with this concept some and see what you think :)  See the shot in this challenge called "Power" to get an idea of what I mean by stepping back from the subject a little.. I believe this shot perfectly describes my notes to you...</td>', 'This is a good interpretation of this challenge.  Good depth of field is difficult to achieve on a shot like this one.  I was successful on shots of this nature by setting my camera to macro mode and then using aperture priority to get the smallest aperture possible.  Also, if you would step back about a foot from the pole so the the camera lens is not right up against it, you would get the clean focus all the way up... Play with this concept some and see what you think :)  See the shot in this challenge called "Power" to get an idea of what I mean by stepping back from the subject a little.. I believe this shot perfectly describes my notes to you...', '2002-04-29 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55646, 1300, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice sky.  Did you try rotating the picture so that the vertical lines on the right were parallel to the side of the frame?</td>', 'Nice sky.  Did you try rotating the picture so that the vertical lines on the right were parallel to the side of the frame?', '2002-04-29 10:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55647, 1300, 259, '<td valign="top">as i mentioned on someone elses picture, i am not a fan of power lines.  just a personal preference.</td>', 'as i mentioned on someone elses picture, i am not a fan of power lines.  just a personal preference.', '2002-04-29 11:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55648, 1300, 156, '<td valign="top">interesting composition</td>', 'interesting composition', '2002-04-29 11:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55649, 1300, 544, '<td valign="top">I really like in-focus/out-of-focus pictures, so maybe this is just my own personal "thing", but the only suggestion that I can give here is that it would have been nice to have gotten the pole more in focus, even if that meant using the macro feature to get the base in focus, and everything else more blurred. Then again, a lot of people don''t seem to appreciate that style, so my suggestion is probably bad. Nice coloring on the sky - it''s hard to get a rich blue color, yet get the clouds that nice as well, yet still have the pole lit enough to have detail and texture. Good job overall.</td>', 'I really like in-focus/out-of-focus pictures, so maybe this is just my own personal "thing", but the only suggestion that I can give here is that it would have been nice to have gotten the pole more in focus, even if that meant using the macro feature to get the base in focus, and everything else more blurred. Then again, a lot of people don''t seem to appreciate that style, so my suggestion is probably bad. Nice coloring on the sky - it''s hard to get a rich blue color, yet get the clouds that nice as well, yet still have the pole lit enough to have detail and texture. Good job overall.', '2002-04-29 13:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55650, 1300, 1336, '<td valign="top">subject wasnt very well lit.</td>', 'subject wasnt very well lit.', '2002-04-29 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55651, 1300, 1379, '<td valign="top">Love the wood pole against the harshness of the wires.... very intense</td>', 'Love the wood pole against the harshness of the wires.... very intense', '2002-04-29 14:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55652, 1300, 675, '<td valign="top">to me this shot is bad, very bad, but that is only because of all the power lines</td>', 'to me this shot is bad, very bad, but that is only because of all the power lines', '2002-04-29 18:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55653, 1300, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nicely done.</td>', 'Nicely done.', '2002-04-30 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55654, 1300, 888, '<td valign="top">thats come out pretty well, I''m sure you have had plenty of comments that its cliched but that doesn''t mena its a bad picture.<br/>I personally would have gone around the post a bit more so you had the two sets of cables coming in at angles, like a Y.  Does that make sense?</td>', 'thats come out pretty well, I''m sure you have had plenty of comments that its cliched but that doesn''t mena its a bad picture.I personally would have gone around the post a bit more so you had the two sets of cables coming in at angles, like a Y.  Does that make sense?', '2002-04-30 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55655, 1300, 441, '<td valign="top">strong composition here, could you have sqeezed some more depth of field here - see ''squirrel escape route'' entry.</td>', 'strong composition here, could you have sqeezed some more depth of field here - see ''squirrel escape route'' entry.', '2002-04-30 18:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55656, 1300, 1209, '<td valign="top">A little "busy", but good focus.</td>', 'A little "busy", but good focus.', '2002-04-30 20:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55657, 1300, 543, '<td valign="top">Certianly the best of it''s kind in this challenge.  Very nice light and lines.</td>', 'Certianly the best of it''s kind in this challenge.  Very nice light and lines.', '2002-05-01 04:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55658, 1300, 1, '<td valign="top">The shot looks massive from your angle.  The lighting is pretty intriguing (very light sky, but dark post).  Very well done.</td>', 'The shot looks massive from your angle.  The lighting is pretty intriguing (very light sky, but dark post).  Very well done.', '2002-05-01 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55659, 1300, 1078, '<td valign="top">nice and simple with a good composition</td>', 'nice and simple with a good composition', '2002-05-01 16:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55660, 1300, 933, '<td valign="top">The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.</td>', 'The subject of this image just does not do a lot for me.', '2002-05-02 15:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55661, 1300, 1457, '<td valign="top">again?</td>', 'again?', '2002-05-04 23:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55662, 1302, 352, '<td valign="top">IKEA!!  Excellent example of a great shot with limited resources.  Good DOF, nice focus, like the lighting.  Very nice!</td>', 'IKEA!!  Excellent example of a great shot with limited resources.  Good DOF, nice focus, like the lighting.  Very nice!', '2002-04-29 01:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55663, 1302, 107, '<td valign="top">very clever... it saves damaging your camera.. like I almost did when my husband lost his balance... Oups!</td>', 'very clever... it saves damaging your camera.. like I almost did when my husband lost his balance... Oups!', '2002-04-29 04:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55664, 1302, 301, '<td valign="top">angle isn''t quite right for me</td>', 'angle isn''t quite right for me', '2002-04-29 08:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55665, 1302, 885, '<td valign="top">The lighting is pretty nice and the figure really feels like it''s in action, jumping off a wall or something. I do wish that the fraction of the hand on the left side wasn''t cropped out, and I wonder why it looks so grainy?</td>', 'The lighting is pretty nice and the figure really feels like it''s in action, jumping off a wall or something. I do wish that the fraction of the hand on the left side wasn''t cropped out, and I wonder why it looks so grainy?', '2002-04-29 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55666, 1302, 656, '<td valign="top">good interpretation - cropped too tightly on the left though.  Needs some sort of interesting background, maybe outside with sky/clouds ?</td>', 'good interpretation - cropped too tightly on the left though.  Needs some sort of interesting background, maybe outside with sky/clouds ?', '2002-04-29 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55667, 1302, 259, '<td valign="top">i like the simplicity.  although it seems, at least on my monitor, that this picture was over sharpened.</td>', 'i like the simplicity.  although it seems, at least on my monitor, that this picture was over sharpened.', '2002-04-29 10:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55668, 1302, 327, '<td valign="top">Not the most original idea, but you have done it very well. I like the angle.</td>', 'Not the most original idea, but you have done it very well. I like the angle.', '2002-04-29 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55669, 1302, 1379, '<td valign="top">Interesting</td>', 'Interesting', '2002-04-29 15:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55670, 1302, 689, '<td valign="top">I like this ... interesting twist! Seems a little grainy ... maybe increase your lighting?</td>', 'I like this ... interesting twist! Seems a little grainy ... maybe increase your lighting?', '2002-04-29 15:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55671, 1302, 544, '<td valign="top">How odd that we have two uniquely creative photos that are so similar! Your photo does a great job of getting the texture of the wood, but it seems kind of too sharp, like there are little speckles throughout the photo. As well, some of the wood seems to be slightly out of focus, such as the foot. I think with this picture, the image isn''t very deep in terms of field of depth, and doesn''t suggest an image that should have parts in and part sout of focus. Does that make sense? Nice and simple - good job :)</td>', 'How odd that we have two uniquely creative photos that are so similar! Your photo does a great job of getting the texture of the wood, but it seems kind of too sharp, like there are little speckles throughout the photo. As well, some of the wood seems to be slightly out of focus, such as the foot. I think with this picture, the image isn''t very deep in terms of field of depth, and doesn''t suggest an image that should have parts in and part sout of focus. Does that make sense? Nice and simple - good job :)', '2002-04-29 15:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55672, 1302, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting photo...  I like the perspective here... i would also like it better if there was more foreground/background contrast to really enhance the presence of the wooden mannequin...</td>', 'This is an interesting photo...  I like the perspective here... i would also like it better if there was more foreground/background contrast to really enhance the presence of the wooden mannequin...', '2002-04-29 16:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55673, 1302, 675, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2002-04-29 18:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55674, 1302, 89, '<td valign="top">you can see her naughty parts. background color too similar to subject.</td>', 'you can see her naughty parts. background color too similar to subject.', '2002-04-29 21:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55675, 1302, 843, '<td valign="top">Would be better with a Van Gough in the background. Sorry, coudn''t resist.</td>', 'Would be better with a Van Gough in the background. Sorry, coudn''t resist.', '2002-04-29 22:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55676, 1302, 1037, '<td valign="top">There''s a subtelty to the colours here that I like, as well as the positioning of the dummy, but as I said on the other dummy photo, those things are kinda cliched.</td>', 'There''s a subtelty to the colours here that I like, as well as the positioning of the dummy, but as I said on the other dummy photo, those things are kinda cliched.', '2002-04-30 02:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55677, 1302, 1283, '<td valign="top">Great idea and presentation for a picture</td>', 'Great idea and presentation for a picture', '2002-04-30 03:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55678, 1302, 813, '<td valign="top">What are the chances of that. Two submissions with the same exact model in them. I''ll treat this as if I hadn''t seen the other. Good idea, and excellent depth of field. I like that you obviously worked to make the background plain and even. The composition is good, the angle gives it a menacing effect. Bravo on a good idea well executed!</td>', 'What are the chances of that. Two submissions with the same exact model in them. I''ll treat this as if I hadn''t seen the other. Good idea, and excellent depth of field. I like that you obviously worked to make the background plain and even. The composition is good, the angle gives it a menacing effect. Bravo on a good idea well executed!', '2002-04-30 10:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55679, 1302, 888, '<td valign="top">ha ha great idea</td>', 'ha ha great idea', '2002-04-30 17:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55680, 1302, 543, '<td valign="top">This would probably make a really nice B/W, if you''re into that.  You just need to do something about the noise.  Probably better rotated 90° CW, and I''d have included all of the hand.  Otherwise nicely composed (guess I would have rotated the torso just a little CCW to straighten in out - makes the pose just a little weird).  What''s the shadow near the elbow?</td>', 'This would probably make a really nice B/W, if you''re into that.  You just need to do something about the noise.  Probably better rotated 90° CW, and I''d have included all of the hand.  Otherwise nicely composed (guess I would have rotated the torso just a little CCW to straighten in out - makes the pose just a little weird).  What''s the shadow near the elbow?', '2002-05-01 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55681, 1302, 1041, '<td valign="top">Nice!  The hand on the left is just a little cut off, but great focus and everything!</td>', 'Nice!  The hand on the left is just a little cut off, but great focus and everything!', '2002-05-01 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55682, 1302, 748, '<td valign="top">The shot looks a little grainy (no pun intended!) to me.  Were you taking at a lower resolution that your camera permits?  I do like the perspective.</td>', 'The shot looks a little grainy (no pun intended!) to me.  Were you taking at a lower resolution that your camera permits?  I do like the perspective.', '2002-05-01 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55683, 1302, 1, '<td valign="top">I like the cropping on the right and top, but I don''t think I would''ve clipped his hand as you did.</td>', 'I like the cropping on the right and top, but I don''t think I would''ve clipped his hand as you did.', '2002-05-02 09:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55684, 1302, 1457, '<td valign="top">it been done better</td>', 'it been done better', '2002-05-04 23:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55685, 1302, 2, '<td valign="top">Cool angle, but sadly you have to compete with the other person who had your idea -- I like his choice of background better.  Your tan background doesn''t provide enough contrast for the subject.</td>', 'Cool angle, but sadly you have to compete with the other person who had your idea -- I like his choice of background better.  Your tan background doesn''t provide enough contrast for the subject.', '2002-05-06 00:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55686, 1302, 472, '<td valign="top">great minds think alike, remie.  i really like the angle you chose for your dummy : )</td>', 'great minds think alike, remie.  i really like the angle you chose for your dummy : )', '2002-05-06 07:33:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55687, 1302, 715, '<td valign="top">Thanks for the comments. I had to cut of the hand on the left to hide a seam in the ceiling (wich can still be seen near the elbow as well). It looks grainy because of the structure of teh ceiling and because the limps of the dummy are not sand-paperded and therefor have a rough grainy looking structure.<br/>I wanted to use a van Gogh painting as a background, but it got stolen just before I was going to make the picture :-)</td>', 'Thanks for the comments. I had to cut of the hand on the left to hide a seam in the ceiling (wich can still be seen near the elbow as well). It looks grainy because of the structure of teh ceiling and because the limps of the dummy are not sand-paperded and therefor have a rough grainy looking structure.I wanted to use a van Gogh painting as a background, but it got stolen just before I was going to make the picture :-)', '2002-05-06 14:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55688, 1304, 205, '<td valign="top">closing down the aperature would have given a better depth of field</td>', 'closing down the aperature would have given a better depth of field', '2002-04-29 01:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55689, 1304, 352, '<td valign="top">The toy makes a nice addition to this shot.  I probably would have shot w/o it, but I think I''d have been wrong, I like what it adds.</td>', 'The toy makes a nice addition to this shot.  I probably would have shot w/o it, but I think I''d have been wrong, I like what it adds.', '2002-04-29 01:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55690, 1304, 1233, '<td valign="top">I thought this picture would be boring, then I scrolled down and saw the ball.  Love the contrast of the color in the bottom and the black and white on top. Very nice!</td>', 'I thought this picture would be boring, then I scrolled down and saw the ball.  Love the contrast of the color in the bottom and the black and white on top. Very nice!', '2002-04-29 06:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55691, 1304, 301, '<td valign="top">nice one</td>', 'nice one', '2002-04-29 07:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55692, 1304, 1024, '<td valign="top">Beautiful!</td>', 'Beautiful!', '2002-04-29 08:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55693, 1304, 656, '<td valign="top">Very tranquil and I like the mix of monochromatic trees/sky with the very green grass and the splash of colour in the ball.  Focal depth is a bit out, maybe need to consider focusing in the middle, rather than on the background, to get more depth of field (hyperfocal setup)/</td>', 'Very tranquil and I like the mix of monochromatic trees/sky with the very green grass and the splash of colour in the ball.  Focal depth is a bit out, maybe need to consider focusing in the middle, rather than on the background, to get more depth of field (hyperfocal setup)/', '2002-04-29 09:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55694, 1304, 675, '<td valign="top">good example of from the ground up, i like the fog in the trees</td>', 'good example of from the ground up, i like the fog in the trees', '2002-04-29 09:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55695, 1304, 772, '<td valign="top">I saw this photograph last nite late and i have been thinking a lot about it.  First of all, i like the challenge interpretation.  The mood of this shot is great with the fog.  the depth of field and overall composition of this photo is very nice.  The toy ball in this photograph disturbs me somewhat.  It does add a spash of color to a photo that needs no additional help with color.  I''m not sure what it''s purpose is in the photograph or in supporting the challenge topic.  I love the overall shot here but I would love to see it again without the ball and I would love to hear your interpretation of the purpose of the ball in this shot.  good work!!</td>', 'I saw this photograph last nite late and i have been thinking a lot about it.  First of all, i like the challenge interpretation.  The mood of this shot is great with the fog.  the depth of field and overall composition of this photo is very nice.  The toy ball in this photograph disturbs me somewhat.  It does add a spash of color to a photo that needs no additional help with color.  I''m not sure what it''s purpose is in the photograph or in supporting the challenge topic.  I love the overall shot here but I would love to see it again without the ball and I would love to hear your interpretation of the purpose of the ball in this shot.  good work!!', '2002-04-29 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55696, 1304, 189, '<td valign="top">Nice.Spooky. (I could do without the ball,actually)</td>', 'Nice.Spooky. (I could do without the ball,actually)', '2002-04-29 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55697, 1304, 1037, '<td valign="top">Great colours, great mood, great framing... the ball gives this photo a sense of narrative, while the mist in the beautiful, delicate trees creates a mood of contemplation.</td>', 'Great colours, great mood, great framing... the ball gives this photo a sense of narrative, while the mist in the beautiful, delicate trees creates a mood of contemplation.', '2002-04-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55698, 1304, 1034, '<td valign="top">i think a little closer to the ball and a little more angle upwards would''ve helped this shot.</td>', 'i think a little closer to the ball and a little more angle upwards would''ve helped this shot.', '2002-04-29 11:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55699, 1304, 544, '<td valign="top">I like the hazy sky and the rich green grass, though it could have been in better focus with the macro feature, if you have one. Same with the colorful object in the foreground. You did a good job of getting a sense of up with the tall trees, though I fear it might not be whip-lash inducing enough of an UP angle to please the crowd.</td>', 'I like the hazy sky and the rich green grass, though it could have been in better focus with the macro feature, if you have one. Same with the colorful object in the foreground. You did a good job of getting a sense of up with the tall trees, though I fear it might not be whip-lash inducing enough of an UP angle to please the crowd.', '2002-04-29 13:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55700, 1304, 509, '<td valign="top">I don''t feel that the ball is necessary here.  The atmosphere created by the trees and the sky can stand alone</td>', 'I don''t feel that the ball is necessary here.  The atmosphere created by the trees and the sky can stand alone', '2002-04-29 13:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55701, 1304, 1269, '<td valign="top">A higher Fstop or whatever might have helped focus... but overall its appealing.  I really like the color contrast and combo.  Good job.  This one is going to be my new desktop picture for a couple hours.</td>', 'A higher Fstop or whatever might have helped focus... but overall its appealing.  I really like the color contrast and combo.  Good job.  This one is going to be my new desktop picture for a couple hours.', '2002-04-29 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55702, 1304, 885, '<td valign="top">On preview I thought the ball was an Easter egg.  I like the misty texture and saturated greens.  Is the ball a little out of focus?</td>', 'On preview I thought the ball was an Easter egg.  I like the misty texture and saturated greens.  Is the ball a little out of focus?', '2002-04-29 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55703, 1304, 1336, '<td valign="top">i really like this photo.  the contrast between the hazy day and the green grass is beautiful.</td>', 'i really like this photo.  the contrast between the hazy day and the green grass is beautiful.', '2002-04-29 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55704, 1304, 835, '<td valign="top">personal opinion- I would have liked the picture w/o the ball in it but it is still breath-taking</td>', 'personal opinion- I would have liked the picture w/o the ball in it but it is still breath-taking', '2002-04-29 14:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55705, 1304, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice shot ... I''m relaxed already!</td>', 'Nice shot ... I''m relaxed already!', '2002-04-29 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55706, 1304, 962, '<td valign="top">Great shot...........</td>', 'Great shot...........', '2002-04-29 16:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55707, 1304, 843, '<td valign="top">Very eerie, I like it alot.</td>', 'Very eerie, I like it alot.', '2002-04-29 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55708, 1304, 933, '<td valign="top">Very nice mood created here.  Though the ball is perhaps a bit too bright for the photo.  It kind of overpowers everything.  Still, very nice work!</td>', 'Very nice mood created here.  Though the ball is perhaps a bit too bright for the photo.  It kind of overpowers everything.  Still, very nice work!', '2002-04-30 00:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55709, 1304, 536, '<td valign="top">Such a pretty picture.  I wish the sky and details on the trees were not washed out.  IMO (and it is just my opinion) The bright colored item on the ground is rather loud for a photo that is a "quiet day".  Good job on meeting the challenge.</td>', 'Such a pretty picture.  I wish the sky and details on the trees were not washed out.  IMO (and it is just my opinion) The bright colored item on the ground is rather loud for a photo that is a "quiet day".  Good job on meeting the challenge.', '2002-04-30 00:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55710, 1304, 1175, '<td valign="top">oh man.  get rid of the ball (colorful thing) raise the angle just a little and I LOVE this picture.</td>', 'oh man.  get rid of the ball (colorful thing) raise the angle just a little and I LOVE this picture.', '2002-04-30 09:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55711, 1304, 888, '<td valign="top">i like how the ball brings colour to the otherwise serene treescape (if sucha  word exists)</td>', 'i like how the ball brings colour to the otherwise serene treescape (if sucha  word exists)', '2002-04-30 17:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55712, 1304, 1209, '<td valign="top">Beautiful composition. Makes you want to run into the frame and kick that ball  But then, I''d have to go into those woods...................................</td>', 'Beautiful composition. Makes you want to run into the frame and kick that ball  But then, I''d have to go into those woods...................................', '2002-04-30 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55713, 1304, 543, '<td valign="top">The wet weather makes the saturated colors on the ball pop like crazy!  Seems like it''s slightly ahead of the field of focus, but that doesn''t bother me much.  Fantastic detail on the trees in the background, and perfectly exposed.  Top 3 for me.</td>', 'The wet weather makes the saturated colors on the ball pop like crazy!  Seems like it''s slightly ahead of the field of focus, but that doesn''t bother me much.  Fantastic detail on the trees in the background, and perfectly exposed.  Top 3 for me.', '2002-05-01 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55714, 1304, 1041, '<td valign="top">I love the composition and the muted colors with the bright object in the foreground (what is it?).  The more I look at this one, the more I like it</td>', 'I love the composition and the muted colors with the bright object in the foreground (what is it?).  The more I look at this one, the more I like it', '2002-05-01 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55715, 1304, 1078, '<td valign="top">Very pretty pic -- and while I think you do need some kind of foreground focal element, the ball (?) seems so out of place.  Maybe that''s what you were going for, if so great.  If not, maybe a large rock in its place?</td>', 'Very pretty pic -- and while I think you do need some kind of foreground focal element, the ball (?) seems so out of place.  Maybe that''s what you were going for, if so great.  If not, maybe a large rock in its place?', '2002-05-01 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55716, 1304, 813, '<td valign="top">I accidently hit the 1 button before I could write a comment, I meant to rate it much higher. This is a nice idea with decent execution. Good DOF, color, and composition. Nice work.</td>', 'I accidently hit the 1 button before I could write a comment, I meant to rate it much higher. This is a nice idea with decent execution. Good DOF, color, and composition. Nice work.', '2002-05-01 18:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55717, 1304, 640, '<td valign="top">focus</td>', 'focus', '2002-05-03 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55718, 1304, 1, '<td valign="top">I love the misty trees.  The toy? doesn''t work well with the picture.  I think it would''ve done better off without it.  The lush green grass, and blooming trees work well enough.</td>', 'I love the misty trees.  The toy? doesn''t work well with the picture.  I think it would''ve done better off without it.  The lush green grass, and blooming trees work well enough.', '2002-05-03 09:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55719, 1304, 739, '<td valign="top">hmm...a ball.  Seems a bit out of place.</td>', 'hmm...a ball.  Seems a bit out of place.', '2002-05-03 11:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55720, 1304, 1379, '<td valign="top">Too cool!  Such a rocking misty vista!</td>', 'Too cool!  Such a rocking misty vista!', '2002-05-03 21:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55721, 1304, 718, '<td valign="top">Very interesting!</td>', 'Very interesting!', '2002-05-04 13:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55722, 1304, 749, '<td valign="top">The more I look at this, the more I like it - amazing clarity!</td>', 'The more I look at this, the more I like it - amazing clarity!', '2002-05-05 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55723, 1304, 156, '<td valign="top">i originally shot this on a bright sunny day, but because of the angle i couldn''t see and none of the horizons were straight -- but i liked it -- so the next day, which was rainy/foggy, i took some more and got a straight horizon.  While the overall impact was better on the sunny day, the ball lying there, all alone on such a dreary day made me think of the children indoors, not playing with it, and with the neighborhood kids all inside and it WAS a quiet day...</td>', 'i originally shot this on a bright sunny day, but because of the angle i couldn''t see and none of the horizons were straight -- but i liked it -- so the next day, which was rainy/foggy, i took some more and got a straight horizon.  While the overall impact was better on the sunny day, the ball lying there, all alone on such a dreary day made me think of the children indoors, not playing with it, and with the neighborhood kids all inside and it WAS a quiet day...', '2002-05-06 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55724, 1305, 352, '<td valign="top">This would have been more plesaing to me if the cactus were in focus as well, try this shot with a deeper DOF...</td>', 'This would have been more plesaing to me if the cactus were in focus as well, try this shot with a deeper DOF...', '2002-04-29 01:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55725, 1305, 801, '<td valign="top">beautifull!! a nice contrast of color</td>', 'beautifull!! a nice contrast of color', '2002-04-29 04:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55726, 1305, 1024, '<td valign="top">I wish there ws more depth of field here.</td>', 'I wish there ws more depth of field here.', '2002-04-29 08:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55727, 1305, 92, '<td valign="top">I''ve never seen anything like this. The green looks like what I see on seashells or bottoms of boats from the ocean. What a nice way to see things from other parts of the world that I never have seen before:) I love the focus on that. I do wish the catus wasn''t blurred as much as it is. Still a nice capture !</td>', 'I''ve never seen anything like this. The green looks like what I see on seashells or bottoms of boats from the ocean. What a nice way to see things from other parts of the world that I never have seen before:) I love the focus on that. I do wish the catus wasn''t blurred as much as it is. Still a nice capture !', '2002-04-29 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55728, 1305, 1209, '<td valign="top">Wish the cactus was more in focus, but interesting, none the less</td>', 'Wish the cactus was more in focus, but interesting, none the less', '2002-04-29 09:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55729, 1305, 885, '<td valign="top">Good composition, depth of field, nice deep dark blue sky</td>', 'Good composition, depth of field, nice deep dark blue sky', '2002-04-29 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55730, 1305, 656, '<td valign="top">like the sharpness &amp; colours</td>', 'like the sharpness & colours', '2002-04-29 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55731, 1305, 259, '<td valign="top">i dont know if its just me but, my eye keeps returing to the cactus and it is out of focus.  i know that you focused on the rock, but i think that i would have gone with the cactus instead.  probably a difference in preference.</td>', 'i dont know if its just me but, my eye keeps returing to the cactus and it is out of focus.  i know that you focused on the rock, but i think that i would have gone with the cactus instead.  probably a difference in preference.', '2002-04-29 10:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55732, 1305, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like the concept of this photo and how it meets the challenge... However, i really wish the cactus was in sharp focus rather than the rock in the front of the frame.  The subject (cactus) should be the focal point of this shot unless I am missing something here... Good shot!</td>', 'I really like the concept of this photo and how it meets the challenge... However, i really wish the cactus was in sharp focus rather than the rock in the front of the frame.  The subject (cactus) should be the focal point of this shot unless I am missing something here... Good shot!', '2002-04-29 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55733, 1305, 640, '<td valign="top">interesting plants, beautiful blue sky. I wish the cactus was in focus</td>', 'interesting plants, beautiful blue sky. I wish the cactus was in focus', '2002-04-29 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55734, 1305, 714, '<td valign="top">Did you try to get the cactus in focus?  I do like it. Great colors on the rock.</td>', 'Did you try to get the cactus in focus?  I do like it. Great colors on the rock.', '2002-04-29 12:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55735, 1305, 509, '<td valign="top">I would have preferred the focal point of this picture to be the cactus personally, but I like the colors and contrast of the rock on the left</td>', 'I would have preferred the focal point of this picture to be the cactus personally, but I like the colors and contrast of the rock on the left', '2002-04-29 13:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55736, 1305, 835, '<td valign="top">The cactus is too much a part of the image to not be in focus</td>', 'The cactus is too much a part of the image to not be in focus', '2002-04-29 14:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55737, 1305, 813, '<td valign="top">Is it too much to ask that the Saguaro be in focus too? Otherwise nice composition, I particularly like the detail in the yellow on the rock. I was visiting Tucson last week and very nearly submitted a shot of one of the giant cactus myself.</td>', 'Is it too much to ask that the Saguaro be in focus too? Otherwise nice composition, I particularly like the detail in the yellow on the rock. I was visiting Tucson last week and very nearly submitted a shot of one of the giant cactus myself.', '2002-04-29 14:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55738, 1305, 1379, '<td valign="top">Awesome greens!  Your perspective is terrific.</td>', 'Awesome greens!  Your perspective is terrific.', '2002-04-29 15:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55739, 1305, 1078, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Nice DOF, good colors.  I''d like the cactus to lean a bit more to the left.</td>', 'Very cool.  Nice DOF, good colors.  I''d like the cactus to lean a bit more to the left.', '2002-04-29 16:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55740, 1305, 962, '<td valign="top">Subject (stone) and background (Saguaro Cactus) apprears to be too prominent in the photo.</td>', 'Subject (stone) and background (Saguaro Cactus) apprears to be too prominent in the photo.', '2002-04-29 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55741, 1305, 1005, '<td valign="top">Nice composition!</td>', 'Nice composition!', '2002-04-29 17:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55742, 1305, 675, '<td valign="top">i don''t know why, but i love this shot...the yellow is really amazing and the cactus is cool, even though it''s blurred, it''s supposed to be - achiral</td>', 'i don''t know why, but i love this shot...the yellow is really amazing and the cactus is cool, even though it''s blurred, it''s supposed to be - achiral', '2002-04-29 18:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55743, 1305, 1, '<td valign="top">Nice greens and blues.  Composition is pretty good here.</td>', 'Nice greens and blues.  Composition is pretty good here.', '2002-04-29 20:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55744, 1305, 142, '<td valign="top">I like the way you focused on the rock thingy and sort of blurred out the cactus in the background.</td>', 'I like the way you focused on the rock thingy and sort of blurred out the cactus in the background.', '2002-04-29 21:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55745, 1305, 843, '<td valign="top">I like how you used DOF here. Good job.</td>', 'I like how you used DOF here. Good job.', '2002-04-29 22:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55746, 1305, 1037, '<td valign="top">I think that either the yellow... stuff or the cactus would have been good subjects, but together they compete for attention.</td>', 'I think that either the yellow... stuff or the cactus would have been good subjects, but together they compete for attention.', '2002-04-30 02:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55747, 1305, 327, '<td valign="top">nice color</td>', 'nice color', '2002-04-30 09:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55748, 1305, 1041, '<td valign="top">Love the light green in the foreground.  Nice shot!</td>', 'Love the light green in the foreground.  Nice shot!', '2002-04-30 14:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55749, 1305, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice job but I would prefer to see the Cactus in Focus too. Great Color.</td>', 'Nice job but I would prefer to see the Cactus in Focus too. Great Color.', '2002-04-30 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55750, 1305, 888, '<td valign="top">whata fantastic moss/sky contrast</td>', 'whata fantastic moss/sky contrast', '2002-04-30 17:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55751, 1305, 543, '<td valign="top">The sky would improve with a little positive gamma adjustment - looks a bit too gray/dark from here.  The lichens are great, but the oof cactus and noise in the sky detract.  I''m guessing you were in macro mode, so not much you could do about the depth of field.</td>', 'The sky would improve with a little positive gamma adjustment - looks a bit too gray/dark from here.  The lichens are great, but the oof cactus and noise in the sky detract.  I''m guessing you were in macro mode, so not much you could do about the depth of field.', '2002-05-01 04:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55752, 1305, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice compositon, color and texture.  Good job!</td>', 'Nice compositon, color and texture.  Good job!', '2002-05-01 13:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55753, 1305, 330, '<td valign="top">I''m not crazy about the way you used the DOF in this picture.</td>', 'I''m not crazy about the way you used the DOF in this picture.', '2002-05-03 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55754, 1305, 1202, '<td valign="top">Different shot in an area all your own.   I am misled as to the main subject, and if it was intentional you did a good job.   Pics don''t have to be by the old rules to be good.</td>', 'Different shot in an area all your own.   I am misled as to the main subject, and if it was intentional you did a good job.   Pics don''t have to be by the old rules to be good.', '2002-05-04 08:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55755, 1305, 1070, '<td valign="top">Not too sure about the cactus INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(55828, 1308, 714, '<td valign="top">Very pretty.</td>', 'Very pretty.', '2002-05-01 12:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55829, 1308, 748, '<td valign="top">... and one flower looking down at me!  Nice shot.</td>', '... and one flower looking down at me!  Nice shot.', '2002-05-01 15:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55830, 1308, 280, '<td valign="top">Nice shot, could have done with someting else in the frame to give a better perspective and the idea of looking up. And maybe move the subject off center.</td>', 'Nice shot, could have done with someting else in the frame to give a better perspective and the idea of looking up. And maybe move the subject off center.', '2002-05-01 17:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55831, 1308, 813, '<td valign="top">This is a nice picture that could be much improved by adjusting levels to make it brighter and composing it differently. The fact that it''s so "dead on" center works against it. Try cropping out the left and bottom sides.</td>', 'This is a nice picture that could be much improved by adjusting levels to make it brighter and composing it differently. The fact that it''s so "dead on" center works against it. Try cropping out the left and bottom sides.', '2002-05-01 17:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55832, 1308, 885, '<td valign="top">Nice detail in the flower.  It seems as if it could be brighter though.  I feel like the background ought to have been white, but it isn''t (at least not on my monitor).</td>', 'Nice detail in the flower.  It seems as if it could be brighter though.  I feel like the background ought to have been white, but it isn''t (at least not on my monitor).', '2002-05-02 09:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55833, 1308, 330, '<td valign="top">It reads more like looking out at a flower.</td>', 'It reads more like looking out at a flower.', '2002-05-03 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55834, 1308, 436, '<td valign="top">great photo. ground up feeling missing, though</td>', 'great photo. ground up feeling missing, though', '2002-05-03 08:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55835, 1308, 1070, '<td valign="top">I think less would be more...</td>', 'I think less would be more...', '2002-05-05 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55836, 1308, 2, '<td valign="top">Unless flowers grow sideways, I''m not sure how this is "looking up at".  Nice, sharp focus.</td>', 'Unless flowers grow sideways, I''m not sure how this is "looking up at".  Nice, sharp focus.', '2002-05-05 13:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55837, 1308, 1, '<td valign="top">Doesn''t really seem from the ground up.</td>', 'Doesn''t really seem from the ground up.', '2002-05-05 23:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55838, 1310, 205, '<td valign="top">What the hell is that big white thing? not that it makes you get a lower score or anything its just I want to know what it is</td>', 'What the hell is that big white thing? not that it makes you get a lower score or anything its just I want to know what it is', '2002-04-29 01:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55839, 1310, 352, '<td valign="top">The sky is mush too overexposed here.  I''m not sure what the blue and grey on the right are, but they are not all all necessary and seriously distract the viewer.</td>', 'The sky is mush too overexposed here.  I''m not sure what the blue and grey on the right are, but they are not all all necessary and seriously distract the viewer.', '2002-04-29 01:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55840, 1310, 772, '<td valign="top">I think the palm tree should have been more in focus in this particular photo.</td>', 'I think the palm tree should have been more in focus in this particular photo.', '2002-04-29 05:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55841, 1310, 318, '<td valign="top">Has potential, but overexposed</td>', 'Has potential, but overexposed', '2002-04-29 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55842, 1310, 656, '<td valign="top">very blurred....</td>', 'very blurred....', '2002-04-29 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55843, 1310, 675, '<td valign="top">whoa, this picture was hard to figure out at first...if that tree was in focus you would have gotten a ten</td>', 'whoa, this picture was hard to figure out at first...if that tree was in focus you would have gotten a ten', '2002-04-29 10:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55844, 1310, 2, '<td valign="top">Is it me or does the image seem streaky and out-of-focus?</td>', 'Is it me or does the image seem streaky and out-of-focus?', '2002-04-29 10:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55845, 1310, 259, '<td valign="top">the palm is not in focus obviously, but the placement and contrasting colors are great.</td>', 'the palm is not in focus obviously, but the placement and contrasting colors are great.', '2002-04-29 11:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55846, 1310, 714, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Not sure what to think of this one.  It is  a cool photo,  just out of focus.</td>', 'Wow.  Not sure what to think of this one.  It is  a cool photo,  just out of focus.', '2002-04-29 12:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55847, 1310, 813, '<td valign="top">Very strong composition! Too bad about the focus, but still, an interesting shot.</td>', 'Very strong composition! Too bad about the focus, but still, an interesting shot.', '2002-04-29 13:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55848, 1310, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting composition.  It works for the sky to be white, but the palm tree seems a little out of focus and/or moving.</td>', 'Interesting composition.  It works for the sky to be white, but the palm tree seems a little out of focus and/or moving.', '2002-04-29 14:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55849, 1310, 1336, '<td valign="top">i like the colors, but it''s not a very sharp photo</td>', 'i like the colors, but it''s not a very sharp photo', '2002-04-29 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55850, 1310, 962, '<td valign="top">Camera shake or too windy ?</td>', 'Camera shake or too windy ?', '2002-04-29 15:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55851, 1310, 89, '<td valign="top">i guess a little blurry.</td>', 'i guess a little blurry.', '2002-04-29 21:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55852, 1310, 843, '<td valign="top">This is a cool picture. looks like a painting almost. Would be even better if the palm tree was in focus</td>', 'This is a cool picture. looks like a painting almost. Would be even better if the palm tree was in focus', '2002-04-29 21:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55853, 1310, 301, '<td valign="top">palm seems out of focus.  Although the three colours in the background are very distinct and kinda cool in a modern art type way, it is hard to work out exactly what I''m looking at</td>', 'palm seems out of focus.  Although the three colours in the background are very distinct and kinda cool in a modern art type way, it is hard to work out exactly what I''m looking at', '2002-04-30 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55854, 1310, 459, '<td valign="top">Modern art!  I love it.</td>', 'Modern art!  I love it.', '2002-04-30 10:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55855, 1310, 1041, '<td valign="top">What makes up the background?  Not sure what I''m looking at.  Palm tree isn''t quite as sharp as I would''ve liked.</td>', 'What makes up the background?  Not sure what I''m looking at.  Palm tree isn''t quite as sharp as I would''ve liked.', '2002-04-30 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55856, 1310, 472, '<td valign="top">nice graphic shapes. too bad about the blurry tree<br/></td>', 'nice graphic shapes. too bad about the blurry tree', '2002-04-30 11:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55857, 1310, 1078, '<td valign="top">I like the idea here -- interesting contrast between abstract and concrete -- I wish the palm tree were in focus (windy day?) -- and that the blue arch followed it''s line more perfectly instead of looking like a chunks missing right where it hits the left hand side of the image -- perhaps a slightly different camera angle?</td>', 'I like the idea here -- interesting contrast between abstract and concrete -- I wish the palm tree were in focus (windy day?) -- and that the blue arch followed it''s line more perfectly instead of looking like a chunks missing right where it hits the left hand side of the image -- perhaps a slightly different camera angle?', '2002-04-30 12:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55858, 1310, 715, '<td valign="top">I like the composition and colors a lot, but it''s too bad that the palmtree is out of focus.</td>', 'I like the composition and colors a lot, but it''s too bad that the palmtree is out of focus.', '2002-04-30 15:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55859, 1310, 280, '<td valign="top">The plam looks a little blurred, maybe you could use a tripod to get a steady shot.</td>', 'The plam looks a little blurred, maybe you could use a tripod to get a steady shot.', '2002-04-30 16:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55860, 1310, 888, '<td valign="top">if the palm wasn''t so fuzzy it would be great</td>', 'if the palm wasn''t so fuzzy it would be great', '2002-04-30 16:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55861, 1310, 640, '<td valign="top">wow--very interesting and creative why is the tree so out of focus--was it moving?</td>', 'wow--very interesting and creative why is the tree so out of focus--was it moving?', '2002-05-01 09:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55862, 1310, 244, '<td valign="top">Don''t know what you saw here, the tree is dying, the sky is washed out, and the picture is overall out of focus.</td>', 'Don''t know what you saw here, the tree is dying, the sky is washed out, and the picture is overall out of focus.', '2002-05-01 17:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55863, 1310, 436, '<td valign="top">interesting composition. the white curve adds a lot.  Looks like the palm needs a bit of grooming, eh?</td>', 'interesting composition. the white curve adds a lot.  Looks like the palm needs a bit of grooming, eh?', '2002-05-03 08:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55864, 1310, 527, '<td valign="top">Great abstract composition and colors. I wish the palm tree was more in focus, though.</td>', 'Great abstract composition and colors. I wish the palm tree was more in focus, though.', '2002-05-03 13:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55865, 1310, 933, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice, interesting composition which I would have rated much higher had it been in focus.</td>', 'This is a very nice, interesting composition which I would have rated much higher had it been in focus.', '2002-05-03 15:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55866, 1310, 1457, '<td valign="top">eh</td>', 'eh', '2002-05-04 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55867, 1310, 1, '<td valign="top">Palm tree seems blurred, as well I really have no idea what the blue/gray/white is.</td>', 'Palm tree seems blurred, as well I really have no idea what the blue/gray/white is.', '2002-05-05 23:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55868, 1311, 205, '<td valign="top">This almost brings a tear to my.</td>', 'This almost brings a tear to my.', '2002-04-29 01:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55869, 1311, 656, '<td valign="top">tells a story!  good entry...</td>', 'tells a story!  good entry...', '2002-04-29 09:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55870, 1311, 2, '<td valign="top">I''ve looked at this twice now, and I''ve changed my first opinion of it :)  I really do like the colors and the depth, and I was way too harsh on pictures for not having a sharp upward angle at first.  Nicely done.</td>', 'I''ve looked at this twice now, and I''ve changed my first opinion of it :)  I really do like the colors and the depth, and I was way too harsh on pictures for not having a sharp upward angle at first.  Nicely done.', '2002-04-29 10:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55871, 1311, 640, '<td valign="top">Nice flowers. The background is distracting</td>', 'Nice flowers. The background is distracting', '2002-04-29 11:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55872, 1311, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very nice! The depth of field is very effective, the colours and lighting are wonderful, and the framing of the two flowers is evocative. The photo with its title tell a little narrative and create a sense of tension.</td>', 'Very nice! The depth of field is very effective, the colours and lighting are wonderful, and the framing of the two flowers is evocative. The photo with its title tell a little narrative and create a sense of tension.', '2002-04-29 11:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55873, 1311, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice, by having the background out of focus really adds to the pic.</td>', 'very nice, by having the background out of focus really adds to the pic.', '2002-04-29 11:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55874, 1311, 714, '<td valign="top">Nice,  I like how it shows the flower as being delicate and behind it something very distructive.  Did you think of cropping off some of the top?</td>', 'Nice,  I like how it shows the flower as being delicate and behind it something very distructive.  Did you think of cropping off some of the top?', '2002-04-29 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55875, 1311, 772, '<td valign="top">Ok.. I think I''m ready to comment on this photograph now :)  Ya see... i work for Caterpillar, Inc. who may have been the maker of that monster truck in the background...  But u know what?  This is an excellent photograph and I like your interpretation of this challenge... Nice job!</td>', 'Ok.. I think I''m ready to comment on this photograph now :)  Ya see... i work for Caterpillar, Inc. who may have been the maker of that monster truck in the background...  But u know what?  This is an excellent photograph and I like your interpretation of this challenge... Nice job!', '2002-04-29 14:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55876, 1311, 1336, '<td valign="top">very nice</td>', 'very nice', '2002-04-29 14:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55877, 1311, 675, '<td valign="top">hahahahaha, that is cool, nice originality</td>', 'hahahahaha, that is cool, nice originality', '2002-04-29 18:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55878, 1311, 1350, '<td valign="top">I like this pic...the choice of subjects and title are excellent. Well done!</td>', 'I like this pic...the choice of subjects and title are excellent. Well done!', '2002-04-29 18:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55879, 1311, 1209, '<td valign="top">Nice sharp image. But, I dig dandelions with a table knife! A Cat tractor is overkill!</td>', 'Nice sharp image. But, I dig dandelions with a table knife! A Cat tractor is overkill!', '2002-04-30 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55880, 1311, 459, '<td valign="top">Good focus on flowers.</td>', 'Good focus on flowers.', '2002-04-30 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55881, 1311, 885, '<td valign="top">Cute idea.  Somehow I think that I might like it better if the flower was closer to the wheel, and then less of the upper part of the tractor would be seen...</td>', 'Cute idea.  Somehow I think that I might like it better if the flower was closer to the wheel, and then less of the upper part of the tractor would be seen...', '2002-04-30 13:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55882, 1311, 888, '<td valign="top">what a brave photographer you are.<br/>Unless of course the truck was stopped.<br/>It may be art but is it worth dying for?</td>', 'what a brave photographer you are.Unless of course the truck was stopped.It may be art but is it worth dying for?', '2002-04-30 16:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55883, 1311, 1041, '<td valign="top">Being a dandelion is scary if you look at it from that perspective! ;o)  Nice shot.</td>', 'Being a dandelion is scary if you look at it from that perspective! ;o)  Nice shot.', '2002-04-30 16:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55884, 1311, 446, '<td valign="top">I can imagine myself looking from the ground up in this shot. I feel like I''m in the frame.  Good idea.  Good exposure.  Looks very natural.  Nice work.  I rated this shot high.</td>', 'I can imagine myself looking from the ground up in this shot. I feel like I''m in the frame.  Good idea.  Good exposure.  Looks very natural.  Nice work.  I rated this shot high.', '2002-04-30 22:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55885, 1311, 543, '<td valign="top">Great story.  The top doesn''t contain much of interest - maybe a longer focal length would have helped there, and also gotten rid of that little sliver of blow out sky at R.  The dandelions draw the eye away from the minor annoyances, though.  Very good.</td>', 'Great story.  The top doesn''t contain much of interest - maybe a longer focal length would have helped there, and also gotten rid of that little sliver of blow out sky at R.  The dandelions draw the eye away from the minor annoyances, though.  Very good.', '2002-05-01 04:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55886, 1311, 878, '<td valign="top">Great shot, perfect depth of field.  You really know what is going on in this photo.<br/><br/></td>', 'Great shot, perfect depth of field.  You really know what is going on in this photo.', '2002-05-01 14:03:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55887, 1311, 813, '<td valign="top">I like the menacing nature of the wheel, it looks like the dandelions are about to be crushed.</td>', 'I like the menacing nature of the wheel, it looks like the dandelions are about to be crushed.', '2002-05-01 18:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55888, 1311, 301, '<td valign="top">funny stuff</td>', 'funny stuff', '2002-05-02 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
