(55894, 1311, 1, '<td valign="top">Wow.  Great shot, I think it''s the best I''ve seen so far (83/102).  I don''t think I can sum it up with words.  Very well done.</td>', 'Wow.  Great shot, I think it''s the best I''ve seen so far (83/102).  I don''t think I can sum it up with words.  Very well done.', '2002-05-05 23:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55895, 1311, 1, '<td valign="top">I really have no clue how you came in 36th.  This shot was excellent and represented so much of what the world is today.</td>', 'I really have no clue how you came in 36th.  This shot was excellent and represented so much of what the world is today.', '2002-05-06 06:39:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55896, 1311, 933, '<td valign="top">Thanks to all for taking the time to comment.  <br/><br/>And Langdon, I know how you feel.  While I was not terrifically thrilled with this shot (I probably would have given it about a 6 or 7), some of the shots which I really liked and gave my highest ratings to, did astonishilgly poorly, finishing 37th and (gulp) 93rd!  Go figure.  I found myself saying the same exact thing about their photos.  Well, I''m glad you and a few others out there liked it.</td>', 'Thanks to all for taking the time to comment.  And Langdon, I know how you feel.  While I was not terrifically thrilled with this shot (I probably would have given it about a 6 or 7), some of the shots which I really liked and gave my highest ratings to, did astonishilgly poorly, finishing 37th and (gulp) 93rd!  Go figure.  I found myself saying the same exact thing about their photos.  Well, I''m glad you and a few others out there liked it.', '2002-05-06 10:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55901, 1313, 205, '<td valign="top">nioe some one beat you and they did a better job</td>', 'nioe some one beat you and they did a better job', '2002-04-29 01:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55902, 1313, 107, '<td valign="top">I''m just thinking about how it would be awkward to have a door at the top of the stairs, especially one that opens twords you as your walking up.  Knowing my clumsiness, I''d knock myself straight down the stairs trying to open the damn thing.</td>', 'I''m just thinking about how it would be awkward to have a door at the top of the stairs, especially one that opens twords you as your walking up.  Knowing my clumsiness, I''d knock myself straight down the stairs trying to open the damn thing.', '2002-04-29 04:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55903, 1313, 301, '<td valign="top">I keep thinking this is pointing downstairs towards a door in the ground ... kinda like something Escher would do. I like this alternative reality :)</td>', 'I keep thinking this is pointing downstairs towards a door in the ground ... kinda like something Escher would do. I like this alternative reality :)', '2002-04-29 06:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55904, 1313, 772, '<td valign="top">I don''t find this shot to be ''cliche''... I really wish that term would abandon this site.  it''s getting old already.  This shot is a good interpretation of the transition.  The first step being out of focus is a little distracting to the shot.  A little more depth of field would have also brought the door at the top of the stairs into sharper focus.  The angle of the camera in this shot doesn''t accent the stairs as much as I would like to see... otherwise, nice shot!</td>', 'I don''t find this shot to be ''cliche''... I really wish that term would abandon this site.  it''s getting old already.  This shot is a good interpretation of the transition.  The first step being out of focus is a little distracting to the shot.  A little more depth of field would have also brought the door at the top of the stairs into sharper focus.  The angle of the camera in this shot doesn''t accent the stairs as much as I would like to see... otherwise, nice shot!', '2002-04-29 08:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55905, 1313, 92, '<td valign="top">I was hoping to see stairs. I like this but I feel the bottom blur or degree of blur distracts from it:( Still, all in all....it''s a nice picture:)</td>', 'I was hoping to see stairs. I like this but I feel the bottom blur or degree of blur distracts from it:( Still, all in all....it''s a nice picture:)', '2002-04-29 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55906, 1313, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the composition, and the open door at the top.  I think I wish the door were more in focus though.  Also, I think it''s a little off horizontal.</td>', 'I like the composition, and the open door at the top.  I think I wish the door were more in focus though.  Also, I think it''s a little off horizontal.', '2002-04-29 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55907, 1313, 656, '<td valign="top">could be a good black&amp; white ?  bring out the texture on the carpet.</td>', 'could be a good black& white ?  bring out the texture on the carpet.', '2002-04-29 10:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55908, 1313, 189, '<td valign="top">The title doesn''t save this one.</td>', 'The title doesn''t save this one.', '2002-04-29 11:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
