(55910, 1313, 1037, '<td valign="top">Hmm... nice textures, nice lighting, good composition and depth of field. The open door creates a kind of tension or narrative. It just doesn''t seem to say enough to be interesting though... hard to explain.</td>', 'Hmm... nice textures, nice lighting, good composition and depth of field. The open door creates a kind of tension or narrative. It just doesn''t seem to say enough to be interesting though... hard to explain.', '2002-04-29 12:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
