(55912, 1313, 813, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea, ugly carpet. It might work better if there was light coming through the door.</td>', 'Interesting idea, ugly carpet. It might work better if there was light coming through the door.', '2002-04-29 14:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55913, 1313, 1379, '<td valign="top">Right on!  Very intense!</td>', 'Right on!  Very intense!', '2002-04-29 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55914, 1313, 675, '<td valign="top">wow that carpet screams mental home</td>', 'wow that carpet screams mental home', '2002-04-29 18:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55915, 1313, 1323, '<td valign="top">Nice idea, just don''t care for the colors.</td>', 'Nice idea, just don''t care for the colors.', '2002-04-29 23:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55916, 1313, 509, '<td valign="top">I like the subject, but you missed on your call!  I didn''t see any other staircase shots.  Suffering from poor lighting though, and the bottom looks out of focus</td>', 'I like the subject, but you missed on your call!  I didn''t see any other staircase shots.  Suffering from poor lighting though, and the bottom looks out of focus', '2002-04-30 00:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55917, 1313, 536, '<td valign="top">HA! This isn''t cliché.  Try harder next time!  I consider this a fun photo because of the added interest of the door. I want to know that is there.  I want to tip toe towards that door.  Would shooting it vertical have gotten more of the door?  I would have considered cropping the first step and rotating just a tad to straighten the photo.  I''m sure you considered rotating it 90 degrees clockwise, right?  &amp;lt;winks&amp;gt;  I also think this photo was begging to be B&amp;W for the added suspense.  The color and design in the carpet is great for a B&amp;W.  Overall - good job on meeting the challenge and providing an interesting photo.  I won''t take points off for failure to live up to your title. :)</td>', 'HA! This isn''t cliché.  Try harder next time!  I consider this a fun photo because of the added interest of the door. I want to know that is there.  I want to tip toe towards that door.  Would shooting it vertical have gotten more of the door?  I would have considered cropping the first step and rotating just a tad to straighten the photo.  I''m sure you considered rotating it 90 degrees clockwise, right?  &lt;winks&gt;  I also think this photo was begging to be B&W for the added suspense.  The color and design in the carpet is great for a B&W.  Overall - good job on meeting the challenge and providing an interesting photo.  I won''t take points off for failure to live up to your title. :)', '2002-04-30 00:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55918, 1313, 714, '<td valign="top">Freaky looking stairs.  :)</td>', 'Freaky looking stairs.  :)', '2002-04-30 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55919, 1313, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m sure you get comments for and against it, but I''ll suggest it anyway: I would crop out that first out of focus step.</td>', 'I''m sure you get comments for and against it, but I''ll suggest it anyway: I would crop out that first out of focus step.', '2002-04-30 12:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55920, 1313, 1078, '<td valign="top">I''m only guessing, but are the colors of the walls and door off?  The interesting thing, to me, about this one, is the way it almost looks like you''re looking down a stairwell instead of up....</td>', 'I''m only guessing, but are the colors of the walls and door off?  The interesting thing, to me, about this one, is the way it almost looks like you''re looking down a stairwell instead of up....', '2002-04-30 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
