(55946, 1314, 543, '<td valign="top">Something from nothing.  Quite a trick!  This could have been a mind-numbingly dull image, but the sharpness, shadows, angle, and that great flare from the floodlight (six-bladed aperture, I see) keep the eye moving around.  Nice work.</td>', 'Something from nothing.  Quite a trick!  This could have been a mind-numbingly dull image, but the sharpness, shadows, angle, and that great flare from the floodlight (six-bladed aperture, I see) keep the eye moving around.  Nice work.', '2002-05-01 09:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
