(55977, 1316, 1034, '<td valign="top">I''m sorry but, couldn''t this be considered copyright infringement since the book is primarily the subject?  I mean, yes, it is an original idea but, that''s what it states in the rules.  Unless perhaps you had the written permission of the author of the book to use his/her image for this pic.</td>', 'I''m sorry but, couldn''t this be considered copyright infringement since the book is primarily the subject?  I mean, yes, it is an original idea but, that''s what it states in the rules.  Unless perhaps you had the written permission of the author of the book to use his/her image for this pic.', '2002-04-29 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55978, 1316, 544, '<td valign="top">I know you''re probably getting a WHOLE LOT of comments about this tongue-in-cheek picture not filling the requirements of the current challenge. Whatever. Personally, I gave this photo a lower score because it was hard for me to determine what the photo was trying to present. Is it the Earth From Above book? There''s some nice color in this picture, but no real strong focal point or texture to the picture. To be honest, I''m not sure what I would have done with this photo to try and improve it. It''s a very challenging picture that you''ve taken, and that''s admirable.</td>', 'I know you''re probably getting a WHOLE LOT of comments about this tongue-in-cheek picture not filling the requirements of the current challenge. Whatever. Personally, I gave this photo a lower score because it was hard for me to determine what the photo was trying to present. Is it the Earth From Above book? There''s some nice color in this picture, but no real strong focal point or texture to the picture. To be honest, I''m not sure what I would have done with this photo to try and improve it. It''s a very challenging picture that you''ve taken, and that''s admirable.', '2002-04-29 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55979, 1316, 772, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... I can tell that the camera is looking up in this shot...  The subject matter of the photo is not screaming at me to continue evaluating the shot.</td>', 'Hmmm... I can tell that the camera is looking up in this shot...  The subject matter of the photo is not screaming at me to continue evaluating the shot.', '2002-04-29 13:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55980, 1316, 1379, '<td valign="top">Heh... clever</td>', 'Heh... clever', '2002-04-29 15:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55981, 1316, 1336, '<td valign="top">i get the irony of "earth from above" but it doesnt really do anything for me</td>', 'i get the irony of "earth from above" but it doesnt really do anything for me', '2002-04-29 15:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55982, 1316, 962, '<td valign="top">Could not relate to the topic....</td>', 'Could not relate to the topic....', '2002-04-29 16:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55983, 1316, 675, '<td valign="top">no creativity points here, this fits the challenge, but what nothing grabs my attention here</td>', 'no creativity points here, this fits the challenge, but what nothing grabs my attention here', '2002-04-29 18:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55984, 1316, 301, '<td valign="top">points for originality.  Is this a bookshop or yours?</td>', 'points for originality.  Is this a bookshop or yours?', '2002-04-30 09:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55985, 1316, 813, '<td valign="top">Look through the pictures in the books on the shelf and draw inspiration there.</td>', 'Look through the pictures in the books on the shelf and draw inspiration there.', '2002-04-30 10:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55986, 1316, 1041, '<td valign="top">Fulfills the challenge.  Nicely photographed, all sharp and in focus.  Don''t like the piece of wall that''s visible in the top left.</td>', 'Fulfills the challenge.  Nicely photographed, all sharp and in focus.  Don''t like the piece of wall that''s visible in the top left.', '2002-04-30 12:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55987, 1316, 1135, '<td valign="top">Nice clear shot!</td>', 'Nice clear shot!', '2002-04-30 17:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55988, 1316, 1078, '<td valign="top">seems kind of dark -- I''d think of cropping out the top of the shelf as it starts to appear in the upper middle</td>', 'seems kind of dark -- I''d think of cropping out the top of the shelf as it starts to appear in the upper middle', '2002-05-01 13:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55989, 1316, 878, '<td valign="top">This doesnt imply too much of the subject for me, the angle obviously indicates the subject is above the photographer but still not enough for me.</td>', 'This doesnt imply too much of the subject for me, the angle obviously indicates the subject is above the photographer but still not enough for me.', '2002-05-01 14:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55990, 1316, 901, '<td valign="top">what is this crap?</td>', 'what is this crap?', '2002-05-02 02:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55991, 1316, 885, '<td valign="top">Why do you have a book still wrapped in plastic?  The little corner of yellow at the top is distracting</td>', 'Why do you have a book still wrapped in plastic?  The little corner of yellow at the top is distracting', '2002-05-03 15:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55992, 1316, 2, '<td valign="top">I''d like to see a sharper angle upward in this picture, and maybe come out a little bit to give the books more of a frame.</td>', 'I''d like to see a sharper angle upward in this picture, and maybe come out a little bit to give the books more of a frame.', '2002-05-05 13:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55993, 1316, 1, '<td valign="top">Bland subject.  =/</td>', 'Bland subject.  =/', '2002-05-05 23:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55994, 1317, 352, '<td valign="top">Cool sillouhette!  LIke the color of the sky!</td>', 'Cool sillouhette!  LIke the color of the sky!', '2002-04-29 02:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55995, 1317, 1024, '<td valign="top">Wonderful use of silloutte!</td>', 'Wonderful use of silloutte!', '2002-04-29 08:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55996, 1317, 656, '<td valign="top">I think I like that you''ve cut half the star off.  Sepia works well for this shot</td>', 'I think I like that you''ve cut half the star off.  Sepia works well for this shot', '2002-04-29 10:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55997, 1317, 189, '<td valign="top">Would have liked to see it: Centered, with the whole thing, and a tad lighter.</td>', 'Would have liked to see it: Centered, with the whole thing, and a tad lighter.', '2002-04-29 11:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55998, 1317, 1034, '<td valign="top">I really love the way this image looks.  but then again, that''s me. he he.  I like the way the star is framed.  good job.</td>', 'I really love the way this image looks.  but then again, that''s me. he he.  I like the way the star is framed.  good job.', '2002-04-29 11:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55999, 1317, 259, '<td valign="top">very nice, and the angle of the subject being off center makes this photo better than many of the others.</td>', 'very nice, and the angle of the subject being off center makes this photo better than many of the others.', '2002-04-29 11:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56000, 1317, 714, '<td valign="top">I really like the lighting.  Great title.  Love it.  Good job.</td>', 'I really like the lighting.  Great title.  Love it.  Good job.', '2002-04-29 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56001, 1317, 509, '<td valign="top">Too bad you couldn''t get the whole star in, but I really like the colors - the sky looks like the canvas of a painting.  Great shot</td>', 'Too bad you couldn''t get the whole star in, but I really like the colors - the sky looks like the canvas of a painting.  Great shot', '2002-04-29 13:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56002, 1317, 544, '<td valign="top">You did a good job here of capturing a "simple" image. You have two colors, basically - sepia toned sky, and completely shadowed machinery. I''m having some trouble with the sun coming through the clouded sky, though... it looks somewhat bleached or washed out because of your coloring scheme. I''m also not sure the horizontal angle works so well for this picture. It might have come across better if you got closer to the picture and looked more upward (that star pattern really accentuates the up). Then again, because of the simple style, it''s hard to tell how close you are or are not. Maybe you are as close as you can get. A nice effort :)</td>', 'You did a good job here of capturing a "simple" image. You have two colors, basically - sepia toned sky, and completely shadowed machinery. I''m having some trouble with the sun coming through the clouded sky, though... it looks somewhat bleached or washed out because of your coloring scheme. I''m also not sure the horizontal angle works so well for this picture. It might have come across better if you got closer to the picture and looked more upward (that star pattern really accentuates the up). Then again, because of the simple style, it''s hard to tell how close you are or are not. Maybe you are as close as you can get. A nice effort :)', '2002-04-29 13:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56003, 1317, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting colors, interesting, intricate silhouette.  Is it sepia-toned, or are these the real colors?  I like it a lot.</td>', 'Interesting colors, interesting, intricate silhouette.  Is it sepia-toned, or are these the real colors?  I like it a lot.', '2002-04-29 13:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56004, 1317, 1379, '<td valign="top">Intense!  The coloration makes the pic seem sinister and poisoned..  Very creepy...</td>', 'Intense!  The coloration makes the pic seem sinister and poisoned..  Very creepy...', '2002-04-29 15:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56005, 1317, 280, '<td valign="top">A fantastic silhouette and good composition.</td>', 'A fantastic silhouette and good composition.', '2002-04-29 15:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56006, 1317, 675, '<td valign="top">interesting</td>', 'interesting', '2002-04-29 18:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56007, 1317, 724, '<td valign="top">The blown out sky is bothersome, but I really love the photo.</td>', 'The blown out sky is bothersome, but I really love the photo.', '2002-04-29 22:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56008, 1317, 1037, '<td valign="top">This is a very cool photo, great colours and lighting, the silhouette is very effective. The complexity of this structure provides a lot of interesting shapes and lines. I think experimenting with framing it and cropping it differently might have yielded something even more exciting though.</td>', 'This is a very cool photo, great colours and lighting, the silhouette is very effective. The complexity of this structure provides a lot of interesting shapes and lines. I think experimenting with framing it and cropping it differently might have yielded something even more exciting though.', '2002-04-30 04:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56009, 1317, 301, '<td valign="top">cool lighting &amp; colours.  Wish that thing under the star wasn''t there tho'' ... makes the bottom of the pic really dark</td>', 'cool lighting & colours.  Wish that thing under the star wasn''t there tho'' ... makes the bottom of the pic really dark', '2002-04-30 07:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56010, 1317, 772, '<td valign="top">This is one of my favorite photos in this challenge.  i can''t say that i would have done anything differently than you have done here... I love the sepia tone.. it adds quite a bit to the mood of this photo.  Nice job!</td>', 'This is one of my favorite photos in this challenge.  i can''t say that i would have done anything differently than you have done here... I love the sepia tone.. it adds quite a bit to the mood of this photo.  Nice job!', '2002-04-30 10:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56011, 1317, 387, '<td valign="top">One of my favorite shots of the competition.  Would adjucting levels have helped with the washed out upper right?  Or was that intentional?</td>', 'One of my favorite shots of the competition.  Would adjucting levels have helped with the washed out upper right?  Or was that intentional?', '2002-04-30 19:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56012, 1317, 543, '<td valign="top">Good stuff!  I''m not wild about how the detail is lost in the ULHC, but that''s fixable.  This up on a mountaintop somewhere?  Fantastic angles, and I really like the sepia treatment.</td>', 'Good stuff!  I''m not wild about how the detail is lost in the ULHC, but that''s fixable.  This up on a mountaintop somewhere?  Fantastic angles, and I really like the sepia treatment.', '2002-05-01 04:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56013, 1317, 1041, '<td valign="top">Wonderful composition.  The sky looks a little strange in some places.  Compression?</td>', 'Wonderful composition.  The sky looks a little strange in some places.  Compression?', '2002-05-01 12:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56014, 1317, 901, '<td valign="top">nice sky texture</td>', 'nice sky texture', '2002-05-02 01:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56015, 1317, 1, '<td valign="top">Great shot.  Whatever effect you used here worked very well.  The silhouette works great.</td>', 'Great shot.  Whatever effect you used here worked very well.  The silhouette works great.', '2002-05-02 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56016, 1317, 640, '<td valign="top">amazing sky! Was this the sunset?</td>', 'amazing sky! Was this the sunset?', '2002-05-03 01:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56017, 1317, 1457, '<td valign="top">could have been better, good concept though, I just have a problem with the composition. The title is good. I''m actually a bit undecided....</td>', 'could have been better, good concept though, I just have a problem with the composition. The title is good. I''m actually a bit undecided....', '2002-05-04 22:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56018, 1317, 749, '<td valign="top">I just love the colours in this</td>', 'I just love the colours in this', '2002-05-05 09:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56019, 1317, 813, '<td valign="top">Love the sky color and detail in the stucture.</td>', 'Love the sky color and detail in the stucture.', '2002-05-05 14:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56020, 1317, 1066, '<td valign="top">Thanks for voting and taking time to make comments!<br/><br/>The blown out sky was intentional.  I had this shot as a color shot...then moved it to black and white because the sky detail wasnt good enough for color.  Black and white mad eht photo look like a file photo fo a newspaper..pissem me off and I went for a hue shift to a more sepia.<br/><br/>As I did this the sky became more blown and detailed, the image went more silohuette and my eye stayed with the image longer.  I lost the sign in the front of the Roanoke Star describing its history.  That was something I needed for an article I am writing.  I am adding that element back in photoshop for the shot in my article but., becasue we can''t do that for the contest rules I left the sign blank ( which seemed to bother a couple folks but..thats life :-)</td>', 'Thanks for voting and taking time to make comments!The blown out sky was intentional.  I had this shot as a color shot...then moved it to black and white because the sky detail wasnt good enough for color.  Black and white mad eht photo look like a file photo fo a newspaper..pissem me off and I went for a hue shift to a more sepia.As I did this the sky became more blown and detailed, the image went more silohuette and my eye stayed with the image longer.  I lost the sign in the front of the Roanoke Star describing its history.  That was something I needed for an article I am writing.  I am adding that element back in photoshop for the shot in my article but., becasue we can''t do that for the contest rules I left the sign blank ( which seemed to bother a couple folks but..thats life :-)', '2002-05-06 09:07:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56021, 1317, 1066, '<td valign="top">BTW..can we add a spell checker..My typing SUCKS!!!</td>', 'BTW..can we add a spell checker..My typing SUCKS!!!', '2002-05-06 09:08:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56022, 1317, 2153, '<td valign="top">I love architectural photos and the sepia tones really played this one up. Good call! Usually I like B&amp;W for the stark contrast but in this case the color added alot. I see movement in the clouds and I really like it. Makes me think of a man-made comet.</td>', 'I love architectural photos and the sepia tones really played this one up. Good call! Usually I like B&W for the stark contrast but in this case the color added alot. I see movement in the clouds and I really like it. Makes me think of a man-made comet.', '2002-06-18 17:56:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56023, 1321, 205, '<td valign="top">what the hell?</td>', 'what the hell?', '2002-04-29 01:07:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56024, 1321, 352, '<td valign="top">I''ll assume this is real, but even so, the exposure is not well done.  The sky is too blown out.</td>', 'I''ll assume this is real, but even so, the exposure is not well done.  The sky is too blown out.', '2002-04-29 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56025, 1321, 1024, '<td valign="top">This photo seems a litle washed out.</td>', 'This photo seems a litle washed out.', '2002-04-29 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56026, 1321, 656, '<td valign="top">Great subject, and the building leads nicely up to it.  Picture seems to have suffered a lot in post-processing though.  Also seems quite over exposed.</td>', 'Great subject, and the building leads nicely up to it.  Picture seems to have suffered a lot in post-processing though.  Also seems quite over exposed.', '2002-04-29 09:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56027, 1321, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wow! This is from my home town :).<br/><br/>The lighting is really interesting but somehow the composition here seems awkward to me. It doesn''t have a tight enough focus.</td>', 'Wow! This is from my home town :).The lighting is really interesting but somehow the composition here seems awkward to me. It doesn''t have a tight enough focus.', '2002-04-29 11:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56028, 1321, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this could have been a really impressive photo with a little added clarity and possibly some of the ever elusive weather cooperation.  The tightrope wire appears very jagged and the bank building is quite grainy.</td>', 'I think this could have been a really impressive photo with a little added clarity and possibly some of the ever elusive weather cooperation.  The tightrope wire appears very jagged and the bank building is quite grainy.', '2002-04-29 13:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56029, 1321, 835, '<td valign="top">I like the subject but the lines and color are not crisp.  It is hard to make out the image on the highwire.</td>', 'I like the subject but the lines and color are not crisp.  It is hard to make out the image on the highwire.', '2002-04-29 14:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56030, 1321, 1336, '<td valign="top">impressive stunt.  photo isnt very sharp.</td>', 'impressive stunt.  photo isnt very sharp.', '2002-04-29 14:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56031, 1321, 962, '<td valign="top">Over-exposed.....</td>', 'Over-exposed.....', '2002-04-29 16:48:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(56032, 1321, 675, '<td valign="top">this picture is really grainy, i see that you were probably attempting to have the guy balancing on the bankwest spire</td>', 'this picture is really grainy, i see that you were probably attempting to have the guy balancing on the bankwest spire', '2002-04-29 18:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56033, 1321, 843, '<td valign="top">Good shot. Too bad it isn''t better quality.</td>', 'Good shot. Too bad it isn''t better quality.', '2002-04-29 22:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56034, 1321, 714, '<td valign="top">Cool, but it is to bad we couldn''t see the subject a bit better.</td>', 'Cool, but it is to bad we couldn''t see the subject a bit better.', '2002-04-30 09:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56035, 1321, 301, '<td valign="top">not keen on the white sky.  could have cropped the tree? on the left</td>', 'not keen on the white sky.  could have cropped the tree? on the left', '2002-04-30 09:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56036, 1321, 1078, '<td valign="top">contrast and exposure -- I''m guessing that you had to do some interesting metering or something to get the detail on the high wire act, but that left everything else kind of washed out -- not sure what advice to offer -- maybe a tighter zoom on the subject so there''s not so much sky?</td>', 'contrast and exposure -- I''m guessing that you had to do some interesting metering or something to get the detail on the high wire act, but that left everything else kind of washed out -- not sure what advice to offer -- maybe a tighter zoom on the subject so there''s not so much sky?', '2002-04-30 12:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56037, 1321, 1041, '<td valign="top">Even though the angle of the photograph is up, it doesn''t convey to me the impression that the camera was on or close to the ground.  I know from some of my photos that it can be on the ground, and not look like it, but I think the final impression conveyed is what counts.    Has the picture been compressed a little too much?  It doesn''t seem very crips.  Love the idea.  Where is this?</td>', 'Even though the angle of the photograph is up, it doesn''t convey to me the impression that the camera was on or close to the ground.  I know from some of my photos that it can be on the ground, and not look like it, but I think the final impression conveyed is what counts.    Has the picture been compressed a little too much?  It doesn''t seem very crips.  Love the idea.  Where is this?', '2002-04-30 12:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56038, 1321, 888, '<td valign="top">not great quality and its a bit difficult to distinguish what is actually hapening</td>', 'not great quality and its a bit difficult to distinguish what is actually hapening', '2002-04-30 14:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56039, 1321, 1135, '<td valign="top">Way over exposed.</td>', 'Way over exposed.', '2002-04-30 17:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56040, 1321, 811, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea.  I think a couple of things might have made it better -- cropping (read the discussion of this in the forums) it differently to get rid of the tree limbs.  Also, it is really grainy on my end.  If you used a digital zoom, that might have caused it, or a low res.  Also, for the challenge, take advantage of the 150 K, you still had some you could have used (I think this has been discussed in the forums also, if not post a question, and they will give you good ideas).</td>', 'Interesting idea.  I think a couple of things might have made it better -- cropping (read the discussion of this in the forums) it differently to get rid of the tree limbs.  Also, it is really grainy on my end.  If you used a digital zoom, that might have caused it, or a low res.  Also, for the challenge, take advantage of the 150 K, you still had some you could have used (I think this has been discussed in the forums also, if not post a question, and they will give you good ideas).', '2002-05-02 09:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56041, 1321, 640, '<td valign="top">Very interesting subject matter. However the focus seems off and the colors are muted</td>', 'Very interesting subject matter. However the focus seems off and the colors are muted', '2002-05-03 01:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56042, 1321, 330, '<td valign="top">Good effort but just too grainy and dull in appearence.</td>', 'Good effort but just too grainy and dull in appearence.', '2002-05-03 10:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56043, 1321, 885, '<td valign="top">Hard to tell if it was really foggy, or this is overexposed.  I kind of wish that the thing on the wire wasn''t so much straight above that antenna, dunno if that would have been possible.</td>', 'Hard to tell if it was really foggy, or this is overexposed.  I kind of wish that the thing on the wire wasn''t so much straight above that antenna, dunno if that would have been possible.', '2002-05-03 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56044, 1321, 637, '<td valign="top">The sky is terribly washed out.</td>', 'The sky is terribly washed out.', '2002-05-04 00:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56045, 1321, 1202, '<td valign="top">Too bad the detail is not here.  Has story and good composition.</td>', 'Too bad the detail is not here.  Has story and good composition.', '2002-05-04 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56046, 1321, 1457, '<td valign="top">thats cool! but the pictures doesn''t flatter it well</td>', 'thats cool! but the pictures doesn''t flatter it well', '2002-05-04 23:22:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56047, 1321, 689, '<td valign="top">A bit overexposed ... try using a manual setting on your camera.</td>', 'A bit overexposed ... try using a manual setting on your camera.', '2002-05-05 14:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56048, 1321, 1469, '<td valign="top">Wow...great photo but quality could have been much better. Maybe it''s just bad luck since it was an overcast day.  =(</td>', 'Wow...great photo but quality could have been much better. Maybe it''s just bad luck since it was an overcast day.  =(', '2002-05-05 18:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56049, 1321, 1, '<td valign="top">Very over exposed, a tighter crop of the walker would''ve been more dramatic.</td>', 'Very over exposed, a tighter crop of the walker would''ve been more dramatic.', '2002-05-05 23:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56050, 1322, 1233, '<td valign="top">Where''s the grounding wire!  Ha!  Nice shot.</td>', 'Where''s the grounding wire!  Ha!  Nice shot.', '2002-04-29 06:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56051, 1322, 885, '<td valign="top">I like the rustiness, as it contrasts very well with the blue sky.  It seems like it maybe could have been better composed - there are a lot of places where lines are cut off, yet it doesn''t completely fill the frame.</td>', 'I like the rustiness, as it contrasts very well with the blue sky.  It seems like it maybe could have been better composed - there are a lot of places where lines are cut off, yet it doesn''t completely fill the frame.', '2002-04-29 09:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56052, 1322, 1024, '<td valign="top">Nie shooting this on a stormy day, the clouds add so much  to the composition.</td>', 'Nie shooting this on a stormy day, the clouds add so much  to the composition.', '2002-04-29 09:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56053, 1322, 656, '<td valign="top">lots of interesting textures and lines.</td>', 'lots of interesting textures and lines.', '2002-04-29 10:02:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56054, 1322, 189, '<td valign="top">Good Subject. Might have been better if taken from a differnt angle.</td>', 'Good Subject. Might have been better if taken from a differnt angle.', '2002-04-29 10:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56055, 1322, 1034, '<td valign="top">not bad.... not great either.</td>', 'not bad.... not great either.', '2002-04-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56056, 1322, 1037, '<td valign="top">Wonderful textures, great sense of erosion and decay, set off by a dramatic sky :). I think though that either the cimneys (?) at the side or the electrical wiring would make a better subject on its own, rather than framing them both together.</td>', 'Wonderful textures, great sense of erosion and decay, set off by a dramatic sky :). I think though that either the cimneys (?) at the side or the electrical wiring would make a better subject on its own, rather than framing them both together.', '2002-04-29 11:21:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56057, 1322, 772, '<td valign="top">I like the camera tilt on this particular shot but the general subject matter doens''t grab my attention very well.</td>', 'I like the camera tilt on this particular shot but the general subject matter doens''t grab my attention very well.', '2002-04-29 11:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
