(56119, 1326, 715, '<td valign="top">HEY!!! That''s my Van Gogh. It was stolen last week, just before I was going to use it as a background for my dummy-picture. Now it get a lot of comments that my background is too plain. :-)<br/>Anyhow, what else can I say then this is a brilliant idea!!</td>', 'HEY!!! That''s my Van Gogh. It was stolen last week, just before I was going to use it as a background for my dummy-picture. Now it get a lot of comments that my background is too plain. :-)Anyhow, what else can I say then this is a brilliant idea!!', '2002-04-30 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
