(56125, 1326, 748, '<td valign="top">I like the angle and the lighting, background may be a little busy.</td>', 'I like the angle and the lighting, background may be a little busy.', '2002-05-01 15:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56126, 1326, 878, '<td valign="top">Pretty neat concept to this shot.  I fear the dummy now.  Nice use of light and great background.  The perspective of the shot conveys the challenge topic quite well IMO. <br/><br/></td>', 'Pretty neat concept to this shot.  I fear the dummy now.  Nice use of light and great background.  The perspective of the shot conveys the challenge topic quite well IMO. ', '2002-05-01 16:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56127, 1326, 1066, '<td valign="top">Good compostion with the background.  Adds emotion.  For some reason I feel like a red light on the dummy would have really added to the feeling of anger or menace I get from this photo.  Imagine half that model being red :-)  I go to walmart for all kinds of cheap colored bulbs for light affects.</td>', 'Good compostion with the background.  Adds emotion.  For some reason I feel like a red light on the dummy would have really added to the feeling of anger or menace I get from this photo.  Imagine half that model being red :-)  I go to walmart for all kinds of cheap colored bulbs for light affects.', '2002-05-01 17:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56128, 1326, 509, '<td valign="top">Great composition, love the painting in the background, I used to know what it was...  Lighting may be a bit strong on the dummy</td>', 'Great composition, love the painting in the background, I used to know what it was...  Lighting may be a bit strong on the dummy', '2002-05-01 20:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
