(56302, 1332, 1037, '<td valign="top">There are lots of interesting things in this photo but it''s one of those ones where I feel like the elements don''t mesh together to provide a whole piece, rather they compete for attention. Eg., the house in the background, the vertical posts, the wet floorboards, and the carpet... nothing takes the focus, everything causes a distraction from everything else. One thing on its own would have been a better subject.</td>', 'There are lots of interesting things in this photo but it''s one of those ones where I feel like the elements don''t mesh together to provide a whole piece, rather they compete for attention. Eg., the house in the background, the vertical posts, the wet floorboards, and the carpet... nothing takes the focus, everything causes a distraction from everything else. One thing on its own would have been a better subject.', '2002-04-30 02:17:00.000000', NULL, 1),
