(56576, 1348, 1175, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... apparently a reflection off a water surface.  Maybe your subject should be "to the ground and up" :)  The image is not very clear.  Makes an interesting abstract photo though.</td>', 'Hmmm... apparently a reflection off a water surface.  Maybe your subject should be "to the ground and up" :)  The image is not very clear.  Makes an interesting abstract photo though.', '2002-04-29 06:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
