(56578, 1348, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a nice water reflection photo.  In a photo like this, you may want to consider having some of the shoreline visible in the shot so that it doesn''t look like a filter has been applied.  My *first* thought when I saw this shot was that it had been filtered.  As I looked a little more, I can definitely see that it''s a water reflection.  Nice shot!</td>', 'This is a nice water reflection photo.  In a photo like this, you may want to consider having some of the shoreline visible in the shot so that it doesn''t look like a filter has been applied.  My *first* thought when I saw this shot was that it had been filtered.  As I looked a little more, I can definitely see that it''s a water reflection.  Nice shot!', '2002-04-29 07:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
