(56619, 1350, 772, '<td valign="top">I really like your perspective on this photo.  The detail in the foreground is great!  I can also definitely tell that I am looking up :)  I have also, during preparation for this challenge, learned how to achieve this shot and maintain proper depth of field to keep everything in focus.  You simply have to step back about 18" from this pole.  You don''t have to put yor camera right on it.  Nice job!</td>', 'I really like your perspective on this photo.  The detail in the foreground is great!  I can also definitely tell that I am looking up :)  I have also, during preparation for this challenge, learned how to achieve this shot and maintain proper depth of field to keep everything in focus.  You simply have to step back about 18" from this pole.  You don''t have to put yor camera right on it.  Nice job!', '2002-04-30 10:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
