(56636, 1351, 352, '<td valign="top">I like how the rungs cut throught he shot.  Nice angle.</td>', 'I like how the rungs cut throught he shot.  Nice angle.', '2002-04-29 02:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56637, 1351, 1024, '<td valign="top">I would have added a little contrast I think.</td>', 'I would have added a little contrast I think.', '2002-04-29 08:27:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56638, 1351, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a good concept and I particularly like the tilt in this shot.  I''m sure you will receive some comments the other way on that though...  I think this shot woud be more impressive with some higher amount of contrast.  In my opinion, there isn''t enough contrast between this tower and the background.  it would be really neat if someone was climbing the ladder.  You probably ran into the same problem I had trying to get a similar shot.  I bet this tower was fenced in and locked up!  Good job...</td>', 'This is a good concept and I particularly like the tilt in this shot.  I''m sure you will receive some comments the other way on that though...  I think this shot woud be more impressive with some higher amount of contrast.  In my opinion, there isn''t enough contrast between this tower and the background.  it would be really neat if someone was climbing the ladder.  You probably ran into the same problem I had trying to get a similar shot.  I bet this tower was fenced in and locked up!  Good job...', '2002-04-29 08:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56639, 1351, 656, '<td valign="top">grey, grey and more grey.  Interesting study in monochrome, if that was what you were after.  I''d personally like more light, maybe a rising/ setting sun casting strong shadows on the rungs ?  If the sky''s always that colour maybe you don''t see the sun much...</td>', 'grey, grey and more grey.  Interesting study in monochrome, if that was what you were after.  I''d personally like more light, maybe a rising/ setting sun casting strong shadows on the rungs ?  If the sky''s always that colour maybe you don''t see the sun much...', '2002-04-29 09:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56640, 1351, 259, '<td valign="top">lacks good contrast in colors.</td>', 'lacks good contrast in colors.', '2002-04-29 11:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56641, 1351, 1175, '<td valign="top">very gray.  lots of artifacts in the "sky".  repetition of the ladder rungs is cool.  other than that not great to look at.</td>', 'very gray.  lots of artifacts in the "sky".  repetition of the ladder rungs is cool.  other than that not great to look at.', '2002-04-29 12:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56642, 1351, 509, '<td valign="top">Good choice of using black and white, but I would have increased the contrast in post production.  Nice angle</td>', 'Good choice of using black and white, but I would have increased the contrast in post production.  Nice angle', '2002-04-29 13:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56643, 1351, 689, '<td valign="top">I dont think there is enough contrast to do this with black&amp;white ...</td>', 'I dont think there is enough contrast to do this with black&white ...', '2002-04-29 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56644, 1351, 962, '<td valign="top">Overexpose &amp; Out-Of-Focus (OOF)..........</td>', 'Overexpose & Out-Of-Focus (OOF)..........', '2002-04-29 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56645, 1351, 724, '<td valign="top">Definately looking up!  The contrast is a bit dull though.</td>', 'Definately looking up!  The contrast is a bit dull though.', '2002-04-29 21:23:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56646, 1351, 1037, '<td valign="top">Very interesting composition... somehow it reminds me of 1920s socialist propaganda, although I''m not sure why :). The ladder creates a sense of purpose, the converging lines and geometric shapes are interesting and somehow the lack of contrast works. I just think it''s a bit dull though.</td>', 'Very interesting composition... somehow it reminds me of 1920s socialist propaganda, although I''m not sure why :). The ladder creates a sense of purpose, the converging lines and geometric shapes are interesting and somehow the lack of contrast works. I just think it''s a bit dull though.', '2002-04-30 02:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56647, 1351, 107, '<td valign="top">I would like to have seen a bit more contrast in this shot.</td>', 'I would like to have seen a bit more contrast in this shot.', '2002-04-30 02:57:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56648, 1351, 1078, '<td valign="top">Composed nicely, but the contrast is flat.  I also find myself wishing for one additional visual element -- since I''m not sure what this is, I don''t know what element I''d suggest -- just something to contrast all the perspective lines</td>', 'Composed nicely, but the contrast is flat.  I also find myself wishing for one additional visual element -- since I''m not sure what this is, I don''t know what element I''d suggest -- just something to contrast all the perspective lines', '2002-04-30 12:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56649, 1351, 1041, '<td valign="top">Unfortunately, photo looks a little grainy.  Also, while the ladder leads the viewer through the whole photo, which is nice, there''s nothing else to hold the attention.</td>', 'Unfortunately, photo looks a little grainy.  Also, while the ladder leads the viewer through the whole photo, which is nice, there''s nothing else to hold the attention.', '2002-04-30 13:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56650, 1351, 888, '<td valign="top">nice angle and height but it just seems the tower is a bit dull</td>', 'nice angle and height but it just seems the tower is a bit dull', '2002-04-30 16:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56651, 1351, 1135, '<td valign="top">Looks rather bleak. Is this the look you were going for? Nice perspective.</td>', 'Looks rather bleak. Is this the look you were going for? Nice perspective.', '2002-04-30 16:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56652, 1351, 301, '<td valign="top">is this the stairway to heaven :)</td>', 'is this the stairway to heaven :)', '2002-05-01 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56653, 1351, 543, '<td valign="top">Nice and simple, but too flat tonally, unsharp and noisy.</td>', 'Nice and simple, but too flat tonally, unsharp and noisy.', '2002-05-01 11:12:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56654, 1351, 878, '<td valign="top">Boy thats a long way up.</td>', 'Boy thats a long way up.', '2002-05-01 13:54:00.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(56655, 1351, 748, '<td valign="top">Good perspective, but short on detail.</td>', 'Good perspective, but short on detail.', '2002-05-01 15:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56656, 1351, 244, '<td valign="top">This picture meets the challenge, it is fromt the ground up.  That being said the whole picture is out of focus, and there is no contrast everything is almost the same shade of grey.</td>', 'This picture meets the challenge, it is fromt the ground up.  That being said the whole picture is out of focus, and there is no contrast everything is almost the same shade of grey.', '2002-05-01 17:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56657, 1351, 739, '<td valign="top">Why did you choose B&amp;W? Nice shot.</td>', 'Why did you choose B&W? Nice shot.', '2002-05-01 21:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56658, 1351, 933, '<td valign="top">I dont know if you were intentionally going for that diffused color look, but it really detracts from an otherwise nicely composed photo.</td>', 'I dont know if you were intentionally going for that diffused color look, but it really detracts from an otherwise nicely composed photo.', '2002-05-02 20:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56659, 1351, 640, '<td valign="top">Good capture of height.Blurry &amp; too plain--not interesting enough</td>', 'Good capture of height.Blurry & too plain--not interesting enough', '2002-05-03 01:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56660, 1351, 330, '<td valign="top">Just too monochromantic.</td>', 'Just too monochromantic.', '2002-05-03 10:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56661, 1351, 885, '<td valign="top">The composition is rather nice, but sort of unexciting</td>', 'The composition is rather nice, but sort of unexciting', '2002-05-03 15:10:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56662, 1351, 637, '<td valign="top">Very up, but not terribly pleasing aesthetically...</td>', 'Very up, but not terribly pleasing aesthetically...', '2002-05-03 19:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56663, 1351, 1457, '<td valign="top">the leaning tower of blah...</td>', 'the leaning tower of blah...', '2002-05-04 22:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56664, 1351, 749, '<td valign="top">I persnally wouldn''t have chosen B&amp;W for this shot, as there is very little texture to either the sky or the tower/chimney. However, the overall bleak, industrial gloominess of the piece makes it work.</td>', 'I persnally wouldn''t have chosen B&W for this shot, as there is very little texture to either the sky or the tower/chimney. However, the overall bleak, industrial gloominess of the piece makes it work.', '2002-05-05 10:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56665, 1351, 1070, '<td valign="top">Sorry too cliché and dull !!!</td>', 'Sorry too cliché and dull !!!', '2002-05-05 12:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56666, 1351, 2, '<td valign="top">The picture seems really blotchy, and though I''m not sure what would cause that, it distracts me from the simplicity of the photograph.  I really love the subject, though.  If you cut just a little closer at the bottom, it would seem like the steps just went on forever.</td>', 'The picture seems really blotchy, and though I''m not sure what would cause that, it distracts me from the simplicity of the photograph.  I really love the subject, though.  If you cut just a little closer at the bottom, it would seem like the steps just went on forever.', '2002-05-05 13:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56667, 1351, 1, '<td valign="top">The shot is cool, but it just seems so grainy and bland.  I think the b/w is unnecessary.</td>', 'The shot is cool, but it just seems so grainy and bland.  I think the b/w is unnecessary.', '2002-05-05 23:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56672, 1353, 352, '<td valign="top">The top looks a bit overexposed, and the water is a weird and somewhat un-natural color.  A neutral density filter on the camera might have helped bring the contrast to a more caputrable level.  At the very least, have the exposre lock on a mid tone (with the dry red rock, there is plenty here.)</td>', 'The top looks a bit overexposed, and the water is a weird and somewhat un-natural color.  A neutral density filter on the camera might have helped bring the contrast to a more caputrable level.  At the very least, have the exposre lock on a mid tone (with the dry red rock, there is plenty here.)', '2002-04-29 01:33:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56673, 1353, 738, '<td valign="top">dont go chasin waterfalls!</td>', 'dont go chasin waterfalls!', '2002-04-29 08:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56674, 1353, 1024, '<td valign="top">Fantastic photograph.</td>', 'Fantastic photograph.', '2002-04-29 09:24:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56675, 1353, 1209, '<td valign="top">Very nice.</td>', 'Very nice.', '2002-04-29 09:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56676, 1353, 92, '<td valign="top">What a beautiful place. I like the capture and the angle. The water coming down isn''t as clear or nice as it should be. That may just be the camera you have.</td>', 'What a beautiful place. I like the capture and the angle. The water coming down isn''t as clear or nice as it should be. That may just be the camera you have.', '2002-04-29 09:48:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56677, 1353, 301, '<td valign="top">Great waterfall.  I would have used a longer exposure to really get the smooth water look</td>', 'Great waterfall.  I would have used a longer exposure to really get the smooth water look', '2002-04-29 10:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56678, 1353, 656, '<td valign="top">good landscape, but a bit over exposed.  Maybe if you didn''t have any sky in it at all it would be better ?  Could be better at either dawn/ dusk with different light ?</td>', 'good landscape, but a bit over exposed.  Maybe if you didn''t have any sky in it at all it would be better ?  Could be better at either dawn/ dusk with different light ?', '2002-04-29 10:11:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56679, 1353, 675, '<td valign="top">not really a picture of from the ground up, otherwise a really cool looking waterfall</td>', 'not really a picture of from the ground up, otherwise a really cool looking waterfall', '2002-04-29 10:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56680, 1353, 1037, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! The colours are great and the lighting is a little harsh but not badly. Images of moving water are often enhanced by a long exposure time, I''ve found. In this case it would create a glassy effect to the water with a haze from the spray, but maybe you don''t want that.<br/><br/>The path of the waterfalls gives me the same feeling I get from Chinese landscape painting, ie. my eyes want to wander all around the picture.</td>', 'Beautiful! The colours are great and the lighting is a little harsh but not badly. Images of moving water are often enhanced by a long exposure time, I''ve found. In this case it would create a glassy effect to the water with a haze from the spray, but maybe you don''t want that.The path of the waterfalls gives me the same feeling I get from Chinese landscape painting, ie. my eyes want to wander all around the picture.', '2002-04-29 10:46:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56681, 1353, 156, '<td valign="top">appears to have been shot straight on, versus from the ground up</td>', 'appears to have been shot straight on, versus from the ground up', '2002-04-29 11:43:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56682, 1353, 772, '<td valign="top">This is a very nice landscape photo.  I like all the elements of this landscape.  What bothers me here is that the falling water in this photo gives me a "from the top down" impression rather than "from the ground up".  I''m also a sucker for longer exposures on waterfalls but since this is just *my* preference, i don''t include that in my scoring :)  Nice shot!</td>', 'This is a very nice landscape photo.  I like all the elements of this landscape.  What bothers me here is that the falling water in this photo gives me a "from the top down" impression rather than "from the ground up".  I''m also a sucker for longer exposures on waterfalls but since this is just *my* preference, i don''t include that in my scoring :)  Nice shot!', '2002-04-29 13:18:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56683, 1353, 544, '<td valign="top">I feel like I could say this for a lot of the current photos, that if I listened to the "gripers" on the boards, I''d be recommending most of these for disqualification. But I like this picture, and think you captured something really strong, even if the camera angle isn''t so dramatic as to give you whiplash :) Your colors are beautiful and you have decent texturing on the rock. I might suggest zooming in a bit more on the water, as that seems to be the stronger focal point. It would also give more dimension and make for a more powerful image. But definitely, good job overall.</td>', 'I feel like I could say this for a lot of the current photos, that if I listened to the "gripers" on the boards, I''d be recommending most of these for disqualification. But I like this picture, and think you captured something really strong, even if the camera angle isn''t so dramatic as to give you whiplash :) Your colors are beautiful and you have decent texturing on the rock. I might suggest zooming in a bit more on the water, as that seems to be the stronger focal point. It would also give more dimension and make for a more powerful image. But definitely, good job overall.', '2002-04-29 13:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56684, 1353, 885, '<td valign="top">The water seems to have a little bit of a blue tinge.  Well done, but not remarkable photo.</td>', 'The water seems to have a little bit of a blue tinge.  Well done, but not remarkable photo.', '2002-04-29 13:59:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56685, 1353, 1175, '<td valign="top">That''s a great picture.  I disagree with it for the topic.  What you did was take picutres of everything from the ground up rather then taking a picture from the ground and shooting up.  This would have been difficult from what I can see here but it would have been cool if you could have jumped into the water and taken a picutre of the water fall from the base.</td>', 'That''s a great picture.  I disagree with it for the topic.  What you did was take picutres of everything from the ground up rather then taking a picture from the ground and shooting up.  This would have been difficult from what I can see here but it would have been cool if you could have jumped into the water and taken a picutre of the water fall from the base.', '2002-04-29 14:08:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56686, 1353, 1336, '<td valign="top">beautiful location</td>', 'beautiful location', '2002-04-29 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56687, 1353, 962, '<td valign="top">Nice shot...</td>', 'Nice shot...', '2002-04-29 16:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56688, 1353, 327, '<td valign="top">Maybe a little out of focus, still it''s the right idea. <br/>Nice work.</td>', 'Maybe a little out of focus, still it''s the right idea. Nice work.', '2002-04-29 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56689, 1353, 1005, '<td valign="top">Can''t go wrong with waterfalls!  Great subject...Challenge met!</td>', 'Can''t go wrong with waterfalls!  Great subject...Challenge met!', '2002-04-29 17:40:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56690, 1353, 661, '<td valign="top">I wish this picture was a little sharper.  Nice color tones.</td>', 'I wish this picture was a little sharper.  Nice color tones.', '2002-04-29 18:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56691, 1353, 1283, '<td valign="top">Beautiful place...........Great shot........</td>', 'Beautiful place...........Great shot........', '2002-04-30 03:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56692, 1353, 587, '<td valign="top">gorgeous photo!</td>', 'gorgeous photo!', '2002-04-30 07:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56693, 1353, 782, '<td valign="top">Best of the lot</td>', 'Best of the lot', '2002-04-30 19:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56694, 1353, 1066, '<td valign="top">Great location, I would have loved to see a shot of these falls from a much closer perspective looking up.  I can see the potential here and like the composition.</td>', 'Great location, I would have loved to see a shot of these falls from a much closer perspective looking up.  I can see the potential here and like the composition.', '2002-05-01 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56695, 1353, 1041, '<td valign="top">I''m sure the camera is actually resting on a rock in the foreground, but I don''t get the feel of "from the ground up" by looking at the photo.  Nice fall though.</td>', 'I''m sure the camera is actually resting on a rock in the foreground, but I don''t get the feel of "from the ground up" by looking at the photo.  Nice fall though.', '2002-05-01 10:37:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56696, 1353, 901, '<td valign="top"><br/></td>', '', '2002-05-02 01:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56697, 1353, 1290, '<td valign="top">Fabulous photo and location.</td>', 'Fabulous photo and location.', '2002-05-02 19:49:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56698, 1353, 933, '<td valign="top">Nice colors.  very peaceful</td>', 'Nice colors.  very peaceful', '2002-05-02 20:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56699, 1353, 739, '<td valign="top">Love the blue in the water.  Did you take this around 1-3pm?</td>', 'Love the blue in the water.  Did you take this around 1-3pm?', '2002-05-03 11:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56700, 1353, 1202, '<td valign="top">Did you have your fly rod with you?   Inviting, shot.</td>', 'Did you have your fly rod with you?   Inviting, shot.', '2002-05-04 08:47:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56701, 1353, 1457, '<td valign="top">cool postcard shot, not very interesting otherwise, unless it''s your backyard</td>', 'cool postcard shot, not very interesting otherwise, unless it''s your backyard', '2002-05-04 22:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56702, 1353, 1, '<td valign="top">Cool shot, but FROM the GROUND up isn''t what''s happenign here.</td>', 'Cool shot, but FROM the GROUND up isn''t what''s happenign here.', '2002-05-05 23:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56703, 1353, 2, '<td valign="top">Great colors!  The orange and blue really complement each other well.</td>', 'Great colors!  The orange and blue really complement each other well.', '2002-05-05 23:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56704, 1354, 772, '<td valign="top">This is an interesting submission... I agree with the title.</td>', 'This is an interesting submission... I agree with the title.', '2002-04-29 05:56:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56705, 1354, 1024, '<td valign="top">I like the angle, and the photo definately meets the challenge.  I think that if it had not been over exposed I would have liked it more.</td>', 'I like the angle, and the photo definately meets the challenge.  I think that if it had not been over exposed I would have liked it more.', '2002-04-29 08:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56706, 1354, 157, '<td valign="top">growl ;)</td>', 'growl ;)', '2002-04-29 09:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56707, 1354, 1209, '<td valign="top">Yes, overexposed.</td>', 'Yes, overexposed.', '2002-04-29 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56708, 1354, 656, '<td valign="top">Yup, very over-exposed...</td>', 'Yup, very over-exposed...', '2002-04-29 09:39:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56709, 1354, 675, '<td valign="top">people will say they don''t like this because it''s overexposed, but who cares, this picture is really awesome</td>', 'people will say they don''t like this because it''s overexposed, but who cares, this picture is really awesome', '2002-04-29 10:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56710, 1354, 189, '<td valign="top">What''s up...fool!</td>', 'What''s up...fool!', '2002-04-29 11:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56711, 1354, 156, '<td valign="top">shouldn''t this be vertical?</td>', 'shouldn''t this be vertical?', '2002-04-29 11:45:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56712, 1354, 509, '<td valign="top">This is a pretty nice shot, but it doesn''t really leave a lasting impression.  I think it could have done without the object in the lower left corner</td>', 'This is a pretty nice shot, but it doesn''t really leave a lasting impression.  I think it could have done without the object in the lower left corner', '2002-04-29 15:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56713, 1354, 689, '<td valign="top">I am waiting to see how many people tell you it is overexposed! First impression, I didn''t like it but it kinda has a Hollywood feel to the look ... good job.</td>', 'I am waiting to see how many people tell you it is overexposed! First impression, I didn''t like it but it kinda has a Hollywood feel to the look ... good job.', '2002-04-29 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56714, 1354, 1379, '<td valign="top">You''re photogenic, and intense, and you look like you''re 20 feet tall!  Auggh!</td>', 'You''re photogenic, and intense, and you look like you''re 20 feet tall!  Auggh!', '2002-04-29 15:14:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56715, 1354, 1175, '<td valign="top">Gimme some action.  The photos a bit boring just standing around. oh yeah... and the overexposure doesn''t really work here.</td>', 'Gimme some action.  The photos a bit boring just standing around. oh yeah... and the overexposure doesn''t really work here.', '2002-04-29 15:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56716, 1354, 962, '<td valign="top">Over-expose photos may not be suitable for this case !!!</td>', 'Over-expose photos may not be suitable for this case !!!', '2002-04-29 16:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56717, 1354, 327, '<td valign="top">yes it is, but very crisp.</td>', 'yes it is, but very crisp.', '2002-04-29 16:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56718, 1354, 1, '<td valign="top">Over exposed with a lot of haziness.  Maybe play with the white balance to not haze it up as much?</td>', 'Over exposed with a lot of haziness.  Maybe play with the white balance to not haze it up as much?', '2002-04-29 20:38:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56719, 1354, 885, '<td valign="top">You''re right, it''s overexposed.  I think it would have been more striking if you''d turned the contrast up more though.</td>', 'You''re right, it''s overexposed.  I think it would have been more striking if you''d turned the contrast up more though.', '2002-04-30 09:31:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56720, 1354, 301, '<td valign="top">well done on breaking the rules and coming up with something that is still interesting</td>', 'well done on breaking the rules and coming up with something that is still interesting', '2002-04-30 10:13:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56721, 1354, 472, '<td valign="top">i like the over exposed look.  did u do that on purpose?</td>', 'i like the over exposed look.  did u do that on purpose?', '2002-04-30 11:44:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56722, 1354, 1041, '<td valign="top">Like the angle and the framing.  Know the title calls for it to be overexposed, but would''ve preferred this less overexposed anyway.  Just my opinion.</td>', 'Like the angle and the framing.  Know the title calls for it to be overexposed, but would''ve preferred this less overexposed anyway.  Just my opinion.', '2002-04-30 12:06:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56723, 1354, 1078, '<td valign="top">it''s interesting -- and I like the way you''ve left the image a horizontal instead of a vert -- I think I would have tried to find somewhere where the railing in the background could have been avoided -- focus completely on you -- but that''s a personal taste</td>', 'it''s interesting -- and I like the way you''ve left the image a horizontal instead of a vert -- I think I would have tried to find somewhere where the railing in the background could have been avoided -- focus completely on you -- but that''s a personal taste', '2002-04-30 12:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56724, 1354, 1135, '<td valign="top">Why so over exposed? Nice perspective.</td>', 'Why so over exposed? Nice perspective.', '2002-04-30 16:54:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56725, 1354, 543, '<td valign="top">Is the title a statement of intent, or an excuse?  Doesn''t really work either way.  Sorry.</td>', 'Is the title a statement of intent, or an excuse?  Doesn''t really work either way.  Sorry.', '2002-05-01 11:09:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56726, 1354, 640, '<td valign="top">Interesting and creative. What''s he so angry about?</td>', 'Interesting and creative. What''s he so angry about?', '2002-05-03 01:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56727, 1354, 330, '<td valign="top">I like the pose/picture, but the overexposure doesn''t add to the picture.</td>', 'I like the pose/picture, but the overexposure doesn''t add to the picture.', '2002-05-03 06:58:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56728, 1354, 933, '<td valign="top">Interesting shot.  Not sure why you chose a horizontal layout.</td>', 'Interesting shot.  Not sure why you chose a horizontal layout.', '2002-05-03 15:19:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56729, 1354, 718, '<td valign="top">I like this one.</td>', 'I like this one.', '2002-05-04 13:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56730, 1354, 1457, '<td valign="top">i''d like it better upright</td>', 'i''d like it better upright', '2002-05-04 23:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56731, 1354, 259, '<td valign="top">I titled this pic in a way in which to let everyone know that I knew what I was doing.  I over exposed the picture in the camera, when it was taken.  I did nothing to touch it up in PhotoShop or any other program.  Also the thing in the corner is my foot, and I felt it helped to add some sence of movement/perspective to the photo.<br/><br/>Also as far as the overall picture, the picture would be much more boring and normal if I turned it upright and it wasn''t over exposed.  This picture is more experimental and unusual, and like others of its kind it will never be as widely liked as the more normal photos, and I understand that.</td>', 'I titled this pic in a way in which to let everyone know that I knew what I was doing.  I over exposed the picture in the camera, when it was taken.  I did nothing to touch it up in PhotoShop or any other program.  Also the thing in the corner is my foot, and I felt it helped to add some sence of movement/perspective to the photo.Also as far as the overall picture, the picture would be much more boring and normal if I turned it upright and it wasn''t over exposed.  This picture is more experimental and unusual, and like others of its kind it will never be as widely liked as the more normal photos, and I understand that.', '2002-05-06 14:09:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(56732, 1356, 1024, '<td valign="top">cute idea.</td>', 'cute idea.', '2002-04-29 08:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56733, 1356, 656, '<td valign="top">Interesting idea - do you always look so stern to your kids ? :)</td>', 'Interesting idea - do you always look so stern to your kids ? :)', '2002-04-29 09:35:00.000000', NULL, 1),
