(56744, 1356, 661, '<td valign="top">He looks tall.  It almost looks like his head is about to hit the ceiling.</td>', 'He looks tall.  It almost looks like his head is about to hit the ceiling.', '2002-04-29 19:25:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56745, 1356, 1, '<td valign="top">A bit too much white space above his head.  Also for this kind of intimidating shot, a different a attire might be more appropriate.</td>', 'A bit too much white space above his head.  Also for this kind of intimidating shot, a different a attire might be more appropriate.', '2002-04-29 20:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56746, 1356, 536, '<td valign="top">I like. You can tell by the size of his arms and thighs that he isn''t a giant.  But the angle and low ceiling makes him a tad intimidating.  Is your white balance a little off?  With a little better lighting I think (not sure) that you could avoid the heavy shadow behind him and the "flash" on his glasses.  Good job.  It isn''t perfect but it is neat.</td>', 'I like. You can tell by the size of his arms and thighs that he isn''t a giant.  But the angle and low ceiling makes him a tad intimidating.  Is your white balance a little off?  With a little better lighting I think (not sure) that you could avoid the heavy shadow behind him and the "flash" on his glasses.  Good job.  It isn''t perfect but it is neat.', '2002-04-30 00:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56747, 1356, 459, '<td valign="top">Dad looks like a giant!  Shadows from flash make image hard to decipher.</td>', 'Dad looks like a giant!  Shadows from flash make image hard to decipher.', '2002-04-30 10:36:00.000000', NULL, 1),
