(56749, 1356, 1135, '<td valign="top">Now you know how your Kids see you. Nice shot.</td>', 'Now you know how your Kids see you. Nice shot.', '2002-04-30 17:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56750, 1356, 1041, '<td valign="top">The way he''s looking down at me gives the impression that he''s too tall to actually stand up straight - nice!  Good focus.  Shame about the cut-off elbow to the left.</td>', 'The way he''s looking down at me gives the impression that he''s too tall to actually stand up straight - nice!  Good focus.  Shame about the cut-off elbow to the left.', '2002-05-01 11:34:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56751, 1356, 1078, '<td valign="top">the angle on this seems like it either needs to be more extreme, or non-existent (not up and down, but the side to side -- how one shoulder is closer than the other).  Because of the flash, it seems like his face is a tad underexposed, and you can''t see his eyes because of the flash reflection in his glasses</td>', 'the angle on this seems like it either needs to be more extreme, or non-existent (not up and down, but the side to side -- how one shoulder is closer than the other).  Because of the flash, it seems like his face is a tad underexposed, and you can''t see his eyes because of the flash reflection in his glasses', '2002-05-01 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56752, 1356, 813, '<td valign="top">This may have worked better if the gian were wearing long pants and if you could have gotten even lighting. It''s tough to take a good flash shot of a subject that''s receding from view.</td>', 'This may have worked better if the gian were wearing long pants and if you could have gotten even lighting. It''s tough to take a good flash shot of a subject that''s receding from view.', '2002-05-01 18:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
