(56756, 1356, 1350, '<td valign="top">I love the title of this pic...and the image itself. It really hits home, especially since I''m the Dad to two small children. Well done!</td>', 'I love the title of this pic...and the image itself. It really hits home, especially since I''m the Dad to two small children. Well done!', '2002-05-05 19:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56757, 1356, 715, '<td valign="top">Well done Leah, I think it was a very nice picture. Don''t let the 100th place it stop you from making more pictures. Keep learning from your dad and  I''m sure you will end up first in the list someday.</td>', 'Well done Leah, I think it was a very nice picture. Don''t let the 100th place it stop you from making more pictures. Keep learning from your dad and  I''m sure you will end up first in the list someday.', '2002-05-07 15:35:00.000000', NULL, 0),
