(56767, 1357, 885, '<td valign="top">Interesting subject.  The backlighting was a good choise, because you don''t have the glare on the front yet you''re able to tell that it''s flat by the highlights around the edges.  I''m a bit confused by the space between his legs and below his paper, so that is a bit distracting.  Is the white a doorway?  It seems as if there ought to be more yellow in that area, but I don''t know the scene really..</td>', 'Interesting subject.  The backlighting was a good choise, because you don''t have the glare on the front yet you''re able to tell that it''s flat by the highlights around the edges.  I''m a bit confused by the space between his legs and below his paper, so that is a bit distracting.  Is the white a doorway?  It seems as if there ought to be more yellow in that area, but I don''t know the scene really..', '2002-04-30 08:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56768, 1357, 459, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot.  Everything works.  From "the ground up" perspective makes the object bigger than life. The message board lets us know what the object is.  The cutout is very interesting.  The muted wall is just right.  Even the reflection in the window adds to the effect</td>', 'I really like this shot.  Everything works.  From "the ground up" perspective makes the object bigger than life. The message board lets us know what the object is.  The cutout is very interesting.  The muted wall is just right.  Even the reflection in the window adds to the effect', '2002-04-30 10:55:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56769, 1357, 142, '<td valign="top">I like this.</td>', 'I like this.', '2002-04-30 16:29:00.000000', NULL, 1),
