(56773, 1357, 637, '<td valign="top">Explanation: The background was out of my control.  This "paperboy" was placed in front of a bookstore, and management would not allow it to be moved.  The confusion between his legs is a tree, I believe, and I believe the lower right hand corner is the sky.</td>', 'Explanation: The background was out of my control.  This "paperboy" was placed in front of a bookstore, and management would not allow it to be moved.  The confusion between his legs is a tree, I believe, and I believe the lower right hand corner is the sky.', '2002-05-06 02:15:00.000000', NULL, 0),
