(55756, 1305, 2, '<td valign="top">Very nice composition.  I love the contrast of objects and the contrast of colors working together.</td>', 'Very nice composition.  I love the contrast of objects and the contrast of colors working together.', '2002-05-05 13:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55757, 1305, 689, '<td valign="top">Nice colors ... my opinon, I would have rather had the cactus in focus with the foreground blured ... but that is just my opinion!</td>', 'Nice colors ... my opinon, I would have rather had the cactus in focus with the foreground blured ... but that is just my opinion!', '2002-05-05 14:26:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55758, 1305, 1191, '<td valign="top">Nice shot</td>', 'Nice shot', '2002-05-05 18:05:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55759, 1305, 1336, '<td valign="top">This was my first entry on DPC.  Thanks for all the feedback.  The most common comment was that I should have used a deeper DOF in this photo (although several people said they liked the DOF I used).  Well, that rock just looked beautiful to me and to capture it how I wanted, my camera needed to be in macro mode.  Because of that, I don''t think I could have had a deeper DOF, although if I''m wrong, please correct me.  Anyway, I had fun with this one and it was cool to see all of the positive things people said about my photo.</td>', 'This was my first entry on DPC.  Thanks for all the feedback.  The most common comment was that I should have used a deeper DOF in this photo (although several people said they liked the DOF I used).  Well, that rock just looked beautiful to me and to capture it how I wanted, my camera needed to be in macro mode.  Because of that, I don''t think I could have had a deeper DOF, although if I''m wrong, please correct me.  Anyway, I had fun with this one and it was cool to see all of the positive things people said about my photo.', '2002-05-06 19:23:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55760, 1306, 656, '<td valign="top">could have something here, with all the strong converging lines on the wood.  Not sure this really brings it out though.  Plants/ upper half is too overexposed.</td>', 'could have something here, with all the strong converging lines on the wood.  Not sure this really brings it out though.  Plants/ upper half is too overexposed.', '2002-04-29 09:53:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55761, 1306, 142, '<td valign="top">I like the title as well as the photo.</td>', 'I like the title as well as the photo.', '2002-04-29 10:41:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55762, 1306, 156, '<td valign="top">doesn''t appear to my eye to be from the ground up</td>', 'doesn''t appear to my eye to be from the ground up', '2002-04-29 11:42:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55763, 1306, 714, '<td valign="top">It seems so bright.  I can''t distinguish the flowers form the background.  Maybe if you would have taken it at a different time of day.</td>', 'It seems so bright.  I can''t distinguish the flowers form the background.  Maybe if you would have taken it at a different time of day.', '2002-04-29 13:20:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55764, 1306, 544, '<td valign="top">I gave this photo an average score. It wasn''t bad, but it has more potential in there to be better. For example, the wood for the bridge or whatnot doesn''t really have any richness or texture to it. The trees overhead seem kind of washed out a bit, perhaps by the sun or the lack of detailed separation with the whitish flowers. I think the focus of the picture is the hanging white flower, and I feel that this would have been a stronger picture if you got up close and personal with it. Keeping it off-center is fine, but closer is better. I can''t really make out any detail of the white flower, but if it were there it would have been an incredible picture.</td>', 'I gave this photo an average score. It wasn''t bad, but it has more potential in there to be better. For example, the wood for the bridge or whatnot doesn''t really have any richness or texture to it. The trees overhead seem kind of washed out a bit, perhaps by the sun or the lack of detailed separation with the whitish flowers. I think the focus of the picture is the hanging white flower, and I feel that this would have been a stronger picture if you got up close and personal with it. Keeping it off-center is fine, but closer is better. I can''t really make out any detail of the white flower, but if it were there it would have been an incredible picture.', '2002-04-29 13:30:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55765, 1306, 885, '<td valign="top">the white flowers look a little bit overexposed - it''s a contrasty scene since it must have been a lot lighter above than below the trellis.</td>', 'the white flowers look a little bit overexposed - it''s a contrasty scene since it must have been a lot lighter above than below the trellis.', '2002-04-29 14:50:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55766, 1306, 772, '<td valign="top">interesting photograph here... According to your title, the flowers here are the subject of this photo and they are heading down rather than up???  The camera is pointed up though... I think I may understand your interpretation of the challenge but a stronger interpretation or stronger display of this interpretation would interest me much more...</td>', 'interesting photograph here... According to your title, the flowers here are the subject of this photo and they are heading down rather than up???  The camera is pointed up though... I think I may understand your interpretation of the challenge but a stronger interpretation or stronger display of this interpretation would interest me much more...', '2002-04-29 15:15:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(55767, 1306, 962, '<td valign="top">Minimum relationship to the subject.</td>', 'Minimum relationship to the subject.', '2002-04-29 16:51:00.000000', NULL, 1),
