(55779, 1307, 446, '<td valign="top">I like the concept here.  Excellent composition.  I like the natural look of the scene.  You caught a great piece of sky and exposed for it will keeping the tower well exposed.  If you would have focused just beyond the hyperfocal distance to keep the radio in focus you would have had a winner by my eye.  I rated this photo high.  Keep up the good work.</td>', 'I like the concept here.  Excellent composition.  I like the natural look of the scene.  You caught a great piece of sky and exposed for it will keeping the tower well exposed.  If you would have focused just beyond the hyperfocal distance to keep the radio in focus you would have had a winner by my eye.  I rated this photo high.  Keep up the good work.', '2002-04-29 02:00:00.000000', NULL, 1),
