(55806, 1307, 640, '<td valign="top">I love how your eye is drawn  up into the tower. having the phone there is a nice idea but If somehow it could have been smaller I would have liked it better. The sky gives nice, needed color. Good work!</td>', 'I love how your eye is drawn  up into the tower. having the phone there is a nice idea but If somehow it could have been smaller I would have liked it better. The sky gives nice, needed color. Good work!', '2002-05-03 01:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
