(55814, 1307, 811, '<td valign="top">I thought that was a ham radio, but wasn''t completely sure.  Used to be pretty involved, haven''t done much in a couple of years though.  I really liked the picture, too.  The structure really pulls your eyes upward.  Good job-<br/>Karmat (KE4QZK)</td>', 'I thought that was a ham radio, but wasn''t completely sure.  Used to be pretty involved, haven''t done much in a couple of years though.  I really liked the picture, too.  The structure really pulls your eyes upward.  Good job-Karmat (KE4QZK)', '2002-05-06 10:47:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(55815, 1307, 748, '<td valign="top">I appreciate all of the comments.  Popular opinion is that I should not have used the radio.  I took a bunch of shot without the radio, then thought that adding the radio might add interest.  I was wrong.  Thanks to the "hams" that said howdy, de Pete N4BHB</td>', 'I appreciate all of the comments.  Popular opinion is that I should not have used the radio.  I took a bunch of shot without the radio, then thought that adding the radio might add interest.  I was wrong.  Thanks to the "hams" that said howdy, de Pete N4BHB', '2002-05-06 14:27:00.000000', NULL, 0),
