(56143, 1326, 472, '<td valign="top">Remie, you should have seen how many I took with no background but the wall.  Then my brother suggested a big sky.  Well, it was night on the last day (this always happens to me!), so I grabbed the Van Gogh print off the wall and held it above the dummy.  On the wide angle it was hard to fill the frame with it, but I ended up getting a crop that seemed to work ok!</td>', 'Remie, you should have seen how many I took with no background but the wall.  Then my brother suggested a big sky.  Well, it was night on the last day (this always happens to me!), so I grabbed the Van Gogh print off the wall and held it above the dummy.  On the wide angle it was hard to fill the frame with it, but I ended up getting a crop that seemed to work ok!', '2002-05-06 12:12:00.000000', NULL, 0),
