(56158, 1327, 587, '<td valign="top">great shot.</td>', 'great shot.', '2002-04-30 07:52:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56159, 1327, 772, '<td valign="top">I think this is my favorite photo of this challenge.  Allowing this diagonal to show the shower head makes it very obvious to me where this shot is set.  The look on this cat''s face seals this photo up as my only 10 in this challenge.  The shower door is a little out of focus and could have possibly been avoided, but based on what I have seen in this challenge, I''m marking this photo as my favorite by making it the only 10 I give this week.  Nice job!</td>', 'I think this is my favorite photo of this challenge.  Allowing this diagonal to show the shower head makes it very obvious to me where this shot is set.  The look on this cat''s face seals this photo up as my only 10 in this challenge.  The shower door is a little out of focus and could have possibly been avoided, but based on what I have seen in this challenge, I''m marking this photo as my favorite by making it the only 10 I give this week.  Nice job!', '2002-04-30 11:01:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(56160, 1327, 885, '<td valign="top">This really works well.  The disembodied shower head and the door handle give it the context, without adding too many extra lines or color which might make the image too busy and take away from the kitten.  And the expression on the face of the kitten is perfect.</td>', 'This really works well.  The disembodied shower head and the door handle give it the context, without adding too many extra lines or color which might make the image too busy and take away from the kitten.  And the expression on the face of the kitten is perfect.', '2002-04-30 11:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
