(56184, 1327, 1344, '<td valign="top">No I didn''t put her up there.  She likes saying ''hi'' to us when someone''s in the shower.  Jumps up from the sink and then meows until we get her down.  She''s got the guts to get up there but too much of a wuss to jump down!</td>', 'No I didn''t put her up there.  She likes saying ''hi'' to us when someone''s in the shower.  Jumps up from the sink and then meows until we get her down.  She''s got the guts to get up there but too much of a wuss to jump down!', '2002-05-06 01:10:00.000000', NULL, 0),
