(56190, 1328, 1037, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous! This photo has lots to look at - bold lines, contrasting textures, interesting patterns in the windows, distorted reflections. The stone is very tactile, and the composition is awe-inspiring (as all such windows are designed to be).  The lighting seems just right.</td>', 'Gorgeous! This photo has lots to look at - bold lines, contrasting textures, interesting patterns in the windows, distorted reflections. The stone is very tactile, and the composition is awe-inspiring (as all such windows are designed to be).  The lighting seems just right.', '2002-04-29 11:04:00.000000', NULL, 1),
