(56205, 1328, 387, '<td valign="top">Definitely fits the contest.  Nice texture Would have loved to see this in color before you converted it. Is that a smudge on the glass??? Just kidding, very nice shot!</td>', 'Definitely fits the contest.  Nice texture Would have loved to see this in color before you converted it. Is that a smudge on the glass??? Just kidding, very nice shot!', '2002-04-30 20:16:00.000000', NULL, 1),
